<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="toc1">ACT - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">ACT - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">ACT - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">ACT - NUMANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Ibaŋ Yesɔ te kɔmɔ ne shu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Nǝ cɛr muŋ iyi ku ti, Tiyofulɔ, mne ncɛr bɔbɔk ki yiŋ ndi Yesɔ ne kuti anai, ben ki yiŋ ndi ane tsarǝ <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />te gar mkpaŋ keŋ ndi ane baŋu te kɔmɔ ne gbarshu, ndi ane nek anu akɛ nyɛ Izhu Tsetser bǝn abɛ nau ndum abaŋ ndi ne hria ba. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Yesɔ ne tsar aneshir kpa maa ndi ne yik iya, te na bla aneshir abɛ kli tetɛk te di wa ayi tsitsir. Ane tsar tu maa amkpamkpaŋ har bɛr sɔknas, azǝn lɛ ilɛ kɛ kɔb Arik. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Ndi ne yi ndɔ bǝn aba, ne nek ba nken lɛ te di &lt;&lt; kǝr duŋ zhin Urshelima ba, ama izhin bǝ ŋub tǝ ta inek iyiŋ ndi Tetɛɛ amuŋ nɛ kpai anyak, iyiŋ ndi zhin ne wɔ nenu amuŋ. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yɔɔna ne su aneshir ne amashir, ne miŋ kɛ bɛr watsɔb atei su zhin ne Izhu tsetser.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Ndi ne kam anyɛ tuŋ abiŋ, ane rib bu, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, ai mkpaŋ kǝŋe kɛ Utei ta ngɔŋ kɛ Isrela nek bai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />A di ba: &lt;&lt;Izhi mkpaŋa bǝn zhi iki yi na bɛr bai min ba, Tetɛɛ wa ne anyak mkpaŋa ne mgbyamgbyaŋ maa. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Ama izhin tei ta mgbyamgbyaŋ ndi Izhu Tsetser te zǝǝ ne atu amin; izhineba tei du lɛ muŋ ne Urshelima, ben Yahudiya, ben Samariya te kɔmɔ ne tu klɛ yi gɔnmimi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Ndi Yesɔ ne bla amɛ, Izhu Tsetser abaŋu te kɔmɔ ne shu neyi amen, akpa ne ku ndi bane na yigu ba.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Nǝ shur ayi amen te zen tɔ gbarshu ndi azǝn kɔmɔ, ankyak aneshir ayaa aklɛkli anyaŋ ba, ne su kiki klikla. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Abɛ su ki klikla ma adi, &lt;&lt;Izhin aner abɛ Galili&gt;&gt; Adi ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin klɛ tɔ anii ne shu mɔi? Yesɔ waŋ ndi ne baŋu ben abɛ zhin te kɔmɔ ne shu, atei na kam aŋyak ndi zhin ne yik ne baŋu te kɔmɔ ne shumɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne hria Matiya te baŋ mben yi Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Ndi aneshir ne ŋur akam aŋyak Urshelima ndi ne zǝǝ are Igbu iyi Zaitun, iyiŋ ndi iyi gbahir bǝn Urshelima, itsin vǝtsɔb. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Ndi ne nyak, ne yuŋ tuki kɛ sɔŋ mǝne. Abaŋ ndi ane yime ayi ane Biturus, ben Yɔɔna, ben Yakubu, ben Anduru, ben Filibus, ben Tɔma, ben Batɔlɔmi, ben Matiu, ben Yakubu izu Halfa, ben Saminu Zalɔt, ben Yahuza izu Yakubu. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Aneshir abaŋa bɔbɔk mǝne ne susun zhiin ne tuŋ abiŋ te ben Arik, ben ane Mata ben Meryamu iyah maa Yesɔ, ben amunzumene.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Nǝ mkpaŋ yuŋɔ Biturus ne lu aklɛ ne miŋ amunzumɔr abɛ zǝ Arik abaŋ ndi ne yi amkplik azhin ne sɔk yaa (120) <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />fe tedi, &lt;&lt;amunzumɔr, nɛrɛ te Ilɛ kɛ Arik keŋ ndi ne cɛr kɛ bɛ shaga ir keŋ ndi Izhu Tsetser ne bla nenu akɛ Doda netu kɛ Yahuda, waŋ ndi ne yi ne tsar ba ankɔŋ tǝ bɛ vuŋ Yesɔ <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Neyi zhiin ne min mɔrɔ, te ana yine ki yi na nemiŋ kɛ ndum kǝŋe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Ndi ne ta idǝk maa kɛ na ki mimin,Yahuda ne lɛb amkpa; amɔ te akama zhaku antɔzi, ikpa maa ne lakŋar te duŋ alɛlɛ amaa ne ru akur ne abɛm. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Iki yiŋɛ ne duŋ kɔte neshir tawa ne Urshelima ne wɔi, fǝ tǝ zhɔ amkpama ne aŋa mǝne te Akaldama, watɔ ahwaŋ ane azhizhi.)<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />&lt;&lt;Fena,&gt;&gt; Biturus ne di, Ne cɛr amɛ nemin Zabura te di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">&lt;&lt;&lt;Ikɔb maa bǝyi amkpɔk akɔ, inuŋ abɛ ta mben yi ndum maa&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Ndi amɛ, ne rɛ te abɛ hria nuŋ ne min aneshir abaŋa ndi ne yi ben abɛta, nak rɛ mkpaŋ keŋ ndi Ŋgɔŋ amɔr Yesɔ ne yi ben abɛta, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />Nak baŋ rɛ mkpaŋ kɛ Yɔɔna ine su aner, te kɔmɔ ne mkpaŋ keŋ ndi ne baŋ Yesɔ agli adɔmɔ nǝ ti mɔr. Tǝ zhiin ne miŋ kɛ aneshir abaŋ ndi ne zǝ ta ayik ilumaa ne bɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Ankyak akɔ kpob aner ayaa: Yusuu ndi azhɔu te Barsabas, ana zhɔu te Yustus bǝn Matiya. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Fe akɔ ben Arik, tedi, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, Une zhi susun kɛ kɔte ŋɔwa. Nǝmin kɛ aneshir ayaa baŋa tsar ta waŋ ndi une hriau <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />te abɛ baŋ amkpa nǝ du lɛ kɛ Arik ndi Yahuda ne duŋ kɛ te kɔmɔ ne abɛ ndi ne teu anenen,&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Fe akɔ shur ba ankeŋkam, nkǝŋkama kɔ vuŋ Matiya, akɔ blau azhɔk ne min kɛ aneshir awur ane zhiin abɛ gar ishar maa.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Izhu Yi Tsetser ne zǝǝ ne bɛr Pɛntekɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Ndi bɛr sɔk tuŋ ne nyɛ, neyi amkpa azhiin bɔbɔk mǝne. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Ankyak awɔ igu ndi ŋguŋgu rɛ shu te nyɛ shak kɔb keŋ ndi akɔsɔŋɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Akɔ yik laŋ ndi iyi ndi lǝlɛn lu te nyɛ gab sɔɔŋ ba netu. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Bɔbɔk mǝne, Izhu Tsetser ku shak ba, akɔ lɛ ne aŋa kaaŋkaŋ, ndi Izhu Tsetser ne nǝk ba.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Nǝ mkpaŋa Yahudawa anuŋ abɛ rɛ ntuntun yi gɔŋmimi ndi asɔŋ ne Urshelima abaŋ ndi aklu sǝsǝk Arik. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Ndi ne wɔ igumɔ, tǝduŋ abiŋ te kime ne shak ba susun, te kɔte ŋɔwa awɔ ba alɛ ne aŋa amaa. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Ndi ikime ne shak ba susun arib te di: &lt;&lt;Aner abaŋa ba yi aner abɛ Galili kai? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Aye nii tsǝn tǝ ta wɔ kɔte ŋɔwa ne miŋ mɔrɔ awɔlɛ ne aŋaa aye kɔmen? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Tayi ane Patinya, ane Midiya, ben ane Lametiya; abɛ sɔŋ ne Mesopotamiya, Yahudiya ben Kafadɔsiya, Pontɔs ben Asiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Firijiya, ben Bamfiliya, ben Masar, ben gar kɛ Libiya yaŋ Siren; acɛn abɛ rǝ Roma <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />(Yahudawa ben abaŋ ndi ne cɔk aglik bǝn abɛ zǝ lɛ kɛ tanyɛmɛ Yahudawa); Karita, bǝn Larabawa, ta wɔ ba abla kiki ngɔngɔŋ yiŋ ndi Arik nɛ nai ne aŋa amɔr!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Bɔbɔk mǝne ikime ne kpa ba tu ne vuŋ anu, te rib akpa mɛn tedi, &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi anii amei?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Ankyak anuŋ, akɔ mlakba te di, &lt;&lt;Nǝ mli iki rǝrǝ te zen hwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biturus ne Le ne Ber yi Pɛntekɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Ankyak Biturus ne lu akli ne miŋ kǝ amɛ awur anezhiin abaŋa, ne lɛk kɔr tedi: &lt;&lt;Amunzumɔr Yahudawa bǝn aner abɛ Urshelima, shur zhin atɔŋ te wɔ iki ndi M tei mbla zhin. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Aner abaŋa ba hwa ba ndi zhin yik ba me, azizaŋa ayi mkpaŋ kɛ teres kɛ amblimblɛ! <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Duŋ zhin, waŋa ayi lɛ keŋ ndi ine bla shar yi Arik Ijue ne lɛ:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />Arik ne di, &lt;&lt;&lt;Mkpaŋ tei nyɛ klɛtu ndi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">M tei mbwaa aneshir kab Izhu muŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Amunlum ben amunamba atei bla iki yi nyɛ ne ti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Amunanzak atei yik iki yi nyɛ ti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Anunkub atei te rimla.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Agɛn abaŋ ndi azǝm alulum bǝn amba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">M tei mbwa Izhu Tsetser muŋ ne bɛr yi nyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">A tei bla kiki iyi nyɛ ne sak muŋ.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />M tei ntsar kiki ngɔngɔŋ ne shu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">Bǝn ngir ne gɔnmimi kɛ shin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">Azhizhi bǝn ilu, bǝn ntsiŋ ngɔŋ.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />A tei duŋ aririk akam atǝ ibu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">Fe ihwa tei kam te azhizhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">Fe bɛr ngɔŋ iye Arik iteishi nyɛ.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Waŋ ndi ate ben</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">Nǝ sak kɛ Arik atei yik ita zhɔk.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />&lt;&lt;Aner abɛ Isrela, wɔ zhin lɛ kǝŋe: Yesɔ Awɔnǝ Nazara, iner waŋ ndi Arik ne bla zhin tedi iwa ne tanyɛme ben abɔu, ben kiki ngɔngɔŋ ndi ne nai, ben kiki yi vuŋ anu ndi nena, ben iki yik ne ayi ndi Arik ne nai ne aŋɔk amaa, ndi izhineba nǝ zhi. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Yesɔ waŋa ayi Arik wa ne tanyɛmɛ te nek zhin ne wu ne zhi maa bǝn zhin yi susun maa izhin ne kpaanu bǝn aner amimin te kɔru ne nkunkun kɛ gen, te ŋunu ne aŋɔk ayi aner abɛ na zumimiŋ. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Fe Arik ne lɛgu ne kumɔ, te iku bane gliu yir ba. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Doda ne lɛ netu maa te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">&lt;&lt;&lt;Kɔ te mkpaŋ takɛ me yik Arik bene bɛm.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">Ayi ne ŋɔk li muŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">Sǝsǝk kinuŋ ba tei vuŋ me ba.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Ne me, susun muŋ ne klak, fe anu amuŋ atei gbar Arik asak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">Ikpa muŋ maayi itei yik suŋ sik te shur ayi,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Fena bau tei tyak me zhɔk ne bɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">Bau tei duŋ iner ami tsetser abɛ ku te bɔ ba.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Ai wa Une tsar me nkuŋkɔŋ yiŋ ndi M tei vli;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">Utei na duŋ mna nyɛr ne timi.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Biturus adi, &lt;&lt;Amun zumɔr, M tei mbla zhin ne susun zhiin netu ayi ntsǝntsǝm amɔr Doda, ndi ane ku, ne ruu, ibɛ maa iyi bǝn ta har aliŋe. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Fena Doda ayi ine bla shar yi Arik ndi ne zhi te Arik ne kpai anyak tedi, iwa a tei tun nuŋ ne aŋa amaa abaŋ asak ne mben ngɔŋ maa. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Fǝ ndi Doda ne yik amɛ, te nena bla netu ayi lu Almasihu ne bɛ, tedi ba tei duŋu ne min bɛme ba, ikpa maa batei na yik bɔ ba. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Yesɔ waŋa, Arik ne lɛgu ne bɛ bɔbɔk mɔrɔ tani yik amɛ ne ayi amɔr ilɛ mɛ iyi zub. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Ne baŋu te kɔte nyagu ne ŋɔk li kɛ Arik, tena ta mben Tetɛɛ maa ne ikpa nyak yi Izhu Tsetser tena bwa shur iki ndi izhin yige tena wɔi. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Tǝ, Doda bane yuŋ shu ba, ama wa ne tu maa ne di, &lt;&lt;&lt;Arik ne di Ŋgɔŋ amuŋ: &lt;&lt;Zisɔŋ ne ŋɔk li muŋ <verse eid="ACT 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />Se mne nduŋ abɛ kyagu yi abɛyi ki caŋ ne aza mi.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />&lt;&lt;Neme duŋ aneshir abɛ Isrela azhi te di: Arik ne duŋ Yesɔ waŋa, ndi ne kpaŋu ne kuŋkun kɛ gen, ayi wa Ŋgɔŋ tena yi Kristi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Ndi ne wɔ me, ilɛ mɛ ne tur ba ne susun, akɔdi Biturus bǝn nki abɛ tsene maa,&lt;&lt;Amunzumɔr, ta tei na kikini?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Fe Biturus adi ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin bǝ nek asusun amin, te abɛ su zhin, kɔte ŋɔwa ne sak kɛ Yesɔ Kristi, te zuk zhin azhɔk ne zumimin min, atei na nek zhin Izhu Tsetser. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Ikpa nyaga iyi min ben amumun amin ben abaŋ ndi ayi gbagbaŋ abaŋ ndi Ŋgɔŋ Arik amɔr atei zhɔ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Biturus ne ben ba bǝn anuŋ tetǝk, te gbaŋ ba atɔŋ tena nǝk ba lɛ, tedi, &lt;&lt;Izhin bɛ gli atu min igli rumɔ ne gɔnmimi mimin kǝŋe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛme nǝ lɛ maa ne su ba ne bǝn, aneshire idu mǝne ne vuŋ azhin atar.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bine tu yi abɛ zi Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Fe nɛ nǝk mkpaŋ men ben abɛ na ndum tsar amaa te vuŋ abɛ biŋ atu amen, tena gab kili, te ben Arik. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Fe sǝsǝk ku vuŋ kɔte ŋɔwa, kiki yi vuŋ anu tetɛk ne aŋɔk aye abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Bɔbɔk abɛ zǝ Arik neyi amkpa zhiin tena kiki men abiŋ aŋkun azhiin. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Ne vu kiki men alɛb, te gab azɔbɔ ne kpa men ndi iyah yi ŋɔ yime <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />kɔte bɛr tayi akɔmɔ ne akaba ne susun zhin te zen gab kili ne akɔbɔ men, ali kili ne nyɛr ne min kɛ sik susun. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Agbar Arik tena nyɛr ijɔk susun kɛ aneshir. Fe Ŋgɔŋ ne duŋ abaŋ ndi ne tau ate du.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Biturus nena ne aglugluk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Ber nuŋ yiŋɛ Biturus ben Yɔɔna a tsǝne kɔmɔ ne akabaŋkɔŋ ne mkpaŋ kɛ ben Arik, ne mkpaŋ tar kɛ aririk. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Fe Neshir nuŋ ndi ne ŋliu aglugluk ndi ane ben abaŋu anyɛ aŋyak ne anɔkɔŋ akǝŋ ndi azho kɛ te rɛ ŋgɔŋ, anyɛ nyagu te bɛ aben ne aŋɔk abɛ yir miŋ akaba. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Ndi ne yik ane Biturus ben Yɔɔna atei yir akabaŋkɔŋ, akɔ ben ba azɔb. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Biturus ben Yɔɔna a shuru ayi, Biturus adiu te di, &lt;&lt;Tɔ ta!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Fe susun kɛ neshire kam kɔmɔ ben abɛba, ayik tedi atei nek wa ikinuŋ.<verse eid="ACT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Fe Biturus a diu tedi, &lt;&lt;Bam yine izineriya ben azurfa ka, iki ndi m yime neyi ai yi m tei nǝgu. Nǝ sak kɛ Yesɔ Awɔnǝ Nazara, lu tsin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Fe Biturus akɔ vuŋu ne ŋɔk kɛ li maa, te alǝgu aŋyak adidik, Ne amkpamkpama aza maa ben ayi mbwak amaa akɔ klik. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Akɔ atuk alu aklɛ adidik te kɔ tsǝn. Fe akɔ zǝ ba akɔmɔ te yir miŋ akabaŋkɔŋ ŋɔ, atsin te atuk adɔ te agbar Arik asak. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Aneshir bɔbɔk ne yigu atsǝne tsǝn te zen gbar Arik asak, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Ne tɔu azhi ndi ner waŋ ndi ane ben asɔŋ ne anɔkɔŋ goŋ ake akabaŋkɔŋ te zen ben ne anɔkɔŋ akabaŋkɔŋ ndi azho kɛ te rɛ ŋgɔŋ, fe iki me ku shak ba susun ben vuŋ anu ndi iki yiŋɛ nena ma.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biturus ne lɛ ben Aneshir ne Akabaŋkɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Ndi ner ne bene avuŋ ane Biturus ben Yɔɔna agli, aneshire ne shur klu te nyɛ bǝn a bɛba ne amkpa ndi azhɔu te Mme didik iyi Solɔmɔn te zen vuŋ anu. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Ndi Biturus ne yik amɛ, akɔ adi ba: &lt;&lt;Izhin aner abɛ Isrela, aye anii duŋ zhin vuŋ anu ne ki yiŋɛi? Izhin shur ta ayi aye nii ndi ayi mgbyamgbyaŋ mɔr kɔ tsetser mɔr kɛ ne duŋ iner waŋa alu atsǝn? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Arik ayou Ibrai, ben Ishaku, ben Yakubu, Arik ayou atsintsim amɔr, wa ne lɛk ivǝn maa Yesɔ. Izhin ne kamu nek te bɛ aŋunu, te na kyagu ne yi ayi Bilatus, ndi ne nyak susun kɛ zhaku. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Izhineba ne kyak iner ne yi tsetser, iwaŋ ndi ayi iner didik te ben te di abɛ zhɔk zhin ner ne na zumimin nnɛ ŋlɔk aneshir. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Izhin ne ŋun waŋ ndi anǝk vli, amaa Arik ne lǝgu ne bɛ i. Taba ne yik te tanyɛme ne me. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Nǝ itanyɛme ne sak kɛ Yesɔ, iner waŋa ndi izhin yigu izhin ne na zhiu ne ta mgbyamgbyaŋ ma. Ayi isak kɛ Yesɔ ben tanyɛme ndi ne ru rɛ ben abɔu ndi ne duŋ ner waŋa ne rɛ, ndi zhin yik.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />&lt;&lt;Azizaŋ, amunzumɔr, mǝne nzhi ayi yaŋ zhi yi ne duŋ zhin ne na me, ndi angɔŋgɔŋ amin ne na ma. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Fe waŋ ayi ki ndi Arik ne duŋ lɛ kɛ bla ma bǝ shaga ndi ne bla kɛ ne anu kɛ abɛ shar ama bɔbɔk, tedi kristi atai yik yaa. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Amɛ duŋ zhin kiki mimin, te kam nyak zhin ben Arik, te duŋu abɛ yis kiki mimin min agli adɛ me, Arik ne tu ma atai nek zhin isik susun, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />A tei shar zhin nnɛ zuk ta shur,waŋ ndi ne aŋyak zhin newu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Yesɔ iwaŋ ndi ayi ne shu gar yir mkpaŋ ndi Arik atei kam kiki aŋyaga, ir keŋ ndi ane di wa atei na ben abɛ na ndum ama abɛ yi tsetser nak rǝ asese. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Musa ne di, &lt;&lt;Arik ami ŋgɔŋ atei lɛk zhin ne bla shar ndi nga; izhin tei nak shir atɔŋ te wɔ kɔ ate ni ndi atei bla zhin. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Iwaŋ ndi bate wɔu ba atei tunu agli adɛ me ne min kɛ aneshir ama.<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Anenen, bɔbɔk baŋ rǝ ben ne bla lɛ kɛ Arik Samula, te kam kɔmɔ ben abaŋ ndi ne lɛ, ne nak alɛ ne atu ayi ibɛr yiŋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Fe izhin aba ayi alǝla abɛ bla ishar ben abaŋ ndi Arik ne she atetɛ men ben atsintsim amin arim, ane di Ibrai tedi, &lt;M tei nek aneshir abɛ goŋ mimi anu adidik ne tɔ yi nga mi.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Ndi Arik ne lɛk vǝn ma, ne men asharu ben abɛ zhin te abɛ nek zhin anu adidik te kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ duŋ na zumimin ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Biturus ben Yɔɔna ne tii kɛ abɛ te ambuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Ane Biturus bǝn Yɔɔna ayi ne min kɛ lɛ bǝn aneshir fe abɛ na ndum kǝ Arik anuŋ bǝn abɛ blɛ akabakɔŋ bǝn aner abɛ Sadukiyawa akɔ nyɛ bǝn aba. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Asusun amene acɔk ala ndi abɛ shar abɛ Yesɔ azǝn tsar aneshir tena bla ba ilɛ kǝ lu Yesɔ ne bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Fe ne vuŋ Biturus ben Yɔɔna, ne kab amgbalu, te shur ba ne jaru aŋub bɛr ŋan. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Aner tetɛk ndi ne wɔ ilɛmɛ ne nek asusun amen, idu mǝne neyi aneshir azhin atuŋ.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Ndi iber ne ŋan atɔtum, ben anǝŋkub ben abɛ tsar lɛ kɛ atɔra ne biŋ ne Urshelima. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Anas ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik, bǝn kayafa, bǝn Yɔɔna, bǝn Iskandari, bǝn abaŋ ndi ayi ŋa kɔb kɛ ine na ndum Arik ge. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Ne zhɔ Biturus ben Yɔɔna ne atsutsu amen, te rib ba tedi: &lt;&lt;Izhin ne na kiyiŋɛ ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ ŋɔɔ, kɔka ne sak kɛ ŋɔi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Fe ndi Izhu Tsetser ne shak Biturus, a diba tedi: &lt;&lt;Izhin angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ Gli aneshir bǝ anuŋkub aneshir! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Ate yi ndi zhin tei tǝ ambuk aliŋ netu ayi nerne aglugluk ndi ne nau ki didik te duŋu are, te rib ta te anii ne duŋu are, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Fe, izhin bǝ men zhi, izhineba, ben aner abɛ Isrela: Ayi ne sak kɛ Yesɔ kristi ne Nazara, iwaŋ ndi izhin ne kpaŋu ne kuŋkun kɛ gen, iwaŋ ndi Arik ne duŋu ne lu ne bɛ, netu amaa ineshir waŋa aklikla adidik ne atsutsu amin aliŋ. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yesɔ wa ayi &lt;&lt;mkpaŋ yiŋ ndi izhin abɛ mɛ ne kyagǝ, iyi ne kam tǝ mkpaŋ yi nju ki.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Ita zhɔk inak rɛ bǝn Yesɔ ankyak, isak nuŋ ba na yime ne gɔnmimi bǝn gbarshu keŋ ndi ne nek aneshir ndi iteita aneshir shur&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Fe, ndi ne yik vuŋ susun ane Biturus ben Yɔɔna, nena yik ba ba yi aner abɛzhi ankyak ba, aye aner abɛ iyah, ne vuŋ anu, te tanyɛme ben abɛba, nɛ men ayi ben Yesɔ re kukub. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Fena ndi neyik ineshir waŋ ndi ne duŋu areme a klikli ben abɛba, bane yi ne kiyi di ba. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Ne di ba, abɛ ru ne Akabaŋkɔŋ ŋɔ, akɔ tuŋ abiŋ te lɛ ne akpa. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Te di, &lt;&lt;Ta tei na aneshir abaŋa kikini?&gt;&gt; Ki yiŋɛ aneshir abɛ sɔŋ ne Urshelima, neyik ikiki yi vuŋ anu ne kiyiŋ ndi nenai, ankɔŋ anedi aba tei timu ba yime ba. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Tǝ ta bǝ yara nǝ lɛ kǝŋe tǝ nɛ shak abɛm, tabǝ di ba, abɛ duŋ na lɛ ben inuŋ nǝ sak kɛ Yesɔ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Fe azhɔ Biturus ben Yɔɔna, te vǝ ba, tedi abɛ duŋ na lɛ ben nuŋ, kɔ abena tsar nuŋ ne sak kɛ Yesɔ ba. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Ankyak Biturus bǝn Yɔɔna a tanyɛmɛ bama te di, &lt;&lt;Tɔ atei iyi didik ndi Arik neyik nɛrɛ tǝ ta bɛ zǝ lɛ min kɔ maa, izhin bɛ tɔ. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Atai taba kam, bata yi ne ki naa ba ta tei bla ki yiŋ ndi tane wɔi ben ki yiŋ ndi ayi amɔr neyik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Ndi nena vuŋ ba, ne shur ba bane zhi ir keŋ ndi atai sak ba iya ne ayi aneshir ba. Aneshir azǝn gbar Arik sak ne kiyiŋ ndi ayige. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Iner waŋ ndi nena ki yi sak ŋɔk nenu netu maa te duŋu areme nǝ kam ase sɔknas.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abɛ zǝ Arik ne ben Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Ndi ne shur ane Biturus bǝn Yɔɔna ne akama kɔmɔ ben aneshir amen, te kɔte bla ba ki yiŋ ndi ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik bǝn abɛ anunkub ne bla ba. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Ndi abɛ zǝ Arik ne wɔ me, ne lɛk akɔr amen te ben Arik ne susun zhiin, te di, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ ne Gli shu ben gɔnmimi, ben inǝk ngɔŋ, ben kiki yiŋ ndi yi ne min mǝne. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Waŋa Izhu tsetser, ire anu akɛ ntsǝntsǝm amɔr Doda ivǝnmi tedi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">&lt;&lt;&lt;Anii duŋ aneshir ate mfu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">Anayi aneshir abɛ yaŋ zǝ Arik,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 4:25">Aneshir ana kam na iki yi sha?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Atum abɛ gli gɔnmimi ne kpa kum, abɛ te ambuk ne bine, te zǝn te zɔr bǝn Arik, bǝn Almasihu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Ayi izub Hiridus bǝn Bilatus ne bine ben aneshir abɛ yaŋ zǝ Arik bǝn aneshir abɛ Isrela tetɛɛ zɔr bǝn Yesɔ vǝvǝne mi neyi Tsetser, iwaŋ ndi ne duŋɔ akam ate Almasihu. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Ne biŋ atu te abena kiyiŋ ndi ne kpai netu maa ibǝ te, ne mgbyamgbyaŋ maa ben susun maa. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Azizaŋa Arik, tɔ ikiyiŋ ndi ne akpai aŋyak, te nek igen mi ilɛ kǝ bla tena nǝgu vuŋ susun. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />U nab ŋɔk mi tena aneshir are, ana kiki yi sak aŋɔk nenu ben kiki iyi vuŋ anu, nǝ sak kɛ tsetser kɛ Yesɔ vǝn mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Ndi ne ben Arik, amkpa waŋ ndi aklɛ klimɛ ajaŋ, fe akɔ duŋ izhu tsetser yir ba, akɔ du ilɛ kɛ Arik iyaŋ sisik.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abɛ zǝ Arik ne gab kiki ne akpa mɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Bɔbɔk abɛ zǝ Arik nɛ yi aŋkun azhiin tena nǝk atu ne asusun amen azhiin, ilɛ mǝne nayi zhiin,inuŋ ba adi ikinuŋ iyi maa kiki maa ba se ibǝyi imen bɔbɔk. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Abɛ na ndum Arik ne lɛ ne mgbyamgbyaŋ netu yi lu Yesɔ ne bɛ, ina didik iyi netu mǝne. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Inuŋ bane yaŋ kinuŋ ne min mǝne ba, abɛ huhwaŋ, bǝn akɔb ne vui alɛb te gli azɔbɔ nyɛmɛ <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />ne nyak agene ne ti kɛ abɛ na ndum Arik, ne gab kikime ir keŋ ndi imɔ neshire iyime.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Ayi nemin kɛ na amɛ fe Yusuu, Balawi, ayi awɔnǝ kuburus, ndi ine na ndum kǝ Arik ndi ne zhɔu te Barnaba, (ndi ayi iner ne susun), <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Ne baŋ ahwaŋ amaa alɛb, te gli azɔbɔ anyɛ nyak ne ti kɛ abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tsin.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananiya ben safaratu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Fe ineshir nuŋ ndi azhɔu te Ananiya, ben iwama Safaratu, ne baŋ ahwaŋ amen alɛb. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Nǝ zhi iyi iwa ma, ne su nki azɔbɔ ayir te gli nkime anyɛ nyak ne ti kɛ abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tsin.<verse eid="ACT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Fe Biturus adi Ananiya, &lt;&lt;Uwa Ananiya aye nii te uduŋ shetan ne yir susun mi, te duŋ une timu ne ayi Izhu Tsetser, tena su nki azɔb ayiŋ ndi une lɛb ahwaŋa iyir i? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Ndi une baŋ ahwaŋa lɛb, ba yi ami kai? une lɛb ahwaŋa, azɔbɔ ba ayi ami kai? Ayi anii ne duŋu gli ir susun kǝŋe. Ai, bau nǝ tii ineshir wa imu yiŋɛ ba, ayi Arik wa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ndi ne wɔ ilɛmɛ Ananiya akɔ zhaku te ku, abaŋ ndi ne yime, sisik ngɔŋ ku vuŋ ba. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Amɛ anzak alu te baŋu, te nye ne nǝ nŋa nklu, te baŋu akɔte ruu<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Nǝ baŋ mwɔ mkpaŋ iwa maa ne yir, bane zhi te ikinuŋ nena ba. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Fe Biturus a rib bu, &lt;&lt;Blam zub waŋa ayi azɔb ayiŋ ndi izhin ne lɛb ahwaŋa yi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Fe adi, &lt;&lt;Iye amɛ waŋa ayi azɔbɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Fe Biturus adi, &lt;&lt;Izhin ne kpa anu bǝn ilu mi te zhin bǝ tsar Izhu Tsetser yi Arik? Wɔ akum tsin ne anɔkɔŋ aye abaŋ ndi are amkpa ane ru ilu mi anyɛ, a tei na baŋu ate ru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Ne amkpama, azhaku ne ti kɛ Biturus, te ku, ndi amunanzak nga ne yir, ayugu akɔ kur ikum, a baŋu te ru te kɔte ruu ben lu maa. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Fe sisik ngɔŋ ku vuŋ abǝ zǝ Arik, ben abaŋ ndi wɔ lɛ kɛ kiyiŋ ndi nena.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nena kiki yi vuŋ anu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Ne na ikiki yi vuŋ anu tetɛk nemin aneshir ne aŋɔk abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tsin, bɔbɔk mǝnɛ nǝ susun zhiin ne biŋ ne akpla akǝ Solɔmɔn. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Fena ne miŋ aneshire inuŋ bane vuŋ susun te yir min mǝne ba, neme aneshir azǝn gbar ba. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Abɛ tanyɛmɛ azǝn tǝ du ne ta Arik naŋ yi kukub, aneshir tetɛk amba bǝn alulum. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Nǝ vuŋ ndi avu aner abǝ lɔ anyɛ shur ne ankɔŋ, anuŋ ne atakpa ben agurhwa, atei ndi Biturus agayir, izhu maa be zǝ atu anuŋ. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Aneshir ne zen rɛ ntuntun iyiŋ ndi ne kam Urshelima zǝk azǝn biŋ, te zen gli abǝ lɔ bǝn abaŋ ndi shetan ne yir ba te zǝn sak ba iya, bɔbɔk mǝne nɛrɛ.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne sak abɛ na ndum Arik iyah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik bǝn abɛ zeu, aner abɛ Sadukiyawa akam azǝn te zɔr. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Ne vu abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tsin ashur ne jaru. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Ankyak ne bu ine shar ayou Arik ne nyɛ te bu nkunkɔŋ yi jaru m ɔ te duŋ ba ru tedi. <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />&lt;&lt;kɔmɔ zhin ne akabakɔŋ, te kɔte du aneshir ilɛ kǝ vli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Ndi ne wɔ me, akɔ yir min akabakɔŋ amblimblɛ te zen tsar aneshir.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Ndi ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik, ben abaŋ ndi ayi ben abɔu ne zhɔ abɛ te ambuk, ben angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ Isrela, te shar nǝ jaru abɛ kɔte Gli ba te nyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Ama abɛ blɛ jaru m ɔ ne kɔmɔ, bane yik ba nemiŋ jaru ba, ne kama nyak te nyɛ bla ba te di, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />&lt;&lt;Tani yik ijaru aklekli ku mgbamgbaŋ, abɛ blɛ azǝn blɛ anɔkɔŋɔ, fena tane bu jaru mɔ, ba tane yik inuŋ ne miŋǝ ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Ndi ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik bǝn ngɔŋ ine blɛ Akabakɔŋ awɔ me, kpa men ne sik, bane zhi ka nii te na ba.<verse eid="ACT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Akyak inuŋ anyɛ diba tedi, &lt;&lt;Tɔ zhin aneshir abaŋ ndi zhin ne shur ba ne jaru yuŋ a klikli ne min Akabakɔŋ, te zin tsar aneshir.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Fe angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ blɛ akabaŋkɔŋ ŋɔ akɔ te Gli abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik te ŋyɛ, amaa bane mgbyamgbyaŋ ba, ne te sisik te aneshir atei lu tyak ba ne mkpaŋ ba.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Ndi ne gli ba te ŋyɛ, ne ŋyak ba nǝ ti kɛ abɛ te ambuk, fe ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik arib ba. <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />Te di, &lt;&lt;Tani tsaŋ zhin tedi izhin bɛ duŋ na tsar ne sak kǝŋe ba, amaa zhin ne zi Urshelima bɔbɔk te tsar lɛ me te na wɔb te zhin bǝ yik te di ai taba ne ŋun iner waŋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Ama anǝ Biturus bǝn nki abǝ na ndum maa ne tanyɛmɛ te di: &lt;&lt;Nǝ rɛ tǝ ta bǝ zǝ lɛ kǝ Arik naŋ kɛ neshir! <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Arik ayu atsǝntsǝm amɔr ne lɛk Yesɔ, waŋ ndi zhin ne kpaŋu ne nkpuk tu nkunkun kǝ gen. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Ayi wa Arik ne ŋya gu ne ŋɔk li maa, ngɔŋ bǝn ne ita zhɔk, te bɛ bu Isrela ankɔŋ ne su ŋɔk ne rɛ, te bɛ zuk ba zhɔk ne lalɛ men. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Taba ta ne yik kiki yiŋɛ ne ayi mɔr, izhu yi Arik yi tsetser ndi Arik ne nek abɛ na zi lɛ ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Ndi ne wɔme angɔŋgɔŋ anuŋ abɛ te ambuk, ne te mfu ngɔŋ, te wɔb te aba bɛ ŋlɔk ba. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Ama awɔnǝ Ferisawa nuŋ, azhɔu te Gamaliya, ne zhi icɛr yi Musa, waŋ ndi aneshir a gbaru, a lu kli ne min abɛ te ambuk, tedi abɛ gli aneshir baŋa agli ru abɛm baliŋ. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Ankyak adi angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ te ambuk gɔ tedi, &lt;&lt;Izhineba amunzumɔr abɛ Isrelawa, kiyiŋ ndi izhin wɔb te zhin bɛ na aneshir abaŋa. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Ase yi gayir ineshir nuŋ ne ru, ne zhɔu te Judas, ne baŋ tu maa ndi ayi kinuŋ, aneshir azhin nas ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn abou, ne ŋunu, abɛ zu maa ne se ba var, ne na cɔkla. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Ne gɔŋ ma, ne mkpaŋ kɛ bla aneshir, ne zhɔ nuŋ te Yahuza awɔ ne Galili ne ru, te gbur ntsan aneshir ayaŋ tu maa, ama iwa maayi ne ŋunu. Abɛ zeu ma ne se ba avar. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Neme, azizaŋ, me bla zhin, izhin bɛ te shen ben aner abaŋa, te duŋ ba, a teyi ndi ki na men yiŋɛ ben ndum mǝne iyi kɛ aneshir itei zir. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Ama atei ndi yi kɛ Arik, ba zhin te ya zir kɛ ba, atei duŋ ayik zhin yi abɛ te zɔr bǝn Arik ba. Angɔngɔn aneshir a tanyɛmɛ ne ilɛ kǝ Gamaliya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Ankyak akɔ zǝ lɛ kɛ Gamaliya, te kɔ zhɔ abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tsin, te tsaŋ ba, te di, abɛ duŋ na lɛ te zhɔ isak kɛ Yesɔ, fe te zhɔk ba.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Ankyak, ndi ne lu ne akpa ne te ambuk go, a nyer te yik aba ne mla abɛ sak ba ya ne tu ye sak kɛ Yesɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />kɔte bɛr tayi, ne min akabakɔŋ te vuŋ kɔb, ba ne duŋ tsar lɛ kɛ men ba, tedi Yesɔ wa ayi Almasihu ba.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Hria aneshir ataŋgba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Nǝ iber yi gayir abɛ zǝ Arik ne te du, fe ane Yahudawa abaŋ ndi wɔ aŋa Helɛnawa alɛ ne atu ayi Ibraniyawa abe gab ikiki te di ba nek amba baŋ ndi alulumɔ ne ku kili kɔte ber tayi ba. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Fe abɛ ze Yesɔ tsen amɛ awur ane yaa ma azhɔ aneshir te di ba, &lt;&lt;Bane rɛ te tabǝ duŋ ndum mɔr kɛ du lɛ kɛ Arik, te kam nyak amkpa ne gab kili ba. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Amunzumɔr, ne rɛ izhin bɛ hria aneshir amɛ tangba abɛ yine Izhu tsetser ne miŋ min abaŋ ndi izhin ne tanyɛmɛ ne ba anayi Mgbemgbeb te nek ba ndum kǝŋe <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />taba tabǝ nek tu mɔr te kɔmɔ te ben Arik te du ilɛ kǝ Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Iki yiŋ ndi ne bla aneshir ne tanyɛmɛ bɔbɔk, fe ne hria Istifanus, iner waŋ ndi ne zhi Arik nena yine Izhu Tsetser, bǝn Filibus, bǝn Burokɔras, bǝn Nikanar, bǝn Timan, bǝn Barnaba, bǝn Nikɔlas awɔ ne Antakiya waŋ ndi ne yir Yahudiya. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Waŋa abaŋ ndi abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tsin ne gli ba gar ne ti kɛ abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik. Ndi ne ben Arik ne sak ba ŋɔk.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Ilɛ kɛ Arik zen kɔ ne ti. Abɛ ta lɛ kɛ Arik izen te du ne Urshelima tetɛk, abɛ na ndum kǝ Arik ne te tetɛk ne tanyɛmɛ ne nek tu iye aneshir.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne vuŋ Istifanus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Fena Istifanus, ndi Arik ne negu anu didik tena yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Arik, ne duŋu ne na ikiki yi vuŋ anu ne min aneshir. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Ankyak ine akaba anuŋ ndi azhɔu te (Akaba aner abɛ zuk shur) agɛn abɛ zuk shur anuŋ ne ntuntun ne tuŋ akpa men ne ntuntun te nga aŋa bǝn Istifanus te abla mu ne tu maa; tuno ayi, Libatiya ndi ayi Kuruya bǝn Iskandariya bǝn Asiya, ne te antam bǝn Istifanus te yenu tuk. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Ama aneshire bane kɔgu Itifanus ne lɛ ba te Izhu tsetser iyi ben abɔu.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Fe ne ku ba anu te shɔk aneshir, te di, &lt;&lt;Aba ne wɔu azǝn yen Musa, te zen la sak kɛ Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Fena ne lɛk susun kɛ aneshir bǝn angɔŋgɔŋ, bǝn abɛ tsar Atɔra, fe akɔ te mfu te vuŋu, te gliu te kɔmɔ ben abɛ te ambuk. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Fe ne gli aneshir anuŋ anyɛmɛ te ti mu ashur ba, te di, &lt;&lt;Iner waŋa azǝn lɛ lǝlɛ mimin ne tu yi akaba ne yi tsetser bǝn icɛr yi Musa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Ta ne wɔu a zen di te Yesɔ ayi awɔnǝ Nazara a tei zir amkpa waŋa, te na sen kiki yiŋ ndi Musa ne duŋ ta neyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Abaŋ ndi akɔ sɔŋ ne amkpa ne te ambuk go ashuru ayi, ayik ti maa yi ndi iti kɛ ine shar ayou Arik.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Istifanus ne lɛ bǝn sahindiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Fe, ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik, arib Istifanus tedi, &lt;&lt;ilɛ mɛ yi didik yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Fe Istifanus adi, &lt;&lt;Izhineba amunzumɔr bǝn angɔŋgɔŋ, wɔm zhin, Arik Ngɔŋ ne tsar Ibrai tsǝntsǝm mɔr tu maa ndi ne yi ne Bagadaza, ndi ba ne zǝne sɔŋ ne Haram ba. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Arik Ne diu tedi, &lt;&lt;Lu ne ntun mi, ne min kɛ amunzumin, te kɔmɔ ne ntun yiŋ ndi me tei tsa ru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />&lt;&lt;Fe a lu ne ntun yi Chaldiyawa, te kɔ te sɔŋ ne Haram. Ndi tetɛɛ maa ne ku, Arik ne gliu te nyɛ amkpa waŋ ndi izhin ku sɔŋɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Ama iwa ne tu maa, ba yi ne gadu maa ba kɔ watsɔb. Arik ne nǝgu anu te di iwa atei nǝgu ntuno, iwa bǝn amumun amaa, kɔ ndi ba yi ne vǝvǝn ne mkpaŋa ba. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Ki yiŋ ndi Arik ne blai: &lt;Ne di nga kɛ Ibrai a te yi acɛn ne ntun nuŋ, aner abɛ ntuno ate duŋ ba ayi agɛn a tei sak ba ya har ase amkplik. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />M tei sak ba ya ndi aneshir abe yi agɛn&gt; Arik ne di &lt;me tei gli ba ngli rumɔ te duŋ ba bǝ zekur me ne amkpa waŋa.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Ne nek Ibrai anu akɛ kɔk zik ndi ai ngir kǝ kpa nyak maa, fe Ibrai ne ŋli Ishaku te kɔgu zik ne bɛr yi tander, fe Ishaku ne ŋli Yakubu, fe Yakubu ne ŋli atsintsim mɔr amɛ awur ane yaa.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />&lt;&lt;A tsǝntsǝm mɔr ne kyak yi kɛ Yusuu, te baŋu alɛb, ne gliu te kɔmɔ ne Masar, ankyak Arik ne yi ben abɔu <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />ne gliu a rumɔ ne min kɛ ya, te nǝgu anu didik bǝn Firauna itum ne Masar ne nǝgu gli aneshir abɛ kɔb maa bɔbɔk<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Ankyak ijin ne vuŋ gar kɛ Masar ben Kanana, ben ya mimin atsintsim mɔr ne yaŋ kili. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Ama Yakubu ne wɔ adi ikili iyi ne Masar, ne shar atsǝntsǝm amɔr ne tsin kɛ ku ti. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Nǝ tsin kɛ yaa Yusuu ne gli tu ma agli rumɔ ben amunzumen, Firauna ne na zhi ka Yusuu ayi ŋɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Fe Yusuu ashar bǝn tetɛɛ maa Yakubu abɛ nyɛ, bǝn amunzumen, aneshir sɔk taŋgba ane tuŋ te bɛ nyɛ yigu ne Masar. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Fe Yakubu akɔ kɔmɔ ne Masar, ayi muɔ wa ne ku ben atsintsim mɔr. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Fe ne vu ba te kɔmɔ ne shekem, te shur ba ne bɛ keŋ ndi Ibrai ne lɛb kɛ ne zɔb, ben amumun bɛ Hamɔr ne shekem.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />&lt;&lt;Ankyak ndi mkpaŋ ne te ndi kiyiŋ ndi Arik ne kpa nyak Ibrai, aneshir mi atei te du ne tuŋ yi Masar. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Ne na shur itum nuŋ ne Masar waŋ ndi bane zhi Yusuu ba. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Itum waŋa ne vuŋ aner amɔr, te zin sak atsintsim amɔr ya, azǝn duŋ a tyak amumun mɔr hrie, te abɛ ku.<verse eid="ACT 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />A yi kpaŋa kɛ bla Arik kǝ ne ŋli Musa, vǝvǝne ne rɛ gɔŋ, ne suyir ihwa tar ne kɔb tetɛɛ ma. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Ndi nɛ tyak gu azhɔk ne bɛm, iva Firauna ne baŋu te gliu, ndi vǝvǝn ne ŋli maa. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Fe ne tsar Musa izhi yi Masarawa, ne yi neshir ne klik ne lɛ ben na kiki nuŋ.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />&lt;&lt;Ndi Musa ne tei a se sɔk nas, fe susun maa gliu te kɔmɔ ben amunzumen Isrelawa te di a bɛ gar ben a bɛba. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Ndi ne yik awɔ nǝ Masarawa azǝn sak zumen iya ne ta zume ne, te ŋur awɔ nǝ Masarawa aŋun. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Musa nɛ yik tɛ di amunzumen te zhi tedi Arik atei duŋ ba zhi ayi wa atei taba shur. Ama bane zhi ba. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Ndi bɛr ne ŋan, anuŋ azǝn tsik mgbu, fe ne wɔb te wa bɛ biŋ atu mǝne, a diba, &lt;Aner abaŋa izhin iyi amunwa fa; aye nii duŋ zhin wɔb akla ne kpa min?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Ama iwaŋ ndi awɔb zumen ne klama adi Musa te di, &lt;iŋɔwa ne nǝgu ngɔŋ bene bɛ ta te bɛ te ta ambuk? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Udi uwɔb te ubɛ ŋun me ndi une ŋun awɔnǝ Masarawa alaŋai?&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Ndi ne wɔ lɛ kǝŋe Musa ne klu akɔmɔ ne ntun yi Madayana, te ŋli amumun aya amɔ.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />&lt;&lt;Ankyak, ndi Musa ne te ase sɔk nas, ine shar ayou Arik nuŋ ne ru kliu ne min lu ne awu aye zizik ayi gbahir ne gbu sinei. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Ndi Musa ne yik amɛ, ne vuŋ anu ne ki yiŋ ndi ne yige. Ndi ne tib te wa abɛ tɔ, fe a wɔ kɔr kɛ Arik idi: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />&lt;Ayi nga Arik ayou atsintsim min, Arik ayou Ibrai, ben Ishaku ben Yakubu.&gt; Fe kpa kɛ Musa ku rǝu, bane na vuŋ susun te tɔ ba.<verse eid="ACT 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Fe Arik adiu tedi, &lt;&lt;Kpob akpaza mi, te amkpa ne kli ami awaŋa ayi tsetser. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Mne na yik iya yiŋ ndi aneshir muŋ ne Masar ayige, mǝne yik iya men, mǝne nzi tem ta ba shur, nyɛ azizaŋ tǝm sharu ne Masar.<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />&lt;&lt;Ankyak Musa waŋ ndi ne kyagu ne lɛ maa, tedi &lt;Ŋɔwa ne nugu ngɔŋ bene abɛ ta te bɛ te ta ambuk?&gt; Ayi wa Arik ne sharu abɛ yi ngɔŋ bene abɛba te na taba shur ine shar ayou Arik ne blau ndi ne ru kliu ne zizik. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Ne gli ba agli rumɔ, ne ngɔŋ keŋ ndi ne na ikiki yi vuŋ anu ne ntun yi Masar, ben nek sesen, ben mine ahwaŋ har a se sɔk nas.<verse eid="ACT 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Waŋa ayi Musa waŋ ndi ne di Isrelawa te di, &lt;Arik atai nek zhin ne bla shara maa ne min kɛ amunzumin, ir keŋ ndi ne lɛ ke me.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Ayi wa ayi waŋ ndi ayi ne akaba ane zizik bǝn ine shar ayou Arik ndi ne lɛ bene bɔu ne igbu yi Sinei bǝn atsintsim amɔr, ayi wa ne ta lɛ kɛ vli gli tama.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Ankyak atsintsim mɔr ne kyak zǝ lɛ maa te var kɛ, a susun men ne kama kɔmɔ ne Masar. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Aner Isrela adi Haruna, &lt;Na ta arik anuŋ ndi atei li ti mɔr te Musa waŋ ndi ne gli ta rumɔ ne ntun yi Masar, bata ne zhi ki yiŋ ndi ne vuŋu ba!&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Ne kpaŋa ne lak arik. te tsigu ibaŋ, te nyer ne ki yiŋ ndi aba ne nai ne ŋɔk men. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Ne me ne duŋ Arik ne kam goŋ anǝk ba, ne duŋ ba abɛ zǝ arik ane na ne aŋɔk amen, zekur cinces yi gbarshu, ir keŋ ndi cɛr ne mplɛ kɛ abɛ bla shar yi Arik ne di:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 7:42">&lt;&lt;&lt;Izhin aner bɛ Isrela</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 7:42">Ayi Nga izhin ne tuk me amkpur</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 7:42">Te tsik me ibaŋ yi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 7:42">A ase sɔk nas ne zizik?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Izhin nek arik ne Molɛk ngɔŋ ne ibur ben kpa cinces iyi arik Rafan, akpa yuŋ ndi zhi ne lak ne ŋɔk min te zhin bɛ zǝkuri,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 7:43">Nga M tei gli zhin te kɔmɔ te izhin bǝ yi agɛn ne goŋ Babila.<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />&lt;&lt;Kukub atsintsim mɔr ne yi ne ibur kɛ du lɛ ne zizik, ir keŋ ndi Musa ne di abɛ na kɛ, ir keŋ ndi ne yik kɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Bur kǝŋe atsǝntsǝm amɔr ne takɛ ne mkpaŋ kɛ Joshuwa, ne kpaŋ kɛŋ ndi ne ta tuno bǝn aner baŋ ndi Arik ne yar ba ne tii men, ibur kǝŋe yime har kpaŋ kɛ Doda, <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Waŋ ndi ne yik iki didik te ben Arik, te wɔb te wa bɛ mee Arik you Yakubu ibur. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Ama ne yi Solɔmɔn wa ne yi ne me Arik akabaŋkɔŋ ma.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Ne me, Arik Ŋgɔŋ ba sɔŋ ne kɔb kɛ me neshir ba. ir keŋ ndi Ishaya ine bla shar yi Arik ne di:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />&lt;&lt;&lt;Arik, ne di, igbarshu kɛ yi amkpa ne sɔŋɔ muŋ, Mimi yi amkpa ane sak aza muŋ, izhin te mem ikɔb irtake? Arik arib. Ai mee yi amkpa ane sɔŋ sik amuŋ?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Ba yi aŋɔk amuŋ ben mgbyamgbyaŋ muŋ kɛ me ne na kiki yiŋɛ kai?&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Istifanus adi ba&lt;&lt;Izhin abɛ kyak wɔ lɛ, izhin abɛ kpa susun, abaŋ ndi atɔŋ men ne taraku, kɔte kpaŋ takǝ izhin kyak wɔ izhu yi tsetser, ir keŋ ndi a tsǝntsǝm min ne na! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Ne min kɛ abɛ bla shar yi Arik ayi tawa atsintsim min ba ne sagu ya ka? Ne ŋlɔk abɛ bla shar yi Arik, ndi ne bla ŋyɛ iyi ne tsetser ne ta aneshir shur, waŋ ndi zhin ne zin sagu ya. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Ayi zhine ba ne ta lɛ kǝ icɛr yi Musa bǝn ine shar ayou Arik, ama zhin ne kyak zǝ kɛ ne yak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne ŋun Istifanus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Ndi angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ Yahudawa ne wɔ me, ne te mfu goŋ, te ŋu aŋin, ne tu maa. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Ama Istifanus, izhu yi tsetser ne shak kpama, ne shur ayi ne shu, ne yik ngɔŋ kɛ Arik, ben Yesɔ a klikli ne ŋɔk li kɛ Arik. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Fe Istifanus adi, &lt;&lt;Tɔ zhin, me yik gbarshu klikli bu, me yik Yesɔ aklɛ kli ne ŋɔk li kɛ Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Fe ne ŋur ruru, te ku a tɔŋ men te kamu ku susun zhiin, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Ne gliu te ru goŋ ntun te zin tyagu ne kpaŋ, abaŋ ndi ne yik ne tyak Istifanus bǝn Venenzak nuŋ ndi azhɔu te Shaulu ne klu te nklunklu men.<verse eid="ACT 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Ndi aneshir ne zin tyak Istifanus ne kpaŋ, iwa a zin ben Arik, tedi, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ ta zhu muŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Akyak a tar gbarum ne mimi, te lɛk kɔr, te di, &lt;&lt;Arik duŋ yaŋ ba zumimin yiŋɛ ba.&gt;&gt; Ndi ne bla me fe aku.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Ankyak Shaulu ne yi ne amkpama, te tanyɛmɛ abɛ ŋun Istifanus.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Shaulu ne sak abǝ zǝ Arik iya ngɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Ne bɛrɛ yi ya abɛ zǝ Yesɔ ne Urshelima ne yik iya, ne klu aŋar te kɔmɔ ne Yahudiya ben Samariya, anaga abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tsin ankyak. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Fe aneshir abɛ te sisik Arik aba ne ru Istifanus, ne zhinu ngɔŋ. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Ama Shaulu ne zǝn sak aner abɛ zǝ Arik iya ngɔŋ, a yir akɔ kɔb, te gbur amba bǝn alulum, te vu ba shur nǝ jaru.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filibus ne bla lɛ kɛ Arik ne Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Abaŋ ndi na se ba var ne zin zǝ tuntun te du lɛ didik kɛ men kɔte me. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filibus ne yir miŋ tuŋ yi Samariya te zin bla lɛ kɛ Arik kɛ men. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Ndi ntsan aneshir ne wɔ, te yik ikiki yi vuŋ anu ndi Filibus a zin nai, ne susun zhiin ne shur kpa te wɔ ki yi bla maa. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Abaŋ ndi anerim ne yir ba ne ru te duŋ ba, anerim ne zin ŋur ruru, a bɛ ku kpa gar zhiin ben abɛ kpuk tetɛk ne duŋ ba arɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Aneshir ne zin nyer ne min ntuno goŋ.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saminu ne na kǝka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Neshir nuŋ ndi azhɔu te Saminu waŋ ndi atɔ ne min tuŋ tena nek aneshir abɛ Samariya kǝka. Aŋur asa te di wa ayi kinuŋ, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Aneshir ashur kpa te nǝgu asusun men angɔŋgɔŋ ben amɔtsɔtsɔb a di, &lt;&lt;Iner waŋa mgbyamgbyaŋ ma kǝŋe iyi kɛ Arik waŋ ndi zhɔu te tetɛɛ ngɔŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Ne zeu tǝ nɛ yik kiki yi zin nama, ndi a nek ba ki vuŋ anu ne tu maa. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Ndi ne tanyɛmɛ ne lɛ kɛ men ndi Filibus ne bla kɛ ne tu kɛ kɔb Arik ben sak kɛ Yesɔ Kristi ndi ne su ba ne amashir amba ben alulum. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Tǝ vuŋ Siman ne tu maa ne tanyɛmɛ ne suu ne sak kɛ Arik. Ankyak azǝ te gar kɔte me, ne yik ir keŋ ndi Filibus azen na ikiki yi vuŋ anu.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Ndi abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tsin ndi ayi ne Urshelima ne wɔ Samariyawa ne ta lɛ kɛ Arik nyɛmɛ, akɔ shar ane Biturus bǝn Yɔɔna bǝn a bɛba. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Ndi ne kɔ te yir akɔ ben Arik te abɛ ta Izhu yi tsetser, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />ndi Izhu tsetser bane zen nyɛ ben abɛba ba, ne su ba ne amashir ne isak Ngɔŋ Yesɔ. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Fe ane Biturus ben Yɔɔna akɔ sak ba ŋɔk, akɔ ta izhu yi tsetser.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Ankyak, Saminu akɔ yik asak abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tsin anŋɔk Izhu tsetser hrie ba, te anab azɔb nǝk ba <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />te di, &lt;&lt;Ngama muŋ yi neme zhin mgbyamgbyaŋ kǝŋe, tem te sak kɔte ŋɔwa ŋɔk, bena ta Izhu tsetser.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Ama Biturus ne diu: &lt;&lt;Izhin bɛ naŋ dɔ iwa ben azɔb me, uyik te di alɛb izhi yi nek Arik yiŋɛ ne zɔb! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Ndɔmi ba yi ne ki yiŋɛ ba, susun mi ba yi anenen bǝn Arik ba. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Ne me bǝ su aŋɔk nerɛ te duŋ ki mimin yi na mi, te ben Arik te abɛ zugu zhɔk ne na zumimin yiŋ ndi une nyagǝ ne susun mi. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Te myik susun mi ne cɔkla, ina kpa zumimin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Fe Saminu a tanyɛme tedi, &lt;&lt;Izhin bǝ ben me Arik, te kǝr iki zhiin ne ki yiŋ ndi izhin ne blai bǝ duŋ vuŋ me ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Ndi ane Biturus bǝn Yɔɔna ne zhi a yi lɛ Arik, ne bla kɛ te kama kɔmɔ ne Urshelima, te zen du lɛ kɛ men ne ntuntun yi Samariya tetɛk.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filibus awɔnǝ Habasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Fena ine shar ayou Arik ne di Filibus, &lt;&lt;Lu te kam zǝ ŋɔk li mi, te zǝ ankɔŋ ndi are Urshelima te kɔmɔ ne Gaza.&gt;&gt; Ayi ankɔŋ ane ablubluk. <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Fe alu te kɔmɔ. A yik awɔnǝ Habasha, ayi tetɛɛ, ngɔŋ ne shir ne ntun yi Samariya. Habasha, ayi wa ayi ine nyak azɔbɔ ayi itum amba, ne nyɛ ben Arik ne Urshelima, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Atsǝne kɔmɔ ne kɔb ne nŋa maa, te zen bla lɛ kɛ Arik ne cɛr yi Ishaya ine bla shar yi Arik. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Fe Izhu tsetser idi Filibus, &lt;&lt;Tib nyak ben nŋa waŋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Fe Filibus aklu kɔmɔ bene bɔu, awɔu azǝn bla mplɛ cɛr kɛ Ishaya ine bla shar yi Arik. Aribu, &lt;&lt;U zhi ki yiŋ ndi uzǝn bla mai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Fe adi, &lt;&lt;Ne me? Se nuŋ ne blam&gt;&gt; fe a ben Filibus abɛ ayuŋ sɔŋ ben abɔu.<verse eid="ACT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Waŋa a yi amkpa waŋ ndi a zen bla cɛr ma:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">&lt;&lt;Ne gburu ndi wanta te kɔmɔ ne amkpa ne yak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Ir keŋ ndi vǝn nklu iku anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Ne ŋɔk kɛ ner ne yagu ne ku anu maa bene bɔu.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Nǝ zitu zhɔk maa ne kyak lɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Nŋɔwa a tei bla lɛ maa ne gɔnmimi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Ne ka baŋ vli maa ne gɔŋmimi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Fe ngɔŋ ine bla shar yi Arik waŋ ndi ne yaru ne lɛ arib Filibus, te di, &lt;&lt;Me rib bu, ine bla shar ayou Arik waŋa, alɛ lɛ kɛ ŋɔwai? Itu maa kɔ ikɛ nuŋ ini?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Fe Filibus abu anu te baŋa rɛ ne mplɛ cɛr kǝŋe te bla lɛ kɛ men kɛ Yesɔ.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Ayi ne min kɛ tsin, ayik nkam amashir, ankyak ngɔŋɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Tɔ amashir awaŋ. Aye nii duŋ bau tei sum ne sak kɛ Arik kai?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filibus a di, &lt;&lt;Utǝ tanyɛme ne susun mi zhiin atei suu&gt;&gt; Ngɔŋ a tanyɛme tedi, &lt;&lt;Mne tanyɛme te di Yesɔ Kristi ayi Izu Arik&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Fe adi abɛ duŋ nŋa ma agbur akli, fe yaya mǝne a kɔ yir min amashir, fe Filibus akɔ su ngɔŋɔ ne sak Arik. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Ndi ne ru ne min amashire Izhu tsetser yi Arik ifuk Filibus baŋ tsibɛ, ngɔŋɔ bane na yigu ba, fe a tsin te bene nyɛr. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Ndi Filibus ne yir Azotus, fe ne zǝ ntuntun te zin bla ba lɛ kɛ men, te yir Kaseriya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Kam sen iyi Shaulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Neme Shaulu ayi ne min kɛ te sak abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik iyah, tedi iwa atei ŋlɔk ba. Fe ne gar ben ngɔŋ ne na ndum Arik <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />te benu abɛ cɛr mplɛ a nek wa te wa abɛ gli kɛ te gar akabaŋkɔŋ ayi Damaskɔ, te wa ate yik abɛ zǝ ankɔŋ awaŋa, amba ben alulum, iwa abɛ vu ba ate kpa ne Urshelima. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Ayi nemin kɛ tsin, nɛ dǝk watsɔb te abɛ yir Damaskɔ, ne amkpama ilu laŋ ire shu te hrieu te kamu zǝk. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Fe azhaku, te wɔ kɔr nuŋ idiu tedi, &lt;&lt;Ishaulu, Ishaulu, aye anii duŋu sak me iya i?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Shaulu adi, &lt;&lt;Uyi ŋɔwa Arik&gt;&gt; Fe adi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">&lt;&lt;Ai Nga Yesɔ ndi uzǝn sak me iyah. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />&lt;&lt;Azizaŋa ubǝ lu te yir min tuŋ amɔ M tei blau iki yiŋ ndi utei na&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Ne amkpamkpama abɛ tsin amaa ba nena yi nenu akɛ lɛ ba, ne wɔ kɔr, bane yik ine ilɛmɛ ba. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Fe Shaulu ne lu, te bu ayi ba na yik ba, fe ne vuŋu a Gli te kɔmɔ ne Damaskɔ. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Iber me tar Shaulu ba yik ba, iyaŋ li kɔka abɛ so.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Iner ne zǝ Arik nuŋ ne Damaskɔ, azhɔu te Ananiya. Arik ne lɛ bene bɔu, ne rimla tedi, &lt;&lt;Ananiya!&gt;&gt; atanyeme, &lt;&lt;Nga waŋ, Ngɔŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Fe Arik adiu, &lt;&lt;Lu te kɔmɔ ne ankɔŋ awaŋ ndi zhɔu te are te nab te rib ikɔb kɛ Yahuda, ka awɔnǝ tarsus ayi amɔ, azhɔu te Shaulu, ite yigu a zen ben Arik. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Ne min kɛ rimla ne yik neshir nuŋ, a zhɔu te Hananiya, ne yir te sagu ŋɔk, te abɛ yik abɛm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ama Hananiya ne tanyɛmɛ tedi &lt;&lt;Arik, me ne zen wɔ lɛ ner waŋa ben aneshir tetɛk, ne zumimin yiŋ ndi a sak aner abɛ yi tsetser abɛyi ne Urushelima. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Ankyak ina na ndum Arik ngɔŋ ne nǝgu mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ kpa aneshir abaŋ ndi aben Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Ama Arik ne diu, &lt;&lt;Tsin, uyi ne na ndum amuŋ me ne hriau ne sak muŋ, bene atu tum ben Isrelawa. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />M tei bla iya yiŋ ndi tei yikɛ ne sak muŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Fe Hananiya ne kɔmɔ, te yir kɔbɔ. Te sagu ŋɔk te di. &lt;&lt;Iwa zumɔr Shaulu Arik ne shar me, ayi Yesɔ waŋ ndi ne tsa ru ma ne ankɔŋ waŋ ndi une zeu, te bǝ na kam yik, te izhu yi tsetser bɛ shak kpami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Ne amkpama iki nuŋ iru ne min yi ma ndi fumfuk nfi, fe ne na kama yik. Fe alu te suu ne sak kɛ Arik, <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />fe ali kili, mgbyamgbyaŋ ma ŋur kam</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Shaulu ne Damaskɔ ben Urushelima</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Shaulu ne te muɔ bɛr ben aner bɛ zǝ Arik ne Damaskɔ. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Ne amkpama akɔ vuŋ du lɛ kɛ Yesɔ ne akabaŋkɔŋ mǝne, tedi ai wa ayi Izu Arik. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Abaŋ ndi ne wɔu, ne vuŋ anu, te di, &lt;&lt;Ashe ba waŋa ayi iner waŋ ndi ne se anere abɛ Arik var ne Urushelima kai? Ne nyɛ yaŋa ne susun kɛ vu ba te kɔmɔ ben abɛ na ndum Arik angɔŋgɔŋ te abɛ kpaba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Fe Shaulu ne na lɛ, te lɛk susun kɛ Yahudawa abaŋ ndi ayi ne Damaskɔ, te di, Yesɔ ayi wa ayi Kristi.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Ndi iber watsɔb ne gayir, Yahudawa alɛ bin te aba abɛ ŋunu, <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Ama Shaulu ne wɔ zumimin mǝne, ibu ben aririk a zen blɛ ne nkuŋkɔŋ yi min tun te abɛ ŋunu. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Ama ne min kɛ bu amumun abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik ne baŋu ne sisa a Gli rumɔ ne adampem.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Ndi Shaulu ne yir Urshelima ne wɔb te wa abɛ yir min kɛ a bɛ zǝ Arik, ama ne klu sisik maa, bane tanyɛme ben a bɔu te di ayi ne zǝ Arik ba. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Ama Barnaba ne vuŋ ŋɔk ma te gliu te gar ben abɛ du lɛ kɛ Arik, te bla ba ir keŋ ndi Shaulu ne yik Arik ne ankɔŋ, ben ir keŋ ndi Arik ne lɛ bene bɔu ben ir keŋ ndi ne du lɛ kɛ Arik susun zhiin ne sak kɛ Yesɔ ne Damaskɔ. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Nak baŋ rɛ mkpaŋa ne zhɔk kpa ben abɛba ne Urushelima. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Azǝn du lɛ kɛ Arik susun ma zhiin ne sak kɛ Arik. Ne bene lɛ ben Yahudawa a baŋ ndi awɔ aŋa Helɛnawa te bene gbur kpa ben bɛba. Amaa ne wɔb te aba bɛ ŋunu. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Ndi abɛ zǝ Arik ne zhi me, ne gliu te kɔmɔ ne Kaseriya, te sharu ne Tarsus.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Akyak abɛ zǝ Arik bɔbɔk ne ntun yi Yahudiya, ben yi Galili ben yi Samariya ne sɔŋ keke. Isɔŋɔ ne rɛ goŋ ana kiki men anenen; yaŋ te sisik Izhu yi tsetser yi Arik ilɔk bama, te aneshir ne te tetɛk.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biturus ne lɛk Tabita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Ndi Biturus ne zǝ ntuntun bɔbɔk, ne gar bǝn abɛ zǝ Arik ndi ayi ne Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Ne yik neshir nuŋ amɔ azhɔu te Iniyas, waŋ ndi a kɔ kur ne iki ase tender ne zen ta kǝka. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Fe Biturus a diu tedi, &lt;&lt;Iniyas, Yesɔ Kristi a tei duŋu rɛ. Lu te baŋ iki kur mi:&gt;&gt; Ne kama lu. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Aneshir abɛ Lida, ben a bǝ ntun yi Sarona ne yigu te zǝ Arik.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Ne Yafa iwa nuŋ ne zǝ Arik, azhɔu te, Tabita (Dokas), Iwama a yi iwa didik ana kiki yi rɛ, ana lɔ susun kɛ aneshir te na aneshir kiki didik. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Ne kpaŋa ilɔ ne vuŋu, ne ku. Ndi ne suu, ne baŋu zizhɔk ne ki kɛ shu. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Lida yi gbahir ben Yafa; a shar aneshir amɛ yaa ben abɔu, abɛ benu, &lt;&lt;A bɛ nyɛ ben abɛba kǝr abɛ baŋ kpaŋ ba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Fe Biturus alu te zǝ ba. Ndi ne yir ne gliu te kɔmɔ ne iki kɛ shumɔ. Bɔbɔk amba baŋ ndi alulum amen ne ku ne nyɛ kli anyaŋu, te zhin te tsa ru kluŋklu ben kiki yiŋ ndi Dokas ne nǝk ba ndi ne yi ndɔndɔ.<verse eid="ACT 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Ama Biturus ne di a bɛ ru abɛm bɔbɔk mǝne, ne tar agbarum ne mimi te ben Arik te kama tɔ ikumɔ te di &lt;&lt;Tabita lu.&gt;&gt; Ankyak abu ayi maa, ndi ne yik Biturus alu sɔŋ. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Ne vuŋu ne ŋɔk te lɛgu fe azho amba abɛ yi tsetser abaŋ ndi alulum men ne ku te nek ba ne wu ne vli. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Ne bla ilɛ kǝŋe kɔte me ne Yafa, aneshir tetɛk ne tanyɛme ben Arik. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Biturus ne sɔŋ iber tetɛk ne Yafa ne kɔb kɛ ner nuŋ ndi a zhɔu te Saminu.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Kaniliyu ne aduŋ azho Biturus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Nǝ ntun yi Kaseriya azho ner nuŋ waŋa te Kaniliyu, ayi ngɔŋ neshir ne te ikum ndi ne jiu ne gar kɛ Italiya. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Iwa ben aner abɛ kɔmaa bɔbɔk ne nǝk tu tena klu sǝsǝk Arik; abu ŋɔk ne nek abaŋ ndi ayaŋ ki tena ben Arik iyaŋ mkpaŋ. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Iber nuŋ yiŋɛ ayi ndi mkpaŋa ane yi Kǝrfe tar kɛ aririk, ayik ndi ai rimla. Akɔ yik ine shar ayou Arik, anyɛ bene bɔu tedi, &lt;&lt;Ikaniliyu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Kaniliyu alǝk ayi atɔu ma ne sǝsǝk. &lt;&lt;Aye nii, Ŋgɔŋ?&gt;&gt; arib. Ine shar ayou Arik adiu, &lt;&lt;Iben mi ben ki ndi unǝk abɛ yaŋǝ ma ba yi ŋursuk ba, ne yir ben Arik. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Fe azizaŋa shar aner te duŋ ba gar Jopa te bɛ te Gli ner nuŋ waŋa ndi azhɔu te Simɔn tena zhɔ sak maa te Biturus. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />A sɔŋ ne kɔb kǝ nǝ Simɔn ne na bur, waŋ ndi kɔmaa yaŋ kɔn nek ngɔŋ.<verse eid="ACT 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Ndi ne shar Arik waŋa ne lɛ bene bɔu ne kɔmɔ, Kaniliyu azho agɛn amaa me ayaa ben zhiin ne min kɛ abɛ kpaakpa maa waŋ ndi anǝk tu. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Kaniliyu abla ba kɔte nii ndi nena te shar ba ne Jopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Irimla kɛ Biturus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Ayi aririk ne bɛr iyah ma ne min kɛ tsǝn ndi ne te gbahir ne ntuno, Biturus ne lɔ kɔmɔ ne ki kɛ shu agar ben Arik. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Ikasa lu vuŋ Biturus te wɔb ki li, ndi neka na ki lime, ayik tu maa ne amkpanuŋ. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Ayik ishu ibu fe ikinuŋ mwe ndi abubu ane shur ki azhɔge are shu te zii aŋyak mimi ne ŋguŋgu mei nas. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Abubu mɔ ahru ane narum tetɛk abɛ yi ne aza nas, ben narum abɛ gbur ne mimi ben aŋliŋlɔ abɛ bwak ne shu. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Fena ikɔr blau, &lt;&lt;Lu sɔŋ, Ibiturus. Ŋun te ta.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />&lt;&lt;Bai te ba, Ŋgɔŋ!&gt;&gt; Biturus adiu. &lt;&lt;Bam ne lii kinuŋ amɛ ndi ne ŋlim iyi yaŋ yi tsetser ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Ikɔrɔ na lɛ bene bɔu mkpaŋ kɛ yaa, &lt;&lt;Kǝr ubǝ di uzhɔ ikinuŋ te iyaŋ yi tsetser ba te Arik neka duŋǝ yi tsetser.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Iyiŋɛ nena amkpaŋ amɛ tar, fe andanda iki hru anena ma abaŋǝ te kɔmɔ ne shu.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Ndi Biturus a zen vuŋɔ ne ne ki ndi wa ne yik, aner abɛ shar Kaniliyu awɔb kɔb Simɔn ayik te klɛ ne anɔkɔŋ akɛ kɔbɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Akɔ zhɔ, te rib ka Simɔn waŋ ndi ne jiu ne sak kɛ Biturus a sɔŋ ayaŋa.<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Biturus anaga ri yi ne min kɛ lɛne ne ki ndi wa ne yik, Izhu ye Arik adiu, &lt;&lt;Simɔn, aner amɛ tar awɔbu. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Ndi amɛ zi kɔmɔ ne shin. Duŋ gbaŋ kpa te kyak zǝ ba andanda ba, te ayi Nga mne shar ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Biturus akɔ zi te di anere, &lt;&lt;Ai nga wa izhin wɔb me. Izhin nyɛ na nii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Aneshir adiu Biturus, &lt;&lt;Ta rɛ ben Kaniliyu ner ngɔŋ. Ayi ner didik tena klu sǝsǝk Arik, aneshir abɛ Yahudawa atɔu ashak ayi. Izhu ne shar tsetser ne blau te abɛ zhɔu te ubǝ gar kɔmaa tǝ bɛ wɔ ikiyiŋ ndi utei blau neyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Fe Biturus adi anere abɛ yir kɔmaa te yi acɛn amaa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 10:23">Biturus ne kɔb kɛ Kaniliyu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Ndi bɛr ne ŋan Biturus alɔ zǝ ba, anuŋ nɛrɛ Jopa te zǝ ba menyi. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Iber yi yaa maa ayir Kaseriya. Kaniliyu azǝn tɔ nyɛ mǝne te zhɔ nga kɛ kɔmen ben amkpama abɛ sɔŋ yaŋ akpa. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Ndi Biturus ne yir kɔbɔ, Kaniliyu alɔ klɛ te zǝ kuu anugu ngɔŋ maa. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Fena Biturus aduŋu lu &lt;&lt;Lu klɛ,&gt;&gt; Adiu, &lt;&lt;Myi neshir muŋ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Nǝ min kɛ zen lɛ bene bɔu, Biturus ate yir min kɔbɔ akɔte yik aneshir tetɛk. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />A diba, &lt;&lt;Izhin ne zhi te bla iyi Yahudawa ne yar binetu bǝn iwaŋ ndi ba yi awɔnǝ Yahudawa ba, ka abɛ nyɛ bene bɔu. Fena Arik ne tsar me tedi kǝr me zhɔ neshir nuŋ te ayi tsetser ka bayi tsetser ba. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Fena ne shar me, kǝr me lu ndim lɛk kinuŋ iyi rib ba. M rib zhin aye nii te izhin ne zhɔm?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Kaniliyu adi, &lt;&lt;Iber nas yi gayir Mni yi ne kɔmuŋ te zen ben Arik ne mkpaŋa, ne Kǝrfe tar kɛ aririk. Ankyak iner nuŋ ne su ki klikla aklɛ bene bɛm <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />tedi, &lt;Kaniliyu, Arik ne wɔ ben mi tena shu azhi iki ndi unǝk abɛ yaŋǝ. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Shar te bɛ gar Jopa atei yik Simɔn ndi azhɔu te Biturus. Ayi cen ne kɔb kɛ Biturus ine te abur, ndi asɔŋ ne ŋkɔn nek ngɔŋ.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Fe mku shar andanda, ne rɛ te izhin ne nyɛ. Azizaŋa bɔbɔk amɔrɔ tayi ne ti kɛ Arik te wɔ kɔte nii ndi ngoŋ ne di ubǝ blaa ta.<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Ankyak Biturus akɔ lɛ: &lt;&lt;Azizaŋa mtashi nzhi te ilɛ didik te Arik ba so tu ba <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Ata ner kɔte aŋaa atayi abaŋ ndi aklu sǝsǝk maa tena na ki didik. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Izhin ne zhi nkenlɛ ndi Arik ne shar aner abɛ Isrela, abla lɛ didik ikɛ sik susun ize ben Yesɔ Kristi, waŋ ndi ayi Ngoŋ bɔbɔk. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Izhin ne zhi ki ndi nena ne garke Yahuda, ibaŋ rɛ ntun yi Galili ndi neka su ne amashir ndi Yɔɔna ne bla <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />ndi yiŋɛ Arik ne shur Yesɔ awɔnǝ Nazara Izhu Tsetser bǝn mgbyamgbyaŋ. Nɛ komo kote me, te na didik te na abaŋ ndi kituk ne yir ba te nɛ rɛ, te Arik atsǝn bene bɔu.<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />&lt;&lt;Taniyik kiki iyi na maa ne ntun yi Yahudawa ben Urshelima. Ne ŋun Yesɔ te kpaŋu ne kuŋkun kɛ gen sak, <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Fe Arik ne lɛgu ne ku ne bɛr yi ntar te duŋɔ yigu, iku bane gliu yir ba. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Aneshir bane yigu bɔbɔk ba, fe abɛ yigu ma Arik neka di atei yigu ma ne mǝne hria ba abaŋ ndi tane lii tena so bene bɔu ndi neka lu ne kumɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Arik Ne dita te bla aneshir tena ta nyɛmɛ te ai wa waŋ ndi Arik ne hriau ne te atsitsir ŋas ben abɛ ku. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Aneshir abɛ bla lɛ kɛ Arik bɔbɔk ne zhi ki ne atu amaa te waŋ ndi ate ta nyɛmɛ bene bɔu atei zugo azhɔk netu lalɛ ne sak maa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Ndi Biturus anaga ri yi ne min kɛ ilɛmɛ, Izhu ye Arik akɔ nyɛ ku aner abaŋ ndi ne wɔ ilɛmɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Abɛ zǝ Arik abaŋ ndi ne kɔk ba zǝk ne zǝ Biturus atsǝn te duŋ ba akama yik ki ndi bane taba yigǝ ba, te vuŋ abaŋ ndi ba ne hria ba ba. Izhu ye Arik ne sɔŋ ne atu mǝne. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Tǝ ne wɔ ba alɛ ne aŋa te nyɛr Arik ngɔŋ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">Fe Biturus adi, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />&lt;&lt;Ka neshir nuŋ ai yara te abɛ su ba ne amashirǝ? Ne ta Izhu Arik ndi ta nena tau ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Fe Biturus akɔ duŋ asu ba ne sak kɛ Yesɔ kristi. Fe akɔ ben Biturus abɛ te mwɔ bɛr bene beba.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Biturus ablaa ki ndi wa tei nai ne Urshelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik ben nki amunya ne gar kɛ Yahuda ne wɔ abaŋ ndi ba yi Yahuda ba ne ta lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Fe ndi Biturus ne yuŋ akɔmɔ ne Urshelima, abaŋ ndi ne kɔk ba zǝk apwar Biturus aŋyak <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />tedi, &lt;&lt;Une gar kɔb abaŋ ndi bane kɔk ba zǝk te li ki li bene ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Biturus akɔ lɛ te bla ba kɔte nii ndi nena: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />&lt;&lt;Mne yi ne ntun yi Jopa te zen ben Arik, fe ne min kɛ zen bene, fe ndi rimla ku nyɛm. Mniyik ririk izi re shu ne kpa abubu angɔŋ ne nguŋgu me nas te zi nyɛ anenen ne amkpawaŋ ndi m yime. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Mte ntɔ miŋe myik inarum abɛ aza nas ne gɔŋmimi angɔŋgɔŋ, abɛ gbur ne mimi ben aŋliŋlɔ abɛ shu. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Fena mwɔ kɔr dim, &lt;Lu kli, Biturus ŋun tǝ ta.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />&lt;&lt;Mku ndi, bai te ba, Ŋgɔŋ! Ikinuŋ iyaŋ tsetser ka ba yi tsetser ne taba yir anu amuŋ ba.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />&lt;&lt;Ikɔr tar rɛ shu mkpaŋ kɛ yaa, &lt;Kǝr ubǝ di uzhɔ iki nuŋ te ba yi tsetser ba iyiŋ ndi Arik neka duŋǝ yi tsetser.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Ikime nena amɛ amkpaŋa tar, tɛna kama abaŋǝ kɔmɔ ne shu.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />&lt;&lt;Ayaŋa fe aner atar abaŋ ndi ne shar ba bene bɛm ire Kaseriya ne gar kɔb keŋ ndi Mne sɔŋɔ. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Izhu aye Arik adim kǝr mduŋ gbaŋ kpa ne zǝ ba gar amɔ ba. Abɛ zǝ Arik amɛ tani ne zǝm menyi. Fe tane yir kɔb neshire. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Kaniliyu abla ta ndi wa ne yik ine shar ayou Arik ne muŋ aru ne kɔ maa tedi, &lt;Shar te duŋ abɛ kɔmɔ ne Jopa ben Simɔn waŋ ndi a zhɔu te Biturus. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />A tei gliu ishar ndi iwa ben kɔmi bɔbɔk atei taba shur.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />&lt;&lt;Ndi ne zin ilɛmɛ, izhu tsetser ne nyɛ ne atu amen ndi nena nyɛ ne atu amɔr ne kuti. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Fena mku shuzhi ne iki yiŋ ndi Ŋgɔŋ ne di: &lt;Yɔɔna a su ne amashir, ama atei su zhin ne Izhu tsetser.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Ndi amɛ Arik ne nek abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba iki ndi nɛna nǝk ta, waŋ ndi nɛ tanyɛmɛ ben Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi, ngam nǝ yi ŋɔɔ wa ndi M ga aŋa bǝn Arik?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Ndi ne wɔ amɛ, bane na yi ki bla ba te nyɛr Arik, tedi, &lt;&lt;Fena, Arik ne nǝk ta te vuŋ abaŋ ndi bai ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba abɛ tau ne yaŋ tei ku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akaba ne Antiyok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Ankyak abaŋ ndi ne klu aŋar ne atu nek iyah ndi ne ka ŋun Istifanus ne gar ntun yi Fonisha, sipro, ben Antiyok, a bla Yahudawa kiki men ilɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Fe anuŋ ne min mǝne, ka yɛ ni, aneshir abɛ rɛ Sipro bǝn Sirǝn, agar Antiyok te azǝn lɛ ben Helɛna men yi, adu ba ilɛ didik ne atu ayi Ngoŋ Yesɔ. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Fe ŋɔk kɛ Ŋgɔŋ iyi bǝ ne beba, fena aneshir tetɛk ne tanyɛme te di aba tei kama zǝ Ŋgɔŋ.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Ilɛ didik kǝŋe ne te yir atɔŋ aye aneshire abɛ zǝ Arik ne Urshelima, fe akɔ shar Barnaba ne Antiyok. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Ndi Barnaba ne te yir ne yik neyi amaa iki ndi Arik nenai, ne nyɛr tɛna nek ba nkenlɛ te bɛ klɛ mgbamgbaŋ ne lɛ didik kɛ Ŋgɔŋ ne asusun amen. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Barnaba ayi neshir didik, waŋ ndi Izhu tsetser iyi bene bɔu ben tanyɛme, ankyak aneshir abɛ du ne tanyɛme ne lɛ kɛ Ŋgɔŋɔ.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Ankyak Barnaba a kɔmɔ ne Tarsus agar wɔb Shaulu, <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Fe ndi ne yigu, a gliu te nyak Antiyok. Nǝ min kɛ se mɛ Barnaba bǝn Shaulu ne biŋ te na ndum ne akabaŋkɔŋ te tsar aneshir tetɛk. Abɛ ne ndumo ane kuti azhɔ ba te Krista ne Antiyok.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Nǝ mkpaŋ yuŋɔ abɛ bla na ndum Arik anuŋ ne zi are Urshelima te gar Antiyok. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Izhiin ne miŋ mǝne azhɔu te Agabus, a lu kli ndi izhu ne diu abɛ bla te izhɔŋ ngɔŋ inyɛ itei yir kɔte me ne gar gɔŋmimi kɔ Roma. (Iyiŋɛ nena ne mkpaŋ kɛ nuŋ ndi azhɔu te kladɔs ne Roma.) <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Abɛ tsǝn amaa ben Yesɔ, kɔte ŋɔ ne ki ndi Arik ne nǝgu, ne glii arumɔ te abɛ nek amunya ne Yahuda. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Iyiŋɛ ne nai, te shar ne kime te bɛ nek angɔŋgɔŋ ne aŋɔk ayi Barnaba ben Shaulu ne Urshelima.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Ina Arik ndi Biturus ne ru ne jaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Nǝ yi ndi mkpaŋ yuŋɔ ndi Itum Hiridus ne vu anuŋ abaŋ ndi ayi ne akabaŋkɔŋ, te wa bɛ nek ba iyah. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Ne vuŋ Yakubu, izumen ane Yɔɔna, te ŋunu ne nzi. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Ndi ne yik nerɛ Yahudawa, akɔ vuŋ Biturus maayi. Iyiŋɛ nena ne mkpaŋ kɛ igyaŋ yi ta idaŋ kɛ yaŋ shur mumuŋ atuntu. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Ndi ne duŋɔ vuŋu a zhɔ gu ne jaru, te sagu ne aŋɔk ntǝg nas bene abɛ kpaakpa amɛ nas kɔte ntǝg takɛ. Hiridus ne lɛ nyak ne susun maa te wa atei ka lɔ teu ambuk ndi igyaŋ yi glak te ka gayir.<verse eid="ACT 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Fe ne nyak Biturus ne jaru, ndi amɛ abɛ zǝ Arik azǝn kwɔyi te ben Arik ne atu ayi Biturus.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Nǝ bu ndi Hiridus atei gliu arumɔ tǝ bɛ teu ambuk, Biturus akɔ kurna ne angus abɛ kpaakpa amɛ yaa ne kpau ne tsǝtsaŋ mei yaa fe anuŋ abɛ blɛ ake klɛ ne Jaru m ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Andanda fe ine shar Arik akɔ munoru fe ilu ku laŋ yir min jaru m ɔ. Akɔ ŋur Biturus ne iyi sa te duŋɔ lu. &lt;&lt;Nama, lu klɛ!&gt;&gt; Adi, fena itsǝtsaŋa ku gburkluk var hrie.<verse eid="ACT 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Ankyak ine shar Arik adiu, &lt;&lt;Baŋ anklu ami su tena su akpaza mi.&gt;&gt; Fena Biturus akɔ na ndi ablau ma. &lt;&lt;Gen anklu ami ne kpa te zǝm,&gt;&gt; Nǝ shar ayou Arik ablau. <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Biturus akɔ zeu aru ne mi jaru mɔ, ama ba ne zhi te ki na nǝ shar Arik iyime ba; Ayik ndi iwa yik rimla. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Agara kam ne blɛ ine kuti bǝn ne yaa te nyɛ adɔŋkɔŋ akɛ zɔb ndi kɔmɔ ne min ntun. Iku buu ba ne tu maa, akɔ gar aru. Ndi neka tsǝne te yir gbagbaŋ, ankyak ine shar Arik aduŋ ba.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Ankyak izhu yi Biturus ku nyak anenen fe adi, &lt;&lt;Azizaŋa Mni zhi ne yaŋ te antam te Ŋgɔŋ ne shar ine shar amaa te abɛ glim arumɔ ne ŋɔk kɛ Hiridus ben kɔte nii ndi Yahudawa ne shur atɔŋ te aba bɛ wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Amɛ ndi ki yiŋɛ nena ne atu amaa, a kɔmɔ ne kɔb Meryamu iya maa Yɔɔna ndi ana zhɔu te Markus, amɔ aner tetɛk ne biŋ te zen ben Arik. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Biturus aŋur ankɔŋ ne adɔŋkɔŋ ake abɛm, fe vǝnwa nuŋ ayi gen waŋ ndi azhɔu te Ruda awɔ aŋur ankɔŋ tɛ nyɛ adɔŋkɔŋ ŋɔ. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Ndi ne wɔ kɔr kɛ Biturus azhi, anyɛr te duŋ bu ankɔŋɔ te ŋar kɔr maa, &lt;&lt;Ibiturus aklɛkli ne adɔŋkɔŋ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />&lt;&lt;Ulandar,&gt;&gt; A diu. Ndi ne kyak duŋ blama, akɔ di, &lt;&lt;Atai yi irii maa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Ankyak Biturus ne kyak te zǝn ŋur ankɔŋɔ, ndi ne bu ankɔŋɔ te yigu kɔte ŋɔwa bane na lɛ yir ba. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Biturus alɛ ne ŋɔk te kǝr abɛ bu anu ba te bla ndi Ŋgɔŋ ne gli wa rumɔ ne Jaru. &lt;&lt;Bla zhin Yakubu ben amunya lɛ kǝŋe,&gt;&gt; Ne bla, tena duŋ ba te gar amkpanuŋ.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Ndi bɛr ne ŋen, inuŋ bane di kinuŋ ne min kǝ abɛ kpaa kpama ne atu yi Biturus ba. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Ndi Hiridus ne duŋ azǝbu tena zǝb te wɔb bu fe bane yigu ba, akama zǝb abɛ blɛmɛ tɛ di abɛ ŋlɔk ba.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 12:19">Iku kɛ Hiridus</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Ankyak Hiridus ne kɔmɔ ne Yahuda tena gar Kaseriya te yine sɔŋ amɔ. <verse eid="ACT 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Hiridus azǝn vǝ aneshir abɛ Tiriyan bǝn Sidon; akɔ bine te zeu te wɔb sɔŋ bene bɔu. Ndi yik Blastus ne ku ba goŋ, Iner nuŋ waŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ bene bɔu ayi gen ayou Itum, aribu isɔŋ kɛ sik ne ntuno te shurɔ yi bǝn Itum ndi anekba kili.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Nǝ bɛr nyak mǝne Hiridus, ne su anklu akɛ Itum, te sɔŋ ne mben maa te bla nkan lǝlɛ a shur aneshir. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Aner aŋar akɔr tedi, &lt;&lt;Waŋai kɔr kɛ arik, bai kɛ neshir ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Andanda, ndi Hiridus bane nek Arik Ŋgɔŋ maa ba, ine shar bla lɛ kɛ Ŋgɔŋ aŋuru azhɔk, fe nkis ku liu ŋun.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Fe ilɛ kɛ Arik izen kɔmɔ tena bla kɛ.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Ndi Barnaba ben Shaulu ne klɛ ndum kɛ na mǝne, ne duŋ Urshelima te baŋ Yɔɔna waŋ ndi ana zhɔu te Markus te kɔmɔ ne Antiyok.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Barnaba ben Shaulu ne shar ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Ne akabaŋkɔŋ ne Antiyok aner abɛ tɔ bla lɛ kɛ Arik ben abɛ tsar: Barnaba, Simiyon ndi azhɔu te Ner shishir, Lusio ine Siren, Manem (waŋ ndi ane agben bǝn Hiridus ne Tetrak) bǝn Shaulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Ndi ayi ne min kɛ nek Arik ngɔŋ te na kpaanu, Izhu tsetser adi, &lt;&lt;Na Barnaba ben Shaulu nyak me zhin ne ndum kɛŋ ndim ne zhɔ ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Ndi neka kpaanu te ben Arik, a sak ba aŋɔk te duŋ ba tsǝn.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nǝ Sipro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Ane Barnaba ben Shaulu ne vuŋ igu kɛ kɔmɔ ne tsǝn Izhu Tsetser aye Arik, aduŋ ba azǝ igu te kɔmɔ ne Selusiya ne zǝ amɔ te kɔmɔ ne Sipro. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Ndi Barnaba ben Shaulu ne yir Salami, adu lɛ kɛ Arik ne akaba anǝ kwɔyi ayou Yahudawa. Yɔɔna ayi ne min mǝne te zok bama.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Ne tsǝn ne ntun yi amashir se ndi ne yir ntun yi Pafos. Amɔ ne te yik ine tɔ nuŋ awɔnǝ Yahudawa ine tii mu te wa ayi ine tɔ bla lɛ kɛ Arik ndi a zhɔu te ba Yesɔ, <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Waŋ ndi ayi ikpa maa Prokɔsol, Sagiyus Poulɔs. Iprokɔsol ayi mgbemgbeb ner, ashar azho Barnaba ben Shaulu te adi wai wɔ lɛ kɛ Arik bene beba. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Fena Elimas ine tɔ (waŋai ndi sak maa yime) akyak lɛ mǝne tena te tǝ wa abɛ duŋ Prokɔsol akyak ta lɛ kɛ tanyɛme. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Fena Shaulu, waŋ ndi ana zhɔu te Bulus, Izhu Tsetser aye Arik ne shak susun maa, a lɛk ayi atɔ Elimasa anenen te di, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />&lt;&lt;Uyi zu ne njunju te nayi ne kyak kɔte nii ndi iyi anenen! Iki mimin iyi yaŋ rɛ iyi ne atu ami tena na iyik ayi. Tǝ di bau duŋ wɔb akla ne ki didik ye Ŋgɔŋ kai? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Azizaŋa ŋɔk kɛ Ŋgɔŋ iyi ne atu ami. Utei yi amfik, gar mkpaŋ nuŋ bau tei na yik laŋ ari ba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Andanda Elimas awɔ ikinuŋ bǝn bu ikwɔ ayi amaa, akɔ ŋam, te wɔb nuŋ ndi atei gliu ne ŋɔk. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Ndi Prokɔsol ne yik ki ndi nenai, mtanyeme, ikime ne nǝgu yaŋ lɛ ne tsar lɛ kɛ Ŋgɔŋ.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nǝ Bisidiya Antiyok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Ire Bafos, Bulus ben abɛ tsǝn amaa ne kama zǝ gwu te yar Ferga ne ntun yi Bamfiliya, amɔ Yɔɔna ne duŋ ba te ŋuro kam aŋyak Urshelima. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Ne lu ne Ferga te kɔmɔ ne Bisidiya Antiyok. Nǝ bɛr yi sɔŋ sik ne yir akaba te zǝ sɔŋ. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Ndi ne bla nkenlɛ yi abɛ bla lɛ kɛ Arik, abɛ Gli akaba ma a shar ba ne nkenlɛ, te di, &lt;&lt;Amunya, izhin te yine ki bla neshir, ta ben izhin bǝ lɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Bulus alɔ klɛ adidik te nab ŋɔk tedi: &lt;&lt;Anere abɛ Isrela bene abaŋ ndi ba ayi Isrelawa ba te zǝ Arik, wɔm azhin! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Arik aner abɛ Isrela ne hria atetɛ mɔr; ne duŋ aneshir aŋli ashak du ne mkpaŋ keŋ ndi ne yi ne Masar, ne kiki ngɔngɔŋ iyi na Arik te Gli ba rumɔ ne ntuno, <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Ne vuŋ susun ne yaŋ wɔ mǝne ne ase sɔknas ne ahwaŋ, <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Arik ne zǝr ntun mei taŋgba ne Kanana te baŋ ahwaŋa asak ne aŋɔk aye aneshir amaa te bɛ yi amen. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Iyiŋɛ iyi ndi ne baŋ ba ase sɔkwur me nas ne sɔk tuŋ (450). &lt;&lt;Ndi yiŋɛ ne gayir, Arik ne nek ba abɛ te ambuk baŋ tǝ tar ne mkpaŋ kɛ Samula ine bla lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Ankyak aneshire ne wɔb te bɛ nek ba Itum, fena akɔ nek ba Sɔl izu Kish, ne nga kǝ Banyami, waŋ ndi ne gli Itu mɔ ase sɔknas. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Ndi Arik ne tun Sɔl, ne suu Doda Itu mɔ. Ne ta nyɛmɛ bene bɔu: &lt;Mniyik Doda izu Jese neshir waŋ ndi ne yir miŋ susun; atei na kɔte nii ndi mte ndiu abɛ nai.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />&lt;&lt;Ibaŋ rɛ nga kɛ neshir, Arik ne glii Isrela Yesɔ ine taba zhɔk, ndi ne kpai aŋyak. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Kamin nyɛ Yesɔ, Yɔɔna ne du lɛ tedi te aner abɛ duŋ na ki mimin te bɛ su aner Isrela bɔbɔk. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Ndi Yɔɔna ana ndum maa ayar klɛ, adi; &lt;Izhin ndi ŋgam yi ŋɔwa? Bam yi Iyuŋɔ ba. Ba ye me ba, ama waŋ ndi anyɛ ne goŋ muŋ, waŋ ndi nga bam ne mla ne zuk akpaza amaa ba.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />&lt;&lt;Amunya, amumun abɛ Ibrai, te vuŋ izhineba abɛ klu sǝsǝk Arik ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba, iyi mɔr te lɛ kɛ ta zhɔk ndi ne shara ne kǝ. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Aneshir abɛ Urushelima, ben atum amen bane zhi Yesɔ ba, bane tɔu ashak ayi ba te duŋ ba ne gun lɛ kɛ bla aner abɛ Arik keŋ ndi abla kɛ kɔte bɛr sɔŋ sik iyaŋ sɔŋ sik. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Ne me bane vuŋ kinuŋ yi luk ndi iduŋ aŋunu ba, ne rib Bilatus te abɛ teu ambuk ayi ŋun. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Ndi ne zǝb te wɔb bla yiŋ ndi ne cɛrǝ ne tu amaa bɔbɔk, ne gliu azime ne tu kuŋkun kɛ gen te baŋu azhɔk ne bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Fe Arik ne lɛgu ne kumɔ, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />ne bɛr tetɛk abaŋ ndi ne tsǝn bene bɔu are Galili te gar Urshelima ne yigu. Aye ba ne yik Yesɔ atei ya gli lɛ maa yir ben aneshir.<verse eid="ACT 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />&lt;&lt;Ta bla zhin ilɛ didik: Iki ndi Arik ne kpai aŋyak atetɛ mɔr <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />ne duŋǝ klɛ ne atu amɔr, amumun amene, ndi ne lɛk Yesɔ. Ndi ne cɛr ne ŋa Zabura kɛ yaa:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:33">&lt;&lt;&lt;Uyi zumuŋ; aliŋe miyi Tetɛɛ mi.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Ai ilɛmɛ kɛ ndi Arik ne lɛgu ne ku, batei na ku ba, ne duŋ ilɛmɛ amɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:34">&lt;&lt;&lt;M tei nǝgu tsetser te nzhi anu adidik akɛ kpa nyak iyi kɛ Doda.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Ndi amɛ ne bla kɛ kɔte me: &lt;&lt;&lt;Bau tei duŋ ne tsetser ami abɛ ayik ku ba.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Ndi Doda ane naa Arik ki ndi ne ta nyɛmɛ ne kpaŋ kɛ mben ŋli maa, ne kurna; ane baŋu aru ben atetɛ maa fe kpa maa ne bɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Fena iwaŋ ndi Arik ne lɛgu ne ku ba ne bɔ ba.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />&lt;&lt;Ndi yeme, amunyamɔr, mte ntǝ te zhin bǝ zhi te Yesɔ ne zuk izhu abɛ lalɛ zhɔk ai yi ablaa zhin. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Ize bene bɔu waŋ ndi ate ta nyɛmɛ ne lieru ne nkenlɛ yi Musa. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Izhin bǝ na bwe te kǝr bla ye aner abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik bǝ shaga ne atu amin ba:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />&lt;&lt;&lt;Tɔ, izhin</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:41">Abɛ yir mvlǝ, lɛ nten bǝn naŋ dɔ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:41">Tǝ M tei na kinuŋ ne mkpaŋ min,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:41">Ndi ba zhin tei ta nyɛmɛ, te vuŋ waŋ ndi ate bla zhin.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Ndi Bulus ben Barnaba aduŋ ki kɛ akaba, aneshir azhɔ ba te bɛ na te bla ilɛmɛ ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik yi nyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Ndi ne duŋ aneshire aŋar, Yahudawa tetɛk ben abaŋ ndi ne nǝk tu te ta ize Arik ane Yahudawa azǝ Bulus ben Barnaba, abaŋ ndi ne lɛ bene ba te di ba abɛ tsi klɛ ne lɛ kɛ Arik.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Nǝ bɛr Sɔŋ sik iyi yaa ma aner tetɛk ne bin te wɔ lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Ndi Yahudawa ne yik aneshir tetɛk, akɔ te ankiŋki te bene yen ntuk ne ki ndi Bulus adi.<verse eid="ACT 13:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Ankyak Bulus ben Barnaba adi ba ne yaŋ klu sǝsǝk: &lt;&lt;Ta tei bla lɛ kɛ Arik baliŋ. Ndi izhin ne kyak kɛ te kyak yik atu amin ne mla te zhin bǝ yi ne susun kɛ yaŋ ku, ta kam gar ben abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli Yahudawa ba. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Tǝ waŋai ki ndi Ŋgɔŋ ne di ta:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:47">&lt;&lt;&lt;Mni duŋu bǝ yi laŋ ben abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:47">Yahudawa ba, te ubǝ Gli ta zhɔk</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:47">Mla ne klɛtu ne gɔŋmimi.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Abaŋ ndi bayi ŋli Yahudawa ba ndi ne wɔ me, anyɛr te nek ngɔŋ ne lɛ kɛ Ŋgɔŋ; bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi ne hria ba ne susun kɛ yaŋ ku ne ta nyɛmɛ.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Ilɛ kɛ Ŋgɔŋ ne wɔ kɛ ngɔŋ ne gar yuŋɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Ndi amɛ Yahudawa ne hria amba abɛ klu sǝsǝk Arik ndi atɔ ba shaga yi ben alulum abaŋ ndi awɔ ba ne ntun. Te duŋ ba lɛk iyaŋ sɔŋ kyekye iyi ntun te bɛ nek Bulus ben Barnaba iyah, tena yar ba ne ntuno. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Fe Bulus ben Barnaba akɔ klu mgbumgbuk ye aza men ashur ba te lɔ kɔmɔ ne Ikɔniya. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Ankyak abɛ zǝ Arik ne Antiyok anyɛr tetɛk tena yini Izhu tsetser.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ben Barnaba ne Ikɔniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Nǝ Ikɔniya Bulus ben Barnaba ne gar akaba ane Yahudawa. Ne mwɔ ilɛ mǝne ne yir asusun aneshire te duŋ aner tetɛk Yahudawa ben abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli Yahudawa ba ne ta lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Fena Yahudawa abaŋ ndi ne kyak lɛ kɛ Arik akɔ lɛk asusun aner anuŋ abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba te cɔk asusun amene la ne atu abɛ ta Arik. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Aŋyak Bulus bǝn Barnaba ne baŋ mkpaŋ amɔ, te zen bla lɛ kɛ Ngɔŋ, waŋ ndi ne nǝk ba lɛ maa kɛ ta zhɔk te na nǝk ba klik yi na kiki yi vuŋ anu. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Aneshir abɛ ntuno atu amene agab ntǝk yaa; anuŋ aklɛ ne goŋ kɛ Yahudawa, anuŋ aklɛ ne abɛ na Ŋgɔŋ ndum. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Ne kpaanu abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba ben Yahudawa, ben aŋgɔŋɔŋ amene te ba abɛ nek ba iyah te tyak ba ne mkpaŋ. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Ndi ne wɔ ki na mǝne fe akɔ duŋ ntuno te kɔmɔ ne ntun yi Likɔniya iyi Listira ben Darbɛ ben ntun ngɔngɔŋ nuŋ, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />te zen bla lɛ didik netu akɛ Yesɔ.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nǝ Listira ben Darbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Ne Listira iner nuŋ ne amkpuk aza, aye abɛba ire ŋli maa ba tsǝn ba. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Awɔ Bulus azǝn le. Bulus alǝk ayi atɔu ma, ayigu ne ata nyɛmɛ te wa atei rɛ <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />te azhɔu, &lt;&lt;Lu klɛ adidik!&gt;&gt; Ne mee, ineshire atuk alɔ klɛ adidik te kɔ tsǝn.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Ndi aneshir neyik ki ndi Bulus ne na, akɔ ya atɔŋ ne aŋa Likɔniya, &lt;&lt;Ane arik ne zi anyɛ ben ta ne wu kpa neshir!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Barnaba waŋ ndi azhɔu te zelɔt, ben Bulus ndi ne azhɔu te Hames te wa ayi ne lɛ ŋgɔŋ amene. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Ine na ndum zǝ shetan ndi azhɔu te Zios, waŋ ndi amkpa ane kwɔyi amaa ayi ne goŋ ntun, ne gli alandɔŋ angɔŋgɔŋ bǝn anɔnkɔŋ akɛ ntunoi te iwa bǝn ntsan aneshire adi ba tei tuk ba amkpur.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Fe ndi Barnaba ben Bulus ne wɔ me, agbu kluŋklu iyi kpa mǝne agboŋa te yir min kɛ aneshire, ŋar kɔr: <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />&lt;&lt;Aneshir, izhin na nii amei? Tayi aneshir ankyak mɔr yi, ndi izhineba. Ta gli zhin lɛ didik, te bla zhin te zhin bǝ duŋ na zumimin te ta zhin Arik tsitsir, waŋ ndi nena gbarshu ben gɔŋmimi ben nek ngɔŋ ben ki ndi iyi ne miŋe. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Ikukub, ane duŋ ntun atsintsim men. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Ndi amɛ, bane duŋ tu maa ne yaŋ ki bla ba: Ne nek izhɔk susun ne ku alu irɛ shu bǝn mgbyaŋ ki ne mkpaŋ men; ne nek zhin ki li te duŋ asusun amin anyɛr ŋgɔŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Tǝ vuŋ lɛ kǝŋe, bane duŋ di aba abɛ duŋ tuk ba amkpur ba.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Fe aner abɛ Yahudawa anuŋ ndi are Antiyok ben Ikɔniya ne atɔ mǝne. Ne tyak Bulus ne mkpaŋ te yaru agli rumɔ ne min ntuno, te yik te neka ku. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Fe ndi abɛ na ndum zǝ Yesɔ ne zhɔ gu ne tsutsu, Bulus ne ŋur akam akɔmɔ ne min ntun. Nǝ ŋen bɛr iwa ben Barnaba aduŋ ntuno te kɔmɔ ne Darbɛ.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ben Barnaba ne kama nyak Antiyok ne Siriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Ne bla lɛ didik kɛ Arik ne ntuno te vuŋ asusun aner tetɛk abɛ ta nyɛmɛ ne lɛ kɛ Arik. Fe akama nyak Listira, Ikɔniya ben Antiyok, <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />anǝk abɛ zǝ Yesɔ nkan lǝlɛ tedi abɛ tsi klɛ ne lɛ didik keŋ ndi ne ta nyɛmɛ ne kɛ. &lt;&lt;Ta tei yik iyah teshe yir kɔb Arik,&gt;&gt; aba di. <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Bulus ben Barnaba a hria angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ nek lɛ ne mkpǝmkpa yi akaba, ben te kpaanu, asak ba ne ŋɔk kɛ Ŋgɔŋ, waŋ ndi aba ne nǝgu atu amen. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Ndi ne gen azǝ min ntun yi Bisidiya, ne yir Bamfiliya, <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Fe ndi ne bla ilɛmɛ ne Paga, akɔ zi akɔmɔ ne Ataliya.<verse eid="ACT 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Ne Ataliya ne ŋur akam ayir gwu kɛ gar Antiyok, amɔ wa ne nek atu ne na Arik ne ndum ndi aba neka na kɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Nak yir men nǝ Antakiya, akɔ tuŋ anere abɛ ku ayime amkpa azhiin te bla ba bɔbɔk ki yiŋ ndi Arik ne nai ne atu amene ndi ne bu ankɔŋ bene abaŋ ndi bai ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba te ne ta nyɛmɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Fe ne sɔŋ amɔ te baŋ mkpaŋ ben abɛ tsǝn abɛ Yesɔ.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Isɔŋ bine ne Urshelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Aner anuŋ ne zi are Yahuda agar Antiyok te zǝn tsar amunya: &lt;&lt;Mba zhin te duŋ akɔk zhin zǝk ba, ne bla yi cɛr Musa, ba zhin tei lieru ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Iyiŋɛ ne duŋ Bulus ben Barnaba ne gaaŋa tena te antam bene ba. Fe ne hria Bulus ben Barnaba, ben aner abɛ ta nyɛmɛ ne lɛ kɛ Arik anuŋ abɛ yuŋ agar Urshelima abɛ te yik abɛ na ndum amaa bene angɔŋgɔŋ abaŋ ndi ne hria ba netu lɛ kɛ ribɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Abɛ na ndum ne akaba ma azhɔk ba ne ankɔŋ te duŋ ba ru, ndi ne tsǝn te gara zǝ Folisiya ben Samariya, abla ndi aner abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba ne ta lɛ kɛ Arik. Iyiŋɛ ne duŋ nki amunya ne nyɛr ngɔŋ. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Ndi ne nyɛ Urshelima, aner abɛ akaba amɔ ne taba ben abɛ na ndum maa ben abaŋ ndi ne hria ba, te bla ba kiki ndi Arik ne nai ne aŋɔk amene.<verse eid="ACT 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Fena anuŋ abaŋ ndi ne ta lɛ kɛ Arik ndi aklɛ ne goŋ kɛ ane Ferisawa alɔ kli tedi, &lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi bai ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba se ne kɔgu zǝk baliŋ te na zǝ nkenlɛ yi cɛr Musa baliŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Abɛ na ndum amaa bene abɛ hria amaa ne zǝ sɔŋ ne nkenlɛ iyi ribɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Ndi ne baŋ mkpaŋ ne lɛme, Biturus a lɔ klɛ te lɛ bene ba: &lt;&lt;Amunya, izhin ne zhi te mkpaŋ nuŋ kǝme Arik ne hria ne miŋ kɛ abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba ai ka wɔ nenu amuŋ ishar yilɛ yayas tɛ ka ta nyɛmɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Arik, waŋ ndi ne zhi susun, ne tsar tena ta nyɛ bama te nek ba Izhu tsetser, ndi ne na nek ta mɔr yi. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Bane duŋǝ iyi kaaŋkaŋ ne atu amɔr ben aba ba, ne ŋla asusun amene ne ta nyɛmɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Fe azizaŋa, anii te izhin ten Arik te baŋ hru sak abɛ na ndum amaa ne gbaktɔ ihru keŋ ndi itaba kai atetɛ mɔr ai baŋ kɛ yir? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Bai tǝ ba! Tani ta nyɛmɛ tei na Yesɔ Ŋgɔŋ amɔr te tabǝ lieru ndi aba yime.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Aner abɛ sɔŋ wɔmɔ bane na bu anu ayir ba ndi ne zen wɔ ane Barnaba ben Bulus abla ba iki ngɔŋgɔŋ yi vuŋ anu ndi Arik ne naa baŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba ne aŋɔk amen. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Ndi ne klɛ, Yakubu alɔ klɛ te lɛ: &lt;&lt;Amunya, wɔm azhin. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Siman neka bla ta ki ndi Arik ne kuti atsarǝ ndi ne abaŋ aba ndi bai ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba te abɛ yi amaa. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Ililɛ yi aner abɛ bla lɛ kɛ Arik ne ta nyɛmɛ ne yiŋɛ, ndi ne cɛrǝ:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />&lt;&lt;&lt;Iyiŋɛ te gayir M tei ŋur nkam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">Tǝm na nkam mɛ Doda akaba ndi ne zǝr</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">Mkpǝmkpa yi zǝr M tei mɛi, tena ŋglǝi nyaga,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Te aner abaŋ ndi ne dǝk abɛ wɔb Ŋgɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">Te abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa bɛ zhɔ sak muŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">Ŋgɔŋ ne bla, ai waŋ ndi ana ki yiŋɛ&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Ndi Arik ine zhi ire kukub.<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Yakubu adi &lt;&lt;Ai te ambuk amuŋ, ne mɛ, kǝr tabǝ duŋ kime bǝ yi ne iyah ben abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba ndi ne ta nyɛmɛ ne lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Ndi amɛ tabǝ cɛr ba, te bla ba abɛ te shaan netu kili yiŋ ndi ne glak anerim, te kur bene amba kɔ alulum abɛ aneshir, ben inarum yiŋ ndi bane yak itu maa ba azhizhi bane na ru ba. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Tǝ Musa ne bla kɔte ntun tayi ne mkpaŋ kɛ kuti te bɛ bla kɛ ne akaba ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ Akaba ne cɛr abɛ zǝ Arik ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Ankyak abɛ na ndum maa ben abɛ hria amaa, ibiŋ ben abɛ akaba bɔbɔk, ne di aba tei hria aner anuŋ amene te shar ba ne Antiyok ane Bulus ben Barnaba. Ne hria Yahuda (waŋ ndi azhɔu te Barsabas) bǝn Sila, aner ayaa abaŋ ndi atei yi abɛ gli amunya. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Ne gli mplɛ kɛ cɛr ndi ne shar bama:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">Abɛ na ndum Yesɔ ben abaŋ ndi ne hria bama, amunzumin,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">Abɛbaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba ndi ne ta nyɛmɛ ne ta Arik ndi ayi ne Antiyok, Siriya:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">Mtǝk zhin.<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Tani wɔ te anuŋ nɛ duŋ ta ba ne zhi mɔr ba tɛ zen dam zhin, aduŋ asusun amin ate mfu ne kiki ndi azǝn lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Fe tane ta nyɛmɛ bɔbɔk mɔrɔ te tabǝ hria alulum anuŋ te shar ba bene bɛ zhin ne akpa mɔr Barnaba ben Bulus <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />alulum abaŋ ndi ne nek atu amen ne sak kɛ Ŋgɔŋ amɔr Yesɔ Kristi. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Ndi iye me ta baŋ shar Yahuda ben Sila te abɛ na te wɔ nenu ne ki ndi tane cɛrǝ. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Iyi ndi ire te Izhu Tsetser ben taba mɔryi te kǝr tabǝ tsǝ zhin ne kinuŋ ngɔŋ iyi luk ndi bai wɔb mɔr ba. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Izhin tei kam ti ne kili yiŋ ndi ne glak anerim, ne azhizhi, ben narum ndi ne ka itu maa kyaŋ, ben kur ben amba kɔ alulum abɛ aneshir. Izhin bǝ tsǝ klɛ te duŋ zhin ki yiŋɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:29">Ta duŋ zhin keke<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Aneshir ne duŋ ba te kama zi kɔmɔ ne Antiyok, amɔ ne tuŋ abɛ ku ayi ne akaba abiŋ amkpa zhiin te she nek ba mplɛ kɛ cɛrǝ. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Yahuda ben Sila, abaŋ ndi aba du lɛ kɛ Arik menyi, ne lɛ te nek ba mgbyamgbyaŋ te amunyama abɛ tsi kli ne lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yahuda ben Sila, aba menyi aye aner abɛ na ndum Arik, ne lɛ tetɛk menyi te nek amunya mgbyamgbyaŋ. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Ndi ne baŋ mwɔ mkpaŋ bene ba amɔ, amunya ne zǝk ba te nek ba anu adidik akɛ sɔŋ kɛ sik te abɛ ŋur akam ate yik abaŋ ndi ne shar bama ne ne adidik. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Sila ne yigǝ ne rɛ tǝ wa abɛ sɔŋ amɔ <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Ankyak Bulus ben Barnaba a sɔŋ ne Antiyok, ndi aba ben anuŋ tetɛk ne tsar tena du lɛ kɛ Ŋgɔŋ.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iga aŋa ne yir min kɛ Bulus ben Barnaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Nǝ mkpaŋ nuŋ kǝŋe Bulus adi Barnaba, &lt;&lt;Duŋ tabǝ kɔmɔ te yik amunya bɔbɔk abɛ yi ne ntuntun ndi tane bla ba lɛ kɛ Ŋgɔŋ tena yik ki na mǝne.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Barnaba ne di wa atei gli Yɔɔna, ndi na zhɔu te Markus, bene ba, <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Fe Bulus bane yige ire te abɛ gliu ba, te ne lɔ klu te duŋ ba ne Bamfiliya te kyak ndumo. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Ne nga aŋa ngɔŋ ndi ne duŋ ba gab tsǝn mǝne. Barnaba abaŋ Markus te kɔmɔ ne Sipro, <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />fe Bulus wa ahria Sila te kɔmɔ, ne sak anu amunyama nena iyi Ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Ne zǝ miŋ Siriya ben Silisiya, te nek aneshir lɛ ne mkpǝmkpa iye akaba te bɛ tsi klɛ mgbamgbaŋ.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timoti ne zǝ ane Bulus ben Sila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Bulus ne nyɛ Darbɛ tena gar Listira, ndi ne tsǝn amaa ndi azhɔu te Timoti a sɔŋɔ, iwaŋ ndi Iya maa aye aŋa Yahudawa ne ta lɛ kɛ Arik fe tetɛɛ maa aye awɔnǝ Helɛnawa. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Amunya abɛ zǝ Arik ne Listira ben Ikɔniya ne bla lɛ didik ne atu ayi Timoti. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Bulus ne di wa atei baŋu ine tsǝn amaa, fe ne kɔgu zǝk te ayi awɔnǝ Yahudawa waŋ ndi asɔŋ ne gara, ne zhi te tetɛɛ maa ayi awɔnǝ Helɛnawa. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Ndi ne zǝ ntun-ntun, abla lɛ kɛ sɔŋ ben ki ndi ne nyagǝ ndi abɛ na ndum ben abɛ hria ne di abɛ blai ne Urshelima te aneshir abɛ nek ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Fe mkpǝmkpa yi ku ayi neyik keŋken lǝlɛ mǝne iyi duŋ ba aŋur aklik ne lɛ kɛ ta nyɛmɛ te duŋ abɛ ta ilɛmɛ azǝn shaga.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Irimla kɛ Bulus ne tu yi awɔnǝ Makidɔniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Bulus ben akpaa abɛ tsǝn amaa ne gar azǝ igar kɛ Firijiya ben Galantiya, ndi Izhu Tsetser ne nyak ba te bɛ du ilɛmɛ ne garke Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Ndi ne nyɛ kɔtɔŋ ntun yi Galantiya Misiya, ne na te aba abɛ yir Bitiriya, fe Izhu iyi Yesɔ ba ne ta nyɛmɛ ba. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Ankyak akɔ zǝ Misiya te gar azǝ akɔmɔ ne Taruwasa. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Nǝ bu Bulus ne yik ne rimla keŋ ndi awɔnǝ Makidɔniya aklɛ zen benu, &lt;&lt;Glɔ nyɛ Makidɔniya te zok tama ki.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Ndi Bulus neka yik rim lama, Bata nena sɔŋ ba ta ku kɔmɔ ne Makidɔniya, te ta nyɛmɛ te aye Arik wa azhɔ ta te tabǝ te du ilɛ maa amɔ.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lidiya ne bu anu ata Arik ne Filibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Tane zǝ gwu ne Taruwasa ne tu nek ngɔŋ te kɔmɔ te yir Samutaraki, ndi bɛr ne ŋen tane kɔmɔ ne Niyapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Ire mwɔ tane zǝ Filibi, ntun ngɔŋ ndi ne yi ne tsutsu akɛ Romawa ne ŋakɛ Makidɔniya. Tane te mwɔ bɛr amɔ.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Nǝ bɛr sɔŋ sik tane ru kɔmɔ ne amagɔŋ ntuno ne tuk, ndi tane zhɔk susun te ta tei yik amkpa ane ku ayi. Ta zǝ sɔŋ te ku lɛ bene amba abaŋ ndi aye amɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Izhiin ne min kɛ amba bǝ wɔ tama are ntun yi Tayatira, azhɔu te Lidiya, idub maa aluk kluŋklu ye aŋɔk didik. Aneyi waŋ ndi azɔkuu Arik. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Ndi Lidiya wa ben aner abɛ kɔmaa ne su ba ne amashir, ne zhɔ ta te tabǝ gar kɔmaa. &lt;&lt;atei ndi izhin ne baŋ me tem ne ta nyɛmɛ ne lɛ kɛ Ŋgɔŋ,&gt;&gt; adi, &lt;&lt;Nye zhin te sɔŋ ne kɔmuŋ,&gt;&gt; Ankyak azǝn dam ta.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nǝ shur ane Bulus ben Sila ne jaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Ndi tane yi ne ankɔŋ ane gar bǝn Arik ne Akaba, tane mla kpa bǝn vǝnwa nuŋ ndi ayi izhu yi shetan ne yiru ndi abla tɔ tii. Agli adudunki tetɛk aŋyak kɔb kɛ ngɔŋ amaa ne tɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Ivǝnwa ma azǝ ane Bulus te ŋur ruru &lt;&lt;Alulum abaŋa aye bǝ na ndum Ŋgɔŋ ne Shu Arik, ndi adu lɛ kɛ ankɔŋ ane ta zhɔk&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Ven iwa ma ne baŋ bɛr te zen na me. Nǝ klɛtu Bulus akɔ baŋ afuk te kama nyɛ di ishetan ne min kɛ vǝnwama, &lt;&lt;Nǝ sak kɛ Yesɔ Kristi Mdi ubǝ ru ne kpa kɛ vǝnwama!&gt;&gt; Fe andanda izhu mimi nǝ iku duŋu.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Fe abaŋ ndi ven wa igene aye maa azhi te ankɔŋ ane yik azɔb amene ne klɛ, a vuŋ Bulus ben Sila te gbur ba kɔmɔ ne gar kɛ dub te abe te yik angɔŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Ne Gli ba gar amkpa ne te ambuk te di, &lt;&lt;Aner abaŋa ai Yahudawa, te zen ruk ntuno cɔkla <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />ne nkan lǝlɛ yiŋ ndi ba yi bla mɔr ba te Romawa aba atei ana ndumo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Idu aneshir azhɔk ba ya atɔŋ ne atu aye nii Bulus ben Sila, fe abɛ te ambuk aduŋu gbu ki mǝne aŋa te duŋ atsik ba ne ririk kɛ zɔb. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Ndi neka tsǝk ba ngɔŋ, a tur ba a shur ne Jaru, ine blɛ amkpama adiu te abɛ shurɔ yi mgbamgbaŋ ne Jaru m ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Ndi ne ta ilɛmɛ, ashur ba ne burgi yi luk te shur ba atsitsaŋ ne za.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Nǝ min kɛ atsutsu bu Bulus bǝn Sila azǝn ben Arik tena duk Arik asem, anuŋ abaŋ ndi ne shur ba ne Jaru menyi azǝn wɔ ba. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Ankyak akɔ wɔ zhaŋ mimi ndi ikab tanda kɛ kime ne zhaŋ ngɔŋ. Mkpaŋ zhin bɔbɔk nkuŋkɔŋ yi jaru m ɔ ku bu, fe atsitsaŋa amene ayi kɔte kɛ ŋɔwa rik ahrie. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Ine na ndum ne Jaru m ɔ akam asi, fe ndi ne yik Inɔŋkɔŋ iyi jaru m ɔ ikur bu, akɔ agbaŋ anzi akɛ tiŋ maa atun te wai ŋun tu maa te yik ndi abɛ shur ne jaru m ɔ neka klu. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Ankyak Bulus akɔ ŋar kɔr, &lt;&lt;Duŋ diu la kpami ba! Ta yimɛ bɔbɔk mɔrɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Ine na ndum ne Jaru m ɔ adi abɛ gli wa lu mɔ, aŋur ayir ne mimin ate zhaku ne ti kɛ Bulus ben Sila. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Akɔ gli ba rumɔ te rib abɛ na ndum ne jaru m ɔ, &lt;&lt;Angɔŋgɔŋ, M tei na anii tem lirui?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Ane Bulus ben Sila ablau lɛ kɛ Arik tedi, &lt;&lt;Ta nyɛmɛ ben Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ, teu ka shii lieru iwa ben aner kɔmi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Ankyak akɔ blau ilɛ kɛ Arik ben abaŋ ndi ayi ne kɔ maa. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Nǝ min kɛ atsutsu bu ine na ndum jaru m ɔ agli ba ate ŋlaa ba amkpa mǝne; fe ayaŋa iwa ben aner kɔmaa akɔ su ba. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Nǝ na ndum Jaru m ɔ ne gli ba te kɔmɔ ne kɔmaa te nǝk ba kili; nyɛr ne shak susun maa ndi wa ne ta lɛ kɛ Arik iwa ben aner kɔmaa.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Ndi bɛr ne ŋen, abɛ te ambuk go akɔ shar angɔŋgɔŋ anuŋ te bɛ tedi ne na ndum jaru m ɔ: &lt;&lt;Zuk anere te duŋ ba kɔmɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Nǝ na ndum Jaru m ɔ abla Bulus, &lt;&lt;Abɛ te ambuk ne di abɛ zu gu ben Sila azhɔk. Azizaŋa izhin bǝ kɔmɔ. Tsǝn zhin ne sik susun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Fena Bulus adi abɛ na ndumo; &lt;&lt;Ne tsǝk ta neyi aner tetɛk ne yaŋ tǝ ta ambuk, itaba mɔr yi tayi ŋli kɛ Romawa te vuu ta tuk shur ne Jaru. Fe azizaŋa aba dibai gli ta rumɔ raraŋ ŋǝ? Bai te ba! Duŋ ba nyɛ ne tu men te zǝk ta rumɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Angɔŋgɔŋɔ akɔte bla abɛ te ambuk, ndi ne wɔ te Bulus ben Sila ayi ŋli kɛ Romawa, sǝsǝk ku vuŋ ba. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Akɔ gar ate ben ba te zǝk ba aru are Jaru m ɔ, te ben ba te abɛ duŋ ntuno. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Ndi Bulus ben Sila ne ru ne Jaru m ɔ, ne kɔmɔ ne kɔb kɛ Lidiya, amɔ nɛ te yik nki amunya te nǝk ba lɛ didik. Te kɔmɔ.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ne Tasalɔnika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Ndi Bulus ben abɛ tsǝn amaa ne gar azǝ miŋ Amfiboli bǝn Apolɔniya, ne nyɛ Tasalɔnika, ndi ne yik akaba ane ku ayi ayou Yahudawa. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Ndi ne yiu kiki na maa, Bulus akɔmɔ ne akabaŋkɔŋ ŋɔ, ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik mei tar te zen wɔ ba ne lɛ kɛ Arik, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Abla tena duŋ ba zhi te Mezaya atei yik iyah tena lu ne ku. &lt;&lt;Yesɔ waŋa ngam mbla lɛ zhiin te wau yi Mezaya ma.&gt;&gt; Adi. <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Yahudawa anuŋ ne tsi klɛ te aba abɛ zǝ ane Bulus ben Sila, ne mee aner tetɛk abaŋ ndi aklu sǝsǝk Arik Helɛnawa ben amba nuŋ angɔŋgɔŋ abaŋ ndi atɔ ba shagai.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Fena Yahudawa nuŋ alɔ te ankiŋki, akɔ gyagmu nuŋ te babɛ cɔk ba la ne garke dubɔ, ne aneshir te kɔ lɔk mgbu ne ntuno. Akɔ nama andanda te gar kɔb kɛ Yason te ba wɔb Bulus ben Sila te babɛ baŋ ba sak aneshir ne aŋɔk. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Ndi bane te yik ba ba, akɔ gbaŋ Jason arumɔ ben abɛ zǝ Arik anuŋ ne ti kɛ angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ ntuno, te aya atɔŋ: &lt;&lt;Aner baŋa azǝn shɔk mgbu nyak ne goŋ mimi ne nyɛ ayaŋa, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Fena Yason ata ba aŋyak ne kɔmaa. Bɔbɔk mǝne azǝn cɔk cɛr yi itum ŋgɔŋ ne Roma ndi azhɔu te kaisar ala tedi Itum nuŋ, waŋ ndi azhɔu te Yesɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Fe ndi ne wɔ me, ntsan aneshir ben ntuno ben abaŋ ndi ana ndum ŋas angɔŋgɔŋ aner ne wɔ me fe susun mǝne cɔk la. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Ankyak akɔ ta ŋɔk kɛ Yason ben nki aner fe te duŋ ba kɔmɔ.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ane Bulus ben Sila ne kɔmɔ ne Biriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Ndi ibu ne ka shir, amunya akɔ tur ane Bulus ben Sila te duŋ ba kɔmɔ ne Biriya. Ndi neka te yir amɔ, ne te yir amkpa ane akaba Yahudawa. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Ayaŋa aner abɛ Biriya ba yi ne lǝktu ba ndi abɛ Tasalɔnika, ne ta lɛ kɛ Arik ne nyɛr tena shur ayi te ba abɛzhi ilɛ kɛ Arik kɔte bɛr tayi tena yik ka iki ndi Bulus ablai iyi anenen o. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Yahudawa tetɛk ne ta nyɛmɛ ne lɛ kɛ Arik, ndi angɔŋgɔŋ amba nuŋ abɛ Helɛnawa ben alulum menyi.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Ndi Yahudawa abɛ Tasalɔnika ne wɔ te Bulus azǝn bla lɛ kɛ Arik ne Biriya, akɔ gar amɔ menyi, te kpur aneshir tena shɔk ba. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Amunya akɔ nama ndanda te duŋ Bulus akɔmɔ nenu nek, fe Isila ben Timoti ne sɔŋ ne Biriya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Alulum abaŋ ndi ne zǝk Bulus tena gliu te gar Antina te lɔ duŋ ishar abɛ Gli Sila ben Timoti te bɛ ka yik wa ndi ishara te yik ba ndanda.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ne ntun yi Antina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Ndi Bulus azǝn ŋub nyɛ ane Timoti bǝn Sila ne Antina, isusun maa ne wu shaga ne ntuno te anere azǝ ane arik tetɛk. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Ankyak akɔ ta nyɛmɛ ne akaba amene ben Yahudawa ben Helɛnawa abɛ klu sǝsǝk Arik, bene abaŋ ndi ayi ne garke dub kɔte bɛr tayi ben abaŋ ndi aye amɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Ne mee ntsan aneshire abɛ Abikuriya bǝn Sitɔkiya abɛ yini amkpalaŋ akɔ nga aŋa bene bɔu. Anuŋ ne min mǝne arib, &lt;&lt;Aye nii ne ya atɔŋ waŋa a blai?.&gt;&gt; Anuŋ akɔ di, &lt;&lt;Ayi ndi awɔb tsar izhi arik ayayas.&gt;&gt; Adi amɛ te Bulus azǝn bla lɛ didik netu Yesɔ ben Lu maa ne ku. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Ankyak akɔ baŋu te gliu agar ne igbu yi Arasa, ndi aneshir ne biŋ amɔ, te diu, &lt;&lt;Ka tei zhi tsar yayas iyiŋɛ ndi uglei nyɛmei? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />U gli kiki yayas nyɛ atɔŋ amɔr tǝ ta di tabǝ wɔi ka di kikin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />(Ntun yi Antina ben acɛn abaŋ ndi ne baŋ mkpaŋ te kɔsɔŋ isha yaŋ ki na te zen lɛ lǝlɛ yiŋ ndi aba wɔi ben yayas.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Bulus alu aklɛ ne amkpa anǝ biŋe tedi; &lt;&lt;Izhin aner abɛ Antina! Mniyik te kɔte mee izhin ye abɛ zǝ arik ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Ndi mne ngɔŋri tena ntɔ bwe iki ndi izhin zǝǝ ma, mne na yik itu cɛr. Tɔ arik waŋ ndi bane zhiu ba. Azizaŋa iwaŋ ndi izhin zeu ndi ba zhin ne jiu ba M tei bla zhin lɛ ne atu amaa.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />&lt;&lt;Arik waŋ ndi nɛ na goŋmimi ben kɔte nii ne miŋe ayi Ŋgɔŋ ne shu ben goŋ mimi ba sɔŋ ne akaba ndi ne meu ne aŋɔk ba. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Fe ba na zo gu naki nuŋ iye aŋɔk ba, ndi awɔb kinuŋ, te Iwa ne tuu maa anǝk aneshir susun ben vli ben kɔte nii. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Ibaŋ rɛ ina neshir zhiin, nena ntun yi aner abɛ goŋ mimi, te bɛ Gli bɔbɔk; tena na mkpaŋ kɛ nyak te ben abɛ ane sɔŋ amene anenen. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Arik ne na amɛ te aneshir abɛ wɔb wa ndi ai ka lɔ ŋam wa te yik wa, ndi amɛ ba yi shaan bene be ta ba. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />&lt;&lt;Nǝ min maa taku sɔŋ tena tsǝn tena na ki ndi ta nai.&gt;&gt; Ndi anuŋ abɛ duk asem nkenlɛ adi, &lt;Ta yi abɛ nga ŋli maa,&gt;<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Fena te yi ndi tayi nga ŋli kɛ Arik, kǝr tabǝ yik ndi ngɔŋ kɛ azurfa kai zinariya ka tei yi mkpaŋai zhu iyi na neshir ne ŋɔk maa. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Ikukub Arik ne kyak nyak na ki mimin mɔr, fe azizaŋa ne di aneshir kɔte me abɛ duŋ na ki mimin tena sɔŋ didik. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Arik ne nyak bɛr yiŋ ndi Iwa atei tei goŋmimi ŋas adidik bǝn Ineshir ne hria amaa. Ne tanyɛmɛ ne lɛ kɛ bla maa bene aneshir ndi ne lɛk Yesɔ ne ku.<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Ndi ne wɔ lɛ kɛ kam lu ne ku, anuŋ akɔ lɛ bɛs, fe anuŋ adi, &lt;&lt;Tei na wɔb wɔ ilɛmɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Fena, Bulus aduŋ sɔŋɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Amɔ aner anuŋ ne ta nyɛmɛ te zǝ Bulus te ta lɛ kɛ Arik. Ne min mǝne ai Diyonisiyus, izhiin ne min abɛ biŋe, ben uwa nuŋ ndi azhɔu te Damaris, ben anuŋ amene.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ne kɔrintiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Ndi yiŋɛ ne gayir, Bulus ne duŋ Antina te kɔmɔ ne kɔrintiya. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Amɔ nɛ te yik awɔnǝ Yahudawa nuŋ ndi azhɔu te Akila, are Fontus. Iwaŋ ndi ne tashi are Italiya ben iwa maa Biriskila. Tǝ Kaludiya ane di bɔbɔk Yahudawa abɛ ru te duŋ Roma. Bulus ne gar yik ane Biriskila ben Akila, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />fe ndi Bulus ndum maa ai kpaŋ abur, ne sɔŋ te na ndum bene abɛba te ana ndum zhiin. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />kɔte bɛr Sɔŋ sik tayi a sɔŋ te gaaŋa ne tsar lɛ kɛ Arik ne amkpa ane Akabaŋkɔŋ. Tǝ wa abɛ baŋ tu kɛ abaŋ ndi ai Yahudawa ben Helɛnawa.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Ndi Sila ben Timoti ne nyɛ rɛ Makidɔniya, Bulus akɔ nek tu maa ngɔŋ ne du lɛ kɛ Arik, tedi Yahudawa te Yesɔ wa ayi Kristi me. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Fe ndi Yahudawa ne kyak lɛ kɛ Bulus te yenu, aklu mgbumgbuk anklu maa te diba, &lt;&lt;Azhizhi amin abɛ sɔŋ ne atu amin! Nga aŋɔk amuŋ neka ru ne atu amin. Baŋ rɛ azizaŋa M tei ngar ben abaŋ ndi ba yi Yahudawa ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Fe Bulus aduŋ akabaŋkɔŋ gar anɔŋkɔŋ akɛ yaa ne kɔb kɛ Titus Yustus ine zǝ Arik ndi kɔmaa yaŋ akabaŋkɔŋ. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kirisbus, ngɔŋ ne akabaŋkɔŋ ŋɔ, ben aneshir abɛ kɔmaa bɔbɔk ne bu anu te tanyɛme ben Ngɔŋ; fe anuŋ tetɛk abɛ rɛ kɔrintiya ndi ne wɔ Bulus ne bu anu te tanyɛmɛ ben Ngɔŋ nena vu ba asuu ne sak kɛ Arik.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Iber nuŋ yime ne buu Ngɔŋ ne lɛ ben Bulus ne rimla: &lt;&lt;Duŋ klu sǝsǝk ba; nak du ilɛ mɛ, duŋ ku anu ba. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Tǝm yi bene bɔu, fe inuŋ batei wɔb bu ne mgbu te bɛ nau ikinuŋ ba, tem myi ne aneshir tetɛk ne ntun yiŋɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Ankyak Bulus ne sɔŋ ne kɔrintiya ise zhiin ne hwa tani, a tsar ba ilɛ kɛ Arik.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Ndi Galilio wa ayi ngɔŋ ne ntun yi Akaya, Yahudawa abɛ rɛ kɔrintiya ne bine te abɛ lɛk mgbu ne atu yi Bulus te gliu te gar amkpa ne teu ambuk. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Adi iner waŋa&lt;&lt;Azǝn zǝ aneshir te bɛ zǝ Arik ne ankɔŋ waŋ di ibla mɔr bane tanyɛme ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Neme ndi Bulus atei lɛ, Galilio abla Yahudawa te di, &lt;&lt;Ate yi ndi izhineba Yahudawa! Zǝn lɛ mumur abɛdi ne la ilɛ nuŋ kɔte yen nuŋ, ibǝ yi anenen tem wɔ zhin. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Ndi ne rib ililɛ ben asak ben icɛr min nǝ ka tanyɛme anenen ben irib mine. Bam tei te ambuk ne kiki yiŋɛ ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Akɔ yar ba ne ibur kɛ te ambuk go. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Ankyak idu aneshir akama yuŋɔ sɔŋ Satanisu ine gli ba ne Akabaŋkɔŋ ne anɔkɔŋ kɛ ibur kɛ te ambuk. Fe Galilio bane kama tɔ ba ba.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Prisila, Akila ben Apolɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Bulus ne baŋ mkpaŋ te zen sɔŋ ne kɔrintiya. Fena ne duŋ amunya bǝn amunva te yir igu kɛ gar Suriya, ane Prisila ben Akila ne zeu. Ndi ne atei lu, ne duŋ akɔn fumfuk tu maa ne Kankiriya ne kpaanu ndi ne te. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Ne yir Afisa, amɔ Bulus aduŋ Prisila ben Akila. Iwa ne tu maa ne gar Akabaŋkɔŋ te gaaŋa ben Yahudawa. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Ndi ne wɔb te abɛ te imɔ bɛr bene ba, ne kyak. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Fena ne lu, ndi ne mǝne bla, &lt;&lt;M tei ŋurkam ndi Arik ate tanyɛmɛ.&gt;&gt; Ne me akɔte yir igu te duŋ ba. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Ndi ne te zǝ ne Kaseriya, agara yuŋ akɔmɔ ne Urshelima te tek abaŋ ndi ayi ne Akabaŋkɔŋ te gara zie kɔmɔ ne Antiyok.<verse eid="ACT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Ndi ne te imɔ bɛr ne Antiyok, Bulus a duŋ amɔ te zǝ ntun-ntun yi goŋri ne ŋa kɛ Galantiya ben Firisiya, te nek abɛ zeu tsǝne nkenlɛ iyi duŋ kpa men ŋurklik.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Apolɔ ne du ilɛ kɛ Arik ne Afisa. Ne me ineshir awɔnǝ Yahudawa nuŋ waŋ ndi azhɔu te Apolɔ, aye awonǝ Alikzanda, ne nyɛ Afisa. Nǝ zhi ki, ndi ikinuŋ bayi yayas bene bɔu nǝ lɛ kɛ Arik ba. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Ne tsa ru ne lɛ kɛ Ngɔŋ, tena nǝk tu ne du lɛ tena tsar abɛ ŋub zhi Yesɔ ngɔŋ, ndi amɛ, ne na zhi isu neshir iyi Yɔɔna ankyak. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Apolɔ ne zen du ilɛ kɛ Arik iyaŋ te sǝsǝk ne Akabaŋkɔŋ. Fe Prisila ben Akila ne wɔu, akɔ zhɔu tǝ bɛ gar kɔmen tǝ nɛ du ilɛ kɛ Arik anenen.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Ndi Apolɔ ne di wa atei glɔ kɔmɔ ne Akaya, amunya ne nǝgu lɛ kɛ tsi kli tena cɛr mplɛ anǝk abɛ tsǝne maa te abɛ tɔu. Iyir maa ne yi iki didik bene abaŋ ndi bane zhi Arik ba ne duŋ ba tanyɛmɛ te ta Arik. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Fena ne zen kyak yir min kɛ Yahudawa abɛ zen gaaŋa ma, adu ba anenen ilɛ kɛ Arik te Yesɔ Iwa ayi Kristi me.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ne Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Ndi Apolɔs ne yir kɔrintiya, Bulus ne baŋ ankɔŋ te zǝ ntuntun te kɔmɔ ne Afisa. Ne muɔ ne yik anuŋ abɛ zǝ Yesɔ <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />te rib ba te di, &lt;&lt;Izhin neka ta Izhu tsetser yi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Adiu, &lt;&lt;bata ne zen wɔ lɛ kɛ zhu tsetser ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Fe Bulus arib, &lt;&lt;Tǝ ne su zhin ne amashir kikini?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Adi, &lt;&lt;Ndi na iyi Yɔɔna,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Bulus adi, &lt;&lt;Yɔɔna ne su aneshir te bɛ duŋ zumimin. Ne bla aneshir abɛ duŋ zumimin te tanyɛmɛ ben waŋ ndi atei nyɛ ne goŋ maa, ndi ayi Yesɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Ndi ne wɔme ne tanyɛme Bulus ne duŋ a su ba ne sak kɛ Yesɔ. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Fe Bulus ne sak ba ŋɔk, Izhu tsetser ne nyɛ ba, fe akɔ lɛ aŋa kaŋkaŋ tetɛk te du ilɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Ne ayi aner awur ne ayaa bɔbɔk mǝne.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Bulus ne yir Akabaŋkɔŋ te du ilɛ kɛ Arik yaŋ te sisik ihwa tar, te te atam goŋ ne atu yi kɔb Arik. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Ne me anuŋ ne kyak te klik tu: te kyak tanyɛmɛ te kyak Ankɔŋ ndi Bulus ne blau ma ne min neshir. Fe Bulus aru te duŋ ba. Te gli abaŋ ndi azǝ Yesɔ te gar amkpa ne tsar ayi Tirana te tsar ba kɔte bɛr tayi. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Neme Bulus ne tsar ba ilɛ kɛ Arik asi yaa te duŋ ane Yahudawa ben Larbawa ndi akɔ sɔŋ ne ntun yi Asiya ne wɔ lɛ kɛ Arik.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Arik ne na iki duŋ aneshir asak aŋɔk ne ne ne atu ye Bulus, <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />ne vu aŋaŋklu kɛ yis akli ben ki su maa agli aneshir abaŋ ndi alɔ, te sak ne kpa men te rɛ ben anerim ne na ru ne kpa kɛ aneshir.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Yahudawa nuŋ ne yir ntun te di aba Gli anerim agli rumɔ ne akpa ye aneshir ne sak kɛ Yesɔ. Te di, &lt;&lt;Ne sak kɛ Yesɔ ndi Bulus abla lɛ ma, Me di zhin bɛ ru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Amumun ataŋgba bɛ awɔ ne Yahudawa ndi ayi ngɔŋ abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik ndi azhɔu te si ba, aba na kiyiŋ. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Ne bɛr nuŋ yi me irim adi ba, &lt;&lt;Mǝne zhi Yesɔ te na zhi Bulus, zhineba yi ane ŋɔwa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Fe iner waŋ ndi ayi ne nerim atuk asɔŋ ba te klik anaŋ ba ankyak aklu ru ne kɔbɔ mgbawun ne zhizhi ne kpa men.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Ndi Yahudawa bene Larbawa ndi ayi ne Afisa ne wɔ lɛ kǝŋe sisik ne vuŋ ba, neme sak kɛ Yesɔ ne yik ta tetɛk. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Aner tetɛk ndi ne ta Yesɔ ne ru tetɛk te bla kiyiŋ ndi aba ne nai. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Aner tetɛk ndi atɔ ne gli amplɛ ye na ndum men gli rumɔ te goŋǝ ne min aneshir. Ndi ne tɔ za kɛ amplɛ ayiŋ ndi ne gɔŋǝ ma atei te azɔb azhin angɔŋ amɛ tuŋ. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Ne me lɛ kɛ Arik ne shak amkpa te na klik ngɔŋ.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Ndi kiki yiŋ ne na, Bulus ne baŋ ne susun maa wa tei gar Urshelima, wa te zǝ Makidɔniya ben Akaya. Bulus adi, &lt;&lt;Te yi ndi mte yir amɔ me te na gar Roma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Ne shar abɛ lɔgu na ndum amɛ yaa, Timoti bene Arastas, ne Makidɔniya, fe wa atei yene sɔŋ ne ntun yi Asiya ne liŋ.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mgbu ne Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Ne Afisa mgbu ngɔŋ ne lu ne atu ayi lɛ kɛ Yesɔ. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Ne muɔ ner nuŋ ndi azhɔu te Dimitiriyas, ine lak arik ayi azɔb, ana lak kpa neshir ndi ayak kɛ ne akabaŋkɔŋ ne Atimas, abɛ na ndum kǝŋe ayik azɔb tetɛk. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Dematros ne zhɔ abɛ na ndum amkpa zhin, bene abɛ lɛb kiyiŋɛ te diba, &lt;&lt;Alulum, izhin ne zhi te tane te yik didik ne ndum ndi ta yik azɔb tetɛk. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Izhin yik te na wɔ ne atɔŋɔ amin ir keŋ ndi Bulus ne ka lɔm aneshir tetɛk tena sen ba susun ne Afisa bene ntun yi Asiya. Adi arik waŋ ndi anau ne ŋɔk ba yi Arik ba. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Ayi ki mimin ankyak ba ne gli sak kɛ ndum mɔr yak goŋɔ ba me ankyak ba, akabaŋkɔŋ ne arik ne Aritimas ba tei na yi akpa ne gar ba bene amkpa ne sak ayi ba. Ire maa tei zhaku na ayi aye ntun yi Asiya, bene gɔŋmimi bɔbɔk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Ndi abɛ na ndumo ne wɔ me, ne tǝ mfu ngɔŋ te bu kɔr te di: Aritimas ne Afisawa a yi arik ngɔŋ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Ankyak ntuno yatɔŋ bɔbɔk. Aneshir akɔ vuŋ Gayus bene Aristakus, akpa abɛ tsin abɛ Bulus ne Makidɔniya. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Bulus ne wɔb te iwa abɛ ru kli ndende ne min aneshir, ankyak abɛ zǝu tsin ne yaru ma. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Angɔŋgɔŋ Anuŋ ne min abɛ zǝ Bulus, ne shar bene bɔu te benu kǝr abɛ ru ne min aneshir ba.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Ntsan aneshir ne yatɔŋ, anuŋ adi yiŋ anuŋ adi yuŋ, anuŋ adi iyiŋ me. Aneshir tetɛk adi ba aba ne yik kiyiŋ ndi aba ne nyɛ nai ba. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Yahudawa ne min kɛ aneshir ne tur Iskandari yak ne ti, te lɛ tedi ayi wa ne Gli yatɔŋ yiŋɛ Gli yeme. Iskandari a lɛk aŋɔk na shu te di aneshir bɛ kunu tǝ wa bɛ bla kiyiŋ ndi iyi ne miŋe. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Fe ndi ntsan aneshire ne yik awɔnǝ Yahudawa, ate ahwa te di: &lt;&lt;arik Atimas ane Afisawa ayi ngɔŋ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Nǝ klɛ tu ine cɛr ne ntuno aduŋ aneshir kunu te diba: &lt;&lt;Aner bɛ Afisa, kɔ ba gɔŋmimi bɔbɔk ne zhi te di ntun yi Afisawa aba bɛ tɔ akabaŋkɔŋ ne Atimas arik ngɔŋ bene izhu maa ka, ndi ne zhaku are shu ka? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Ne me, te yi ndi kiyiŋ iyime, duŋ tsik zhin kpaakpa ba, te zhin zee kǝr zhin bɛ na kinuŋ andanda ba. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Izhin ne Gli aneshir abaŋ Gli nyɛ ayaŋ, bane zhib ne akabaŋkɔŋ ba, bane cɔk sak kɛ arik ne Atimas la ba. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Ate yi ndi iyi amɛ, Dimitiriyas bene akpa abɛ na ndum amaa atei lɛ kɛ lɛ ne atu yi nuŋ. Ibur kɛ te ambuk ikur bu, abɛ te ambuk ayime abɛ Gli lɛ men te gar amɔ. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Te yi ndi ikinuŋ yime ndi zhin yime neyi yi lɛ, abɛ glii te gar isɔŋ ngɔŋ. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Ndi yi amɛ, bate rɛ tabǝ ta lɛ nuŋ te lɛ kɛ yaŋa bane kiyiŋ ndi ne nai aliŋ. Ne me bata te ya lǝlɛ nuŋ ayaŋa ba, ama ba rɛ te abɛ na me ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Ndi ne cɛr ne ntun ne ilɛmɛ, ne duŋ aneshir ŋar.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ne kam kɔmɔ ne Makidɔniya bene Hellas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Ndi aneshir ne duŋ yatɔŋ, Bulus ne zhɔ abɛ zǝ Yesɔ te nek ba lɛ, te zǝk ba te vuŋ ankɔŋ te gar Makidɔniya <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Ne zǝ inǝk ngɔŋ te lɛ lǝlɛ tetɛk yi duŋ susun aneshir azekur, te gar Hellas. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Ne sɔŋ amɔ ihwa tar. Yahudawa anuŋ ne te te ba bɛ kpa kinuŋ mimin aŋyak ne atu maa ndi ne te gar Suriya, te kama kɔmɔ ne Makidɔniya <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Subataras Babiriye izu Iburus, ne kɔmɔ bǝn abɔu; neme Aristakus bǝn Sakundas, arɛ Tasalɔnika; Gayus, arɛ Badarbɛ; Tikikus bǝn Tɔrɔfimus, arɛ ŋa kǝ Asiya bǝn Timoti. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Aneshir abaŋa ne kuti te kɔte ŋub ta ne Taruwasa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Akyak taba ne na lu ne Filibi te zǝ igu, ndi ne klɛ gyaŋ yi kili yi yaŋ maŋ, tane tsin bɛr tuŋ te yik ba ne Taruwasa. Ta ne sɔŋ amɔ bɛr Taŋgba.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ivli kɛ Aftikɔs ne kam nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Ne bɛr yi vuŋdum tayi biŋ sɔŋ te li kili. Bulus ne lɛ bene aneshir ndi iber te ŋan atei duŋ ba, ne ban mkpaŋ te lɛ gar atsutsu bu. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Lulu yi laŋ yime tetɛk ne iki kɛ shu ne amkpa waŋ ndi ta sɔŋɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Ivenenzak nuŋ ndi azhou tǝ Atikus ne kɔ sɔŋ ne Taga, ina ne vuŋu ŋɔk ndi Bulus ne zen du ilɛ kɛ Arik, ne zhaku ne iki kɛ shu kɛ ntar te ku. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Bulus ne zi te zǝkur ne kpa kɛ Aftikɔs te rimu gli na aŋɔk maa. Te di, &lt;&lt;Kǝr asusun amin abɛ cokla ba, vǝvǝnne akur vli!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Fe akama yuŋ te gar iki kɛ shu te li kili. Te du ilɛ kɛ Arik gar ŋan bɛr te duŋ ba. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Aneshir ne baŋ vǝvǝnne te kɔmɔ ne kɔb ne vli maa te nyɛr ngɔŋ.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ne lɛ bene angɔŋgɔŋ bɛ zǝ Yesɔ ne Afisa lǝlɛ yi duŋ ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Tane yir Gu te kɔmɔ ne Asus, amɔ te gar te ta bɛ ban Bulus ne gu. Ama ne di iwa atei tsin ne za. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Ndi ne yik ta ne Asus, ta ne baŋu ne gu tɔ kɔmɔ ne Mitilini. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Ne bɛr yi yaa tane tsin ne gu te yir kiyos. Ne bɛr yi tar ta yir Samas, ne bɛr yi naku zi tane yir Milita. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Bulus ne te te wa abɛ gar Afisa ne gu te kǝr iwa abɛ klɛ mkpaŋ ne Asiya ba, tǝ wa anama andanda, te abɛ yir Urshelima ne bɛr yi igyaŋ yi bɛr sɔk tuŋ iyi biŋ kili yi rɛ ahwaŋ(Fentikɔs).<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Nǝ Milita, Bulus ne shar bene angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ akabaŋkɔŋ ne Afisa. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Ndi ne yir, Bulus adi ba: &lt;&lt;Izhin ne zhi ndi mne mbaŋ mkpaŋ te sɔŋ ben abɛ zhin rɛ bɛr yiŋ ndi mne yi ne Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Mne na ndum kɛ Arik tena nzi tɔ zhɔk tena ru amayi ne kiyiŋ ndi mne yigǝ ben Yahudawa. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Izhin ne zhi te bam ne gbaŋ kpa ne bla kɔte nii ndi itei duŋ zhin te aneshir adidik ba mǝne na bla zhin ne min aneshir ben akɔkɔb. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Mne bla Yahudawa ben abaŋ ndi bane zhi lɛ kɛ Arik te tanyɛme ben Yesɔ ba.<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Fe Bulus adi, &lt;&lt;Azizaŋ, Izhu ne dim gar Urshelima, bam ne zhi kiyiŋ ndi itei nam amɔ ba. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Ki yiŋ ndi mne zhi te kɔte ntun tayi Izhu Tsetser ne gbaŋ me atɔŋ tedi atei sak me iyah te zhɔk me ne jaru fe iyah na klɛ ŋub me. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Ne me, bam ne ban kpamuŋ iyi kinuŋ bene bɛm ba, kiyiŋ ndi yi ne susun muŋ te na kiyiŋ ndi iyi ne ti muŋ tena klɛ ndum keŋ ndi Arik ne neme kɛ ndum kɛ bla neshir lɛ didik kɛ Arik.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />&lt;&lt;Azizaŋ mne zhi te bɔbɔk min ndi mne bla zhin lɛ kɛ kɔb Arik ba zhin tei na yik me ba. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Ne me, me bla zhin aliŋ waŋ ndi bate yir kɔb Arik ba iyiu maa. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Bam ne suk kpa ne bla zhin lɛ kɛ Arik ba. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Izhin bǝ tɔ akpamin ben aneshir bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi Izhu Tsetser aye Arik ne duŋ ba yi ne angus amin. Izhin bɛ kyu aneshir bɛ Akabaŋkɔŋ ayi Arik, ndi ne lɛb ba na zhizhi a Yesɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Me ne zhi M tei duŋ zhin, ane wuwu ma angɔŋgɔŋ atei yi ne miŋ min batei lɔr ben awanta ba. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Nǝ min kɛ aneshir anuŋ amin atei lu te bla kiyiŋ ndi bai didik ba te bɛ gbur anuŋ abɛ zǝ Yesɔ te bɛ kama zǝ ba. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Amɛ, izhin bǝ sɔŋ adidik! Shuzhi zhin te ase tar bam ne nduŋ vǝ nuŋ ne miŋ min ba iyaŋ buu ben aririk ne amayi.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Bulus adi ba, &lt;&lt;Azǝzaŋa mne biŋ zhin ben Arik ben ilɛ maa didik ta zhɔk, ndi tei duŋ zhin flu tena nek zhin kiyiŋ ndi atei nek abɛ yi tsetser. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Bam ne tik yi ne amak ayi nuŋ ben kluŋklu yi nuŋ ba. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Izhineba ne akpamin ne zhi ndi aŋɔk amuŋ ne nǝm li te so ben akpa abɛ tsǝn amuŋ. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Nǝ kiyiŋ ndi mne nai bɔbɔk, mne tsar zhin te ndi nena ndum ŋgɔŋ tǝ ta bǝ lɔk abaŋ ndi ba yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ba, zhin bɛ shuzhi lɛ keŋ ndi Yesɔ ne di: &lt;Ita anu adidik iyi ŋgɔŋ ne tu yi Waŋ ndi anǝk ki maa inaŋ ne ta kime&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Ndi Bulus ne bla lǝlɛ yiŋɛ bɔbɔk, ne tar agbarum bǝn angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ zǝ Yesɔ ne Afisa te ben Arik. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Bɔbɔk mǝne ne zhin te rim Bulus agli te ku asa bǝne bou. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Kiyiŋ ndi ne lɛn ba susun ngɔŋ ayi lɛ keŋ ndi Bulus ne di ba tei na yik wa ba. Fe ne zɛku te gar yir Gu.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ne gar Urushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Ndi ta ne duŋ ba, ta ni yir igu te gar igar kɛ kɔs. Ne bɛr yi ya ta ne gar Rodusa, tena gar Bantara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Ta ni yik igu kɛ gar Finikiya, tani yir kɛ te kɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Ndi tane te gbahir ne kuburus, tani kam zi ŋɔk mla ma, tani zi ne Taya, amɔ igu mɔ te zi ki yiŋ ndi ne baŋ yi. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Ndi tane yik abɛ zi Yesɔ amɔ tane sɔŋ bene abɛba bɛr Taŋgba. Izhu tsetser ne bla Bulus kǝr bɛ gar Urshelima ba. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Ndi mkpaŋ ne te ndi ta tei lu, ta lu te vuŋ tsǝn mɔr. Alulum ben amba, ben amumun, ne zǝk ta agli ru ne ntunɔ, ta ne tar agbarum ne kɔtɔŋ nek te ben Arik. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Ankyak ndi ta ne bla lɛ kɛ duŋ akpa tane duŋ ba akam kɔmɔ ne kɔb.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Tane vuŋ tsin mɔr rɛ Taya te gar Talamayas, ne muɔ tane yik amunya ben amunvamɔr tetɛk tane sɔŋ bene bɛba bɛr zhin. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Ndi bɛr ne ŋan te gar Kaseriya, tane yir kɔb Filibus ne bla lɛ kɛ Arik, waŋ ndi ayi ne min kɛ ataŋgba ndi ne hria ba. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Ayi ne mune amba amɛ nas ndi bane zen aŋa ba, abla shar yi Arik.<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Ndi ta ne te bɛr tetɛk amɔ, ne bla shar ayou Arik nuŋ ndi azhɔu te Agabus are Yahudiya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Ne yi bene bɛta ne ban ki kpa tiŋ yi Bulus, te kpa a ŋɔk bene aza ma te di. &lt;&lt;Izhu tsetser idi, &lt;Ne me angɔŋgɔŋ bɛ Yahudawa ate kpa akiki ne ki kpa tiŋ yiŋɛ te vuŋ nek abɛ yaŋ zhi Arik.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Ndi taba bene aneshir abaŋ ndi ne yi ne amkpama tane ben Bulus kɛ bɛ gar Urshelima ba. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Fe Bulus adi ta te di, &lt;&lt;Izhin zhin tɛ nii te duŋ kpa ku sik me? Mne nǝk tu muŋ te bɛ kpam ba kpa Ankyak ba tem na ku ne Urshelima nǝ sak kɛ Yesɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Ndi ne kyak ben mɔrɔ, bata na yi ni ki na ba fe ta di, &lt;&lt;Arik bɛ na kiyiŋ ndi ne reu.<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Ne me, ta vuŋ ankɔŋ te gar Urushelima. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Anuŋ abɛ zi Yesɔ ndi are Kaseriya ne zǝk ta te gli ta te gar kɔb Manason, amɔ wa ta te kur. Ayi neshir ne kubrus waŋ ndi ne baŋ kpaŋ tetɛk ne zi Yesɔ.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ne yir Urushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Ndi ta ne yir Urushelima, amun zumɔr bene amun va mɔr ne ta ta aŋɔk ya. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Ndi bɛr ne ŋan Bulus ben taba tane gar te kɔte yik Yakubu, bɔbɔk angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ zi Yesɔ ne yime na kpama. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Bulus ne tek ba te bla ba iri keŋ ndi Arik ne na ndum bane wa ne tɔ yi abɛ yaŋ zhi Arik.<verse eid="ACT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Ndi ne wɔ me, ne gbara Arik sak. Fe adi Bulus: &lt;&lt;Izu mɔr, uyik, Yahudawa azhiin tetɛk ne ta lɛ kɛ Arik, ne me bɔbɔk mǝne awɔb lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Ne bla ba te di utsar Yahudiya abaŋ ndi ayi ne min abɛ yaŋ zhi lɛ kɛ Arik ba zi lɛ kɛ Musa ba. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Ta tei na anii?aneshire mɔr ate zhi te izhin yi ayaŋa, <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />ne me na kiyiŋ ndi ta tei blau. Aneshir amɛ nas ndi ayi ben abɛ ta ne sherim. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Izhin bǝ baŋ aneshir abaŋa, te duŋ ba bɛ yi tsetser, te ya ba, te duŋ ba bɛ kɔn atu men. Ne me ba nuŋ ndi ate yi ndi iyi amɛ ne lɛ keŋ ndi ne bla kɛ ne tɔ mi, fe ate di wa miyi uzǝ lɛ kɛ Arik kɛ cɛr yi Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Netu yi acɛn abaŋ ndi ne ta Arik, tane cɛr ba kiyiŋ ndi iyi ne susun amɔr tedi batei li kiyiŋ ndi ne nek kpok kuŋkun ndi ne sub kɛ aŋyak te zǝ kuu kɛ ba, kǝr bɛ na ta na keŋ ndi bane yak kɛ ba, bene narum yiŋ ndi ne fir yi ŋun, kǝr bɛ na kur ben amba abaŋ ndi ba yi amen ba.<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Ne bɛr yi ya, Bulus ne gli aneshir abaŋa te den akpa men tsetser. Fe na gar Akabaŋkɔŋ te blɛ bɛr yiŋ Ndi aneshir ate duŋ akpa men tsetser bɛr iri keŋ Ndi ate bin ba kiki.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne vuŋ Bulus ne Akabaŋkɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Ndi bɛr taŋgba ne te gayir, aner bɛ Yahudawa nuŋ ndi are gar kɛ Asiya ne yik Bulus ne Akabaŋkɔŋ. Ne shɔk aneshir bɔbɔk te bɛ vuŋ Bulus, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />aneshire ayatɔŋ te di, &lt;&lt;Amunzumɔr aner abɛ Isrela, lɔk zhin tama! Waŋ ayi ner waŋ ndi atsar kɔte ŋɔwa ne kɔte me bɛ kam ti bene aner amɔr ben lɛ keŋ ndi Musa ne cɛr ta nǝk ta ne kǝ. Ne mee, ne Gli acɛn te duŋ ba yir Akabaŋkɔŋ te zen la amkpa ne sɔŋ amene.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />(Ne kɔkɔb ne yik Tarofimas awɔnǝ Afisa ne min tun bene Bulus te di Bulus ne gliu te yir Akabaŋkɔŋ.)<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Ntuno bɔbɔk ne ŋurka ne ya tɔŋ, aneshir bɔbɔk aklu te rɛ agagar te nyɛ. Avuŋ Bulus, te gbaŋu agli rumɔ ne Akabaŋkɔŋ, ne amkpamkpama te ku ankɔŋɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Ndi ne te te ba bɛ ŋunu, ilɛ mɛ ne te yir atɔŋ ŋgɔŋ ne abɛ tyak kum abaŋ ndi ayi ne Roma te di bɔbɔk ntun yi Urshelima ne tsik ŋar. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Fe akɔ lu te Gli angɔŋgɔŋ Anuŋ abɛ tyak kum anuŋ te gliu agar bene aneshire. Ndi aner abɛ tsik akpa ŋar ne yik ŋɔk ne tyak kum bene abɛ tyak kum Anuŋ, aduŋ tsik Bulus.<verse eid="ACT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Ngɔŋ ne abɛ tyak kumɔ anyɛ te vuŋ Bulus te di abɛ kpau ne saraka me yaa. Te rib bu ayi ŋɔwa nena na anii. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Anuŋ ne min kɛ aneshir alǝk akɔr tedi yiŋ anuŋ adi yuŋ, ndi ŋgɔŋ ne tyak kumɔ bane wɔ lɛ didik bǝn abɛ yatɔŋɔ ba, adi bɛ baŋ Bulus te gar amkpa ne sɔŋ abɛ tyak kum. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Ndi Bulus ne yir kɔb kɛ zi, aneshir ayatɔŋ ŋgɔŋ tedi abɛ tyak kum bɛ gliu te kɔmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Aneshir abaŋ ndi ne zǝ bama akyak te yatɔŋ tedi, &lt;&lt;Zhɔk zhin newu adɔmɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ne lɛ ben Aneshir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Ndi abɛ tyak kumɔ ne te baŋ Bulus te gar amkpa ne sɔŋ amene, arib ŋgɔŋ amene tedi, &lt;&lt;Ka zhin duŋ me bla kinuŋ ini?&gt;&gt; Ŋgɔŋ ne tyak kum adiu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">&lt;&lt;U ya lɛ Helenanci yi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />&lt;&lt;Bai wa uyi awɔ ne Masar ndi bɛr yi gayir ne duŋ aneshir tsik ŋar te yaa tɔŋ te gli aneshir bɛ kyak wɔ lɛ me azhin nas te gli ba te gar zǝzǝk ka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Bulus adi, &lt;&lt;Me yi awɔ ne Yahudawa, me rɛ Tarsus ntun yi Kilikiya, me yi ŋli kɛ ntun yi tɔ shak yi. Me ben ne duŋ lɛ bene aneshir abaŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Ndi ŋɔk ne tyak kum ne ta yimɛ, Bulus ne lu kli ne nga azǝ te diba abɛ ku anu. Ndi ne ku anu, adi ba na ŋa yi Yahudawai.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />&lt;&lt;Amunzumɔr ben atsintsim amɔr, wɔ zhin lɛ muŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Ndi ne wɔ Bulus alɛ ne ŋa ayi Yahudawa akɔ ku anu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:2">Fe Bulus adi: <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />&lt;&lt;Me yi awɔnǝ Yahudiya, ne ŋlim ne Tarsus, ntun yi Kilikiya, te mne ntǝ ŋgɔŋ ne ntun yiŋɛ. Mne te aki ayi tsar aye Gamaliya, ne tsar me lǝlɛ yi atsintsim amɔr. Mǝne nek tu te zǝ Arik ndi bɔbɔk mine zeu aliŋe. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Mne sak abɛ zǝ ankɔŋ awaŋa iyah, te ntsik anuŋ ŋlɔk, te mkpaŋ alulum ben amba te ntur ba shur ne jaru, <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />ngɔŋ ane abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik ben sɔŋ kɛ angɔŋgɔŋ ate tanyɛmɛ ne lɛ kɛ bla muŋ kǝŋe. Mne na nta mplɛ kɛ cɛr bǝn abɛba te ngar bǝn amunzumen ne Damaskɔ, te gar amɔ te kɔte gli aner abaŋ ndi ne kpa aŋɔk amene ndi abɛ jaru ne baŋ ba te nyɛ Urshelima te abɛ nek ba iyah.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />&lt;&lt;Ne atsutsu arik ndi mne te gbahir ne Damaskɔ, ankyak ilu nuŋ kǝŋe laŋ ngɔŋ te rɛ shu te kum. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />M zhaku ne mimi te wɔ kɔr idim, &lt;Shaulu! Shaulu! Usak mǝ ya tǝ ni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Mǝ rib te ndi, &lt;&lt;&lt;Uyi ŋɔwai, Arik?&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:8">&lt;&lt;&lt;Me yi Yesɔ awɔnǝ Nazara ndi usagu iyah,&gt; adi amɛ. <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Abaŋ ndi ne zǝm atsǝn ne yik ilumɔ, bane awɔlɛ keŋ ndi nɛ lɛ ben bɛm ba.<verse eid="ACT 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />M rib te ndi, &lt;&lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, me na anii?&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:10">Ŋgɔŋ Arik adim, &lt;&lt;Lu sɔŋ te gar Damaskɔ. Amɔ wa atei blau ki yiŋ ndi utei na.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Abɛ zǝm tsǝne ne vuŋ me agli ne ŋɔk te gar Damaskɔ, te lumɔ ne laŋ ŋgɔŋ te kum ayi.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Ner nuŋ ndi azhɔu te Ananiya ne nyɛ ben bɛm. Ayi ner ne zǝ lɛ kɛ Arik ngɔŋ waŋ ndi te vuŋ ane Yahudawa abaŋ ndi aye amɔ ayigu shak ayi. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Ne klɛ gbahir bene bɛm te di, &lt;&lt;Shaulu zumɔr, yik laŋ amkpa!&gt; Fe ne amkpamkpama ayi amaa akɔ bu.<verse eid="ACT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Ankyak a dim: &lt;Arik ane atsintsim amɔr ne hriau te bɛ zhi susun maa tena yik waŋ ndi ayi tsetser tena wɔ nkan lǝlɛ nenu amaa. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Utei yi ne bla aneshir bɔbɔk kiyiŋ di une wɔi tena yigǝ. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Amɛ azizaŋa uŋub anii? Lu teduŋ a suu nǝ sak kɛ Arik te ŋla zumimin mi atyak ahrie te zhɔ sak kɛ Arik.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Ndi Mǝne kam kɔmɔ ne Urshelima te zen ben Arik ne Akabaŋkɔŋ. Mǝne yik iri <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Mǝne yik Arik alɛ ben bɛm te di, &lt;Andanda, duŋ Urshelima azizaŋa, te aner abɛ yaŋa batei tanyɛme ne lɛ kɛŋ ndi utei bla kɛ na tu muŋ ba.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Me ndi, &lt;&lt;&lt;Arik, aneshir abaŋ ndi ne zhi tedi me zǝ Akabaŋkɔŋ te Mvu aneshir nku tena ntsik abaŋ ndi ne tau menyi. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Ndi ne tyak azhizhi ayi Istifanu ne bla lɛ mi ahrie. Mnǝ nkliŋkli ne amkpama, te ntanyɛme ne kiyiŋ di anai tena ŋub kluŋklu yi abaŋ ndi azǝn tyagu ŋun.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Fe Arik adim, &lt;&lt;Tsǝn, me tei sharu gbagbaŋ bene abaŋ ndi bai zǝ Arik ba.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Aneshir ne wɔ te Bulus ndi ne bla lɛ kǝŋe, fe alǝk akɔr te di, &lt;&lt;Be tsǝgu aŋun, ba rɛ te abɛ duŋu tsitsir ne gɔŋmimi ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Ndi ne zen ya tɔŋ tena vu kluŋklu te turo akpa te lɛk mgbumgbuk, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Ngɔŋ abɛ kpaakpa aduŋ avuŋ Bulus te gar amkpa ne su amen. Ne di bɛ tsǝgu tena bene rib bu te anii duŋ aneshir aya atɔŋ ne tu maa me. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Dine kpau te atei zeu azhɔk te tsǝgu, Bulus adi ngɔŋ ne kpaakpa ndi aklikla gbahir bene bau te di, &lt;&lt;Ire te abɛ tsik waŋ ndi ayi ŋli kɛ Roma ndi bane na ki mimin ka yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Ndi ngɔŋ ne kpaakpa ne wɔme a gar ben ngɔŋɔ amen te blau kiyiŋ ndi Bulus ne blai ma. Te rib bu, &lt;&lt;Utei na ner waŋa anii? Ner waŋa ayi ŋli kɛ Roma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Ngɔŋ amene gar bene Bulus te rib bu te di, &lt;&lt;Blam, uyi ŋli kɛ Roma yi?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Bulus adi, &lt;&lt;Iyi amɛ, Mǝyi ŋli kɛ Roma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Ŋɔk ne kpaakpa adi, &lt;&lt;mǝne ya azɔb tetɛk te duŋ ilɛmɛ yi ŋli kɛ Roma.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Bulus adi, &lt;&lt;Teyi nga ne ŋlim ne Roma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Abaŋ ndi ne te rib bu lǝlɛ ne duŋ rib bu ma te kama tibɛ te duŋu. Ngɔŋ ane abɛ kpaa kpama ate sǝsǝk ne teu ndi ne zhi te wa duŋ akpa waŋ ndi ayi ŋli kɛ Roma.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ne angus akɛ angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ lɛ lǝlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Ne bɛr yi ku zǝ ndi ngɔŋ ne abɛ kpaakpa ne wɔb te wa bɛ zhi kiyiŋ di aneshir bɛ zhabu ne awa nǝ ki ndi Bulus ne nai. Ne duŋ ngɔŋ ne bla lɛ kɛ Arik ben angɔŋgɔŋ bɛ lɛ lǝlɛ abiŋ. Fe agli Bulus te nyɛ te duŋɔ alu akli ne ti men.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Bulus a tɔ angɔŋgɔŋ aba lɛ lǝlɛ te di, &lt;&lt;Amunzu mɔr, Mǝne na duŋ kɛ di Arik ne di bɛ na kɛ ne susun didik te nyɛ bǝn aliŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Ne me Hananiya ŋgɔŋ ne bɛ bla lɛ kɛ Arik a di abaŋ di aklɛ kli gbahir bǝn bɔu bɛ ŋɔru ne ne. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Fe Bulus adiu, &lt;&lt;Arik atei ŋuru miyi, kɔntsin keŋ di ne kin kɛ ntɔŋ! Usɔŋ ne bem te ubǝ tǝm ambuk ne lɛ kǝ Arik kǝ cɛr Musa ndi wa miyi bau zǝ kɛ ba, te di ubǝ ŋur me.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Abaŋ ndi a kɛ kli gbahir bǝn Bulus adi, &lt;&lt;Anii duŋu yen ngɔŋ nena ndum kɛ Arik?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Bulus adi, &lt;&lt;Amunya, bam ne zhi te di ayi ŋɔk ne na ndum kɛ Arik ba. Ne cɛr te di; &lt;Kǝr bɛ lɛ mimin ne tu yi ŋgon ne Gli aneshir ba.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Fe Bulus, ne zhi tedi anuŋ ne min mine ayi Sadusiyawa ben Ferisawa, alɛ nǝ kɔr ngɔŋ ne akpa ne bin aner angɔŋgɔŋ te di, &lt;&lt;Amunzumɔr, me yi Bafarisi, ne ŋli Ferisawa. Me kɛ kli ne amkpa ane te ambuk te nzhɔk susun ne ku te lu abɛ ku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Ndi Bulus ne bla amɛ, antam ne lu ne atsutsu ane Ferisawa ben Sadukiyawa, aneshir ne gab ate tek ya. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />(Ane Sadukiyawa adi iku te lu ba yime ba, abɛ shar ayou Arik ba yi ame ba ben zhu ba na yime ba, amɛ Ferisawa ne tanyɛme ne kiyiŋ bɔbɔk.)<verse eid="ACT 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Ne te atam tetɛk, abɛ tsar lɛ kɛ Arik anuŋ ndi ayi Ferisawa ne lu te tǝ atam ŋgon. &lt;&lt;Bata ne yik kinuŋ mimin ne tu yi ner waŋa ba,&gt;&gt; adi. &lt;&lt;Te yiŋ ndi ayi zhu kɔ abɛ shar ayou Arik ne lɛ bene bau nai?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Ndi atam ne lu ŋgon fe sisik ne vuŋ ŋgon ne bɛ tyak kum kǝr abɛ lu tyak Bulus ne mkpaŋ nuŋ ba. Aduŋ abɛ tyak kum a zi te bɛ kɔte ban Bulus te kɔmɔ ne amkpa ne sɔŋ amen.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Ne bu yi ku zǝ Arik ne kli gbahir ben Bulus te di, &lt;&lt;Be kli gbamgbaŋ! Ndi ne bla lɛ muŋ ne Urshelima, ne me utei na bla kǝ nǝ Roma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yahudawa ne kpa nyak te bɛ ŋun Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Ne bɛr yi yaa, Yahudawa nuŋ ne bin te kpa yak te sherim aba ba te li te sɔ ba sɛ ba ne ŋun Bulus ne liŋ. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Aneshir bɛ naŋ sɔk nas aba ne kpa lɛ keŋ yak. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Ne gar bǝn ŋɔk ne na ndum kɛ Arik bǝn angɔŋgɔŋ bɛ Akabaŋkɔŋ te di, &lt;&lt;Ta ne she arim ŋɔk te di bata te so te li kinuŋ ba se ta ne ŋun Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Azizaŋa izhin aba bǝn nki angɔŋgɔŋ izhin bǝ shar bǝn ngɔŋ ne abɛ tyak kum tǝ bɛ gli Bulus agli nyɛmɛ bene bɔu ndi izhin tena rib bu lǝlɛ nuŋ netu ayi lɛ kɛŋ ndi azǝn zhɔu goŋ rime. Ta ne ka na gli ta tei ŋunu bane yir bene bɛ zhin ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Ne me ndi vǝvǝn ayou va men ane Bulus ne wɔ kiyiŋ ndi ne kpai aŋyak, ne gar amkpa ne sɔŋ abɛ tyak kum te bla Bulus.<verse eid="ACT 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Fe Bulus azho zhiin nemin angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ te ambuk alɛ te diu, &lt;&lt;Gli vǝvǝn waŋa te gar ben ŋgon ne tyak kum, ayi ne kiyi blau.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Fe agliu te gar ben ŋgon ne tyak kum.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 23:18">Ne yi ne min abɛ te ambuk alɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Bulus ne yi ne amkpa ne ku aneshir, ne shar bene bɛm te bɛ Gli vǝvǝn waŋa te ye ben abɔu te ayi ne kiyi blau.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Ŋgɔŋ ne tyak kum a vuŋ vǝvǝn ne ŋɔk, te gliu te gar kɔn sa te rib bu, &lt;&lt;Utei blam anii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Vǝvǝn ne adi: &lt;&lt;Yahudawa anuŋ ne tanyɛme atei shar bǝn bɔu te ubɛ gli Bulus te gar amkpa ane ambuk amblimblɛ atei kama Gli tedi aba atei na rib bu ikiyiŋ ndi itsin netu maa. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Kǝr ubǝ tanyɛme ba, te aneshir abǝ naŋ sɔk nas akɔkur nǝ zǝzǝk te kur ablɛu. Ne shɛrim aba batei so tena li ba se aba ne ŋun Bulus. Ne ka na kli azizaŋa, aklɛ ŋub te abɛ tanyɛme ne shar men.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Ngɔŋ ne tyak ikumɔ aduŋ vǝvǝne kɔmɔ te gbaŋu atɔŋ, &lt;&lt;Kǝr ubɛ bla nuŋ tedi une blam lɛ kǝŋe ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne tur Bulus te duŋ gar ben ŋgɔŋ ne Gli Filikus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Fe ne zhɔ abɛ tyak kum amɛ yaa tedi ba, &lt;&lt;Lu zhin te vu zhin ngɔŋgɔŋ abɛ tyak kum amɛ yaa, ben abɛ sa nŋa amɛ sɔk wur me taŋgba ben abɛ Gli kab azhin ayaa te gar zhin Kaseriya ne mkpaŋ teres kɛ amgbalu bu. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Duŋ zhin Bulus ayuŋ nŋa te bɛ gliu kiki maa te gar ben ngɔŋ ne gli Filikus.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Ngɔŋ abɛ kpaakpa ne cɛr amplɛ te di:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Ire ben Kaludiya Lisiya,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 23:26">Te gar ben ngɔŋ ne Gli Filikus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 23:26">Me tegu tetɛk.<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Ner waŋa ne tau ne aŋɔk ane Yahudawa ne tǝ te ba bɛ ŋunu, Mne nyɛ bǝn abɛ tyak ikumɔ tǝ ntau zhɔk, mne zhi tǝ ayi ŋli kɛ Roma. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Mǝne te tem zhi te Bulus ne naa ba anii, Me gliu te ngar amkpa ane te ambuk amene. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Me ne yik lɛ keŋ ndi agliu ma bane bin ben kiki iyi na men ba, bane na kinuŋ ndi ne mla ŋunu kɔ zhɔ gu ne jaru ba. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Ndi ne blam ikpa nyak yiŋ ndi ne tei netu maa. Mǝne turu ngar ben abɔu andanda. Mǝ ne na ndi abɛ wɔb bu nɛ lɛ abɛ gar tɛ te blau ikiyiŋ ndi ne naa ba.<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Fe abɛ tyak kum, akɔ na kiyiŋ ndi ne di abɛ na, te baŋ Bulus ne bu te gliu te gar ben Antibatiri. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Ndi bɛr ne ŋan ne duŋ abɛ sa nŋa gliu te kɔmɔ, fe abɛ tyak kumɔ akam ŋur akam kɔmɔ ne amkpa ne sɔŋ amen. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Ndi abɛ sa ane nŋa ma ne yir Kaseriya, nɛ nǝk ngɔŋ ne Gli ntun icɛr yi ngɔŋ ne tyak kumɔ te nǝgu Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Ndi ngɔŋ ne gli ntuno ne tɔ cɛrǝ arib Bulus tedi uyi awɔnǝ mee. Ndi ne zhi tedi are Kilikiya, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />ngɔŋɔ adi, &lt;&lt;M tei wɔ kɔ azǝbu ne nii ndi abɛ zebu ma ate nyɛ.&gt;&gt; Ankyak akɔ duŋ ba nyak Bulus ne bur Hiridus.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Ne gli Bulus agar amkpa nǝ te ambuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Ndi bɛr tuŋ ne gayir Ananiya ngɔŋ nena ndum ne Akabaŋkɔŋ ne gar Kaseriya ben angɔŋgɔŋ aneshire anuŋ ben ine te ambuk nuŋ ndi azhɔu te Tatulus te gli ambuk amen anyɛ bǝn gomna netu yi Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Ndi ne zhɔ Bulus ayire, Tartulus ne bla ilɛ kɛ te ambuk amaa ne ti kɛ Felik tedi, &lt;&lt;tane baŋ mkpaŋ tetɛk te yik sik susun ne angus ami, ine te zor ben abɔu nɛ Gli kiki yi sen atu aneshir anyɛ nǝ ntun yiŋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />kɔte kpaŋ takɛ ben kɔte ankɔŋ atawa ngɔŋ Felik, tane ta iyiŋɛ ne nyɛr. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Ama bam te sagu iyah ba, mbenu ubǝ shur atɔŋ te wɔ ilɛ kǝŋe.<verse eid="ACT 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Ta ne yik iner waŋa azǝn wɔb akla, azǝn shɔk mgbu nemin kɛ Yahudawa kɔte mɛ ne gɔŋmimi, ayi wa ayi ngɔŋ nena ikiki yiŋɛ ne Nazara <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />tɛ awɔb tǝ wa abɛ var akabaŋkɔŋ ŋɔ, fe ta ne vuŋu. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Ama ngɔŋ Lisiya ne tau azhɔk ne aŋɔk amɔr ne mgbyamgbyaŋ. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Utǝ tɔ iyiŋɛ ne tu mi utei zhi izub o netu ayi ambuk ayiŋ ndi mne gli nyɛmɛ netu maa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Yahudawa ne di ngɔŋ, tedi ikime iyi amɛ.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Ndi gomna ne di Bulus a bɛ lɛ, fe adi: &lt;&lt;Me ne zhi une te ase tetɛk te zen te aner baŋa ambuk ne nyɛr mi te bla lɛ muŋ. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Ndi utei wɔb zhi nǝ tu mi, bane kam bɛr wur ane yaa ndi Mnǝ ngar ben Arik ne Urshelima. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Bane yik me mgaaŋa ben inuŋ ba, kɔ Mne lɛk mgbu te mbiŋ aneshir ne min akabaŋkɔŋ kɔte min ntun ba. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Aba menyi ba tei ya blau kiyiŋ ndi ne duŋ ba ne gli ambuk netu amuŋ anyɛ ayaŋa ba. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Ama mǝne tanyɛme te ndi, ne ankɔŋ awaŋ ndi azhɔu te &lt;&lt;Derika&gt;&gt; Mǝ zǝ Arik ane atsintsim amɔr, ayi wa me ne tanyɛme ne kiyiŋ ndi nɛ lɛ ne min kɛ icɛr iyi Musa ben lɛ kɛ abɛ bla ishar yi Arik, <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />mǝne zhɔk susun ben Arik, ir keŋ ndi abaŋa ana zhɔk asusun, ndi atei lɛk abɛ ku, abɛ na didik ben abɛ na mimin. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Ne me, kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ me nǝk tu tem yine susun didik te kǝr bɛ laa Arik ilɛ ben aneshir.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Ne min kɛ amɔ se, mǝne ŋur nkam kɔmɔ ne Urshelima te nek aneshir iki yiŋ ndi me yime neyi ne miŋ kɛ iyah muŋ. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Mǝyi ne miŋ kǝ na mɛ ne nyɛ yik me ne akabaŋkɔŋ Me yi tsetser, ba aneshir nuŋ ne kpam ba, bata ne gaaŋa ba, anaga yi ane Yahudawa abaŋ ndi are ntun iyi Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Ayi aba ne ne gli ambuk netu muŋ anyɛ me. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Aneshir abaŋa ne tu men abɛ bla iki mimin yiŋ ndi mǝne nai ndi me ne kli ne akabaŋkɔŋ. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Anaga yi lɛ zhiin keŋ ndi me ne lɛk kɔr, te lɛ kɛ ne ti: &lt;M tei yik ku te nlu ndi azǝn tem ambuk ne ti min aliŋe.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Filikus ndi ayi ne zhi ki ne ankɔŋɔ waŋa ne tsiba aŋyak, te di. &lt;&lt;Ate yi ndi Lisiyas ngɔŋ ate nyɛ, M tei ka zhi iki yiŋ ndi M tei nai ne lɛ kǝŋe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Ne di ngɔŋɔ mǝne tedi abɛ gli Bulus, tedi abɛ duŋ asagu iyah ba abɛ duŋ yar aner amaa nyɛ bene bɔu te nyɛ tɔu ba.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Ndi iber ne gayir Filikus ne nyɛ iwa bǝn iwa maa Duruda, ayi vǝŋɔ ane Yahudawa. Fe a kɔ shar abɛ kɔte Gli Bulus agli nyɛmɛ, ne wɔ lɛ maa ne ana tanyɛ ne lɛ kɛ Almasihu Yesɔ. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Bulus ayi ne min kɛ zǝn lɛ ne atu yi na ki didik, ben vuŋ kpa, ben iyah yi nyɛ, Filibus afa anu tedi, &lt;&lt;Ŋurkam kɔmɔ Mte yik mkpaŋ M tei nka zhɔu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Ne yik tedi te Bulus atei nǝk wa azɔb, waŋa kiyiŋ ndi azǝn zhɔu amkpamkpaŋ te zen lɛ bene bɔu.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Ndi ase yaa ne gayir Borkiya Festas ne yuŋ mben yi Filikus. Filikus awɔb te Yahudawa abɛ tanyɛme ben abɔu ne duŋ Bulus ne jaru.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ne baŋ ite ambuk amaa te kɔmɔ ben kaisar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Ndi iber tar ne te Festas ne yir amkpa ne ndum ma, ne lu te duŋ Kaseriya te kɔmɔ ne Urshelima, <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />fe abɛ na ndum Arik angɔŋgɔŋ ben Yahudawa akɔ Gli ambuk te kɔmɔ bene bɔu, te benu. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Abɛ na ba ki didik, abɛ shar te duŋ gliu te nyɛ Urshelima, ne ka kpa nyak tǝ bɛ ŋunu. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Akyak Festas mtanyeme te di, &lt;&lt;Bulus a klikli ku ne Kaseriya, Ngama ne yine susun kɛ gar amɔ ne miŋ kɛ bɛr yiŋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Ne na di, abɛ duŋ zhiin nuŋ ne min mǝne abɛ zǝ wa, ate yi ndi ner waŋa ne lalɛ, abɛ lɛk ambuk go.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Ne te iber tender ka bɛr wur ben abɛ ba, fe akɔmɔ ne Kaseriya ne, ne iber yi zǝ ne lɛ ben ane te ambuk go te abɛ Gli Bulus te gar ben wa. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Ndi ne nyɛ, Yahudawa abaŋ ndi ne rɛ Urshelima alu kli adidik te klɛku, te Gli ambuk tetɛk agli nyɛmɛ ne atu maa, ayiŋ ndi aba kiki men ba ne tanyɛme ne yi ba.<verse eid="ACT 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Akyak Bulus ne Gli lɛ maa nyɛmɛ tedi: &lt;&lt;Nga bam ne lalɛ kinuŋ ne atu yi ambuk ne Yahudawa ba kɔ akabaŋkɔŋ, kɔ ne atu yi kaisar ba, kɔ watsɔb.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Festas awɔb ta Yahudawa ma, tedi abɛ Gli ambuk go te nyɛm bǝn abɔu, adi Bulus tedi, &lt;&lt;Une tanyɛmɛ te ta bɛ kɔmɔ te te ambuk go ne Urshelima ne atu ayi kiki yuŋɔ bǝn abɛm yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Akyak Bulus adi: &lt;&lt;Me klikli ne min jaru ne te ambuk ayi kaisar, ne akpa waŋ ndi ne re te abɛ tem ambuk bam ne la ane Yahudawa ilɛ ba iwa ne tu mi une zhim. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Te ayi udi me ne lalɛ, te me ne na kiyiŋ ndi ne mla a bɛ ŋun me, bam tei nklu ku ba, ate yi ndi ba zhin yik ire te abɛ te ambuk amuŋ ne ankɔŋ adidik ba, ba waŋ ndi a te ŋun me te susun min bǝ sik, me wɔb te abɛ Gli ambuk go te kɔmɔ ne ti kɛ kaisar!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Ndi Festas ne sɔŋ ben abɛ na ndum ma, fe a tanyɛ te di: &lt;&lt;Une wɔb te bɛ Gli ambuk ne atu mi te kɔmɔ ne ti kɛ kaisar! Atei kɔmɔ ben kaisara!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Festas ne lɛ ben Agaribas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Ndi iber watsɔb ne gayir Itum Agabus ben Barniki, ne nyɛ Kaseriya te ba abɛ nyɛ tek Festas. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Ndi ne te muɔ bɛr tetɛk amɔ, fe Festas ne bla Itum lɛ kɛ Bulus te di: &lt;&lt;Iner nuŋ ndi Filikus ne duŋu a klikli ku. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Waŋ ndi me ne yi ne Urshelima abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik angɔŋgɔŋ bǝn angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ Yahudawa ne gli ambuk te nyɛ bǝn abɛm te ben me te di me kpau.<verse eid="ACT 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Nga mǝne tanyɛ bama te di, ba yi ndum kɛ Romawa ba abɛ kpa nuŋ te bɛ duŋ susun kɛ nuŋ sik ba, ndi ba ne zi ba aŋyak ben iwaŋ ndi ne agli ambuk te nyɛ ne atu maa ba, te bɛ bla ki yiŋ ndi ne zhi te ta tu maa azhɔk. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Ndi ne nyɛ, ba me ne baŋ kpaŋ ba, mǝne zi sɔŋ ne mben yi te ambuk ndi bɛr ŋan mǝne di abɛ Gli neshire agli anyɛ me. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Ndi abɛ Gli ambuk ne nyɛmɛ nɛ lu kli bane bla kinuŋ mimin na tu maa ba ir keŋ ndi mǝne nyak susun ba. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Ne nak abla lǝlɛ nuŋ yiŋ ndi yi nkɔŋ kɛ zǝ Arik men, ben nuŋ waŋ adi ayi Yesɔ waŋ ndi ne ku, akyak Bulus adi ayime tsitsir. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Nga bam ne yik ankɔŋ ne zib iki me ba, fe me rib Bulus tedi ka utǝ tanyɛme te zin kɔmɔ ne Urshelima te abɛ kɔ te teu ambuk amɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Akyak Bulus ne di abɛ duŋ ilɛmɛ baliŋ te Augustas abɛ tɔ kɛ ne liŋ, fe me ndi abɛ kama kɔte ku baliŋ te bɛ shar ben kaisar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Fe Agaribas ne di Festas, &lt;&lt;Nga ma mǝne wɔb te me wɔ ner waŋa ne tu muŋ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Festas adi, &lt;&lt;Utei yigu amblɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Ndi bɛr ne ŋan fe Agaribas bǝn Barniki anyɛ te gar ate yir ibur bǝn angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ te kum bǝn a angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ ntun, fe agli Bulus te yir ne lɛ kɛ Festas. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Fe Festas adi, &lt;&lt;Itum Agaribas, ben aneshir ndi ayi ben abɛta, tɔ zhin neshire waŋ ndi aneshir abɛ Yahudawa ne Gli ambuk amaa are Urshelima, te zin ŋur ruru, te di ba rɛ te abɛ duŋu tsitsir ba. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Nga ba me ne yik kiyiŋ ndi ne mla abɛ ŋunu ba. Ndi iwa ne tu maa ne wɔb te abɛ Gli ambuk amaa te kɔmɔ ben Augustas, me ne tanyɛme me te gliu te gar ben abɔu. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Ama bam yi ne lɛ keŋ ndi me tei cɛr Arik amuŋ ne tu maa ba. Ayi duŋ mǝne gliu te nyɛ ti min, ne timi Itum Agaribas, ate zib ilɛmɛ ndi me tei cɛr. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Ne yik muŋ, ayi shum ki, bane rɛ a bɛ kpa neshir waŋ ndi ba ne lalɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Fe Agaribas adi Bulus, &lt;&lt;Ne nǝgu mkpaŋ kɛ lɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:1">Akyak Bulus anab ŋɔk te vuŋ lɛ te di: <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />&lt;&lt;Itum Agaribas! M ne yik pur ne ti mi te bɛ ta tu muŋ zhɔk ne lǝlɛ yiŋ ndi Yahudawa avuŋ me gli ne lalɛ, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Ne me une zhi kiki yiŋ ndi Yahudawa anayi ben lǝlɛ mǝne. Neme me benu bɛ shur kpa te wɔm zǝǝ.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />&lt;&lt;Ane Yahudawa bɔbɔk ne zhi isɔŋ muŋ nak rɛ nzak muŋ, nak men ku ti, ne min kɛ aneshire mɔr ben Urshelima ne kam nyak aliŋe. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Ne zhi men rɛ kukub, ate yiŋ ndi atei zi goŋ te di Me yi Bafarisi ndi ayi sak iyah ne min kɛ ankɔŋ ne ben Arik amɔr. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Mǝne nyak susun te me yik shak ki yiŋ ndi Arik ne bla atsintsim mɔr ane yi ayi me ŋubǝ ne kpaŋ kǝ te ambuk abɛ yime. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Waŋa ayi kpa nyak ndi ne yi akɔb a wur ane yaa abaŋ ndi ne nek tu ne zǝ Arik ibu ben aririk te zin zhɔk susun ka iku ne lɛ shaga, ne zhɔk susun yiŋɛ Yahudawa a zin blai, Itum. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Iyi kikin te zhin di Arik alǝk aner bɛ ku te kyak ta zhin nyɛmɛ?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />&lt;&lt;Nga ne tu muŋ, me yik tedi ne rɛ te me yik kiki tetɛk, ne ti yiŋ ndi akyak sak kɛ Yesɔ Banazara. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Me ne na me ne Urshelima, ne men azhɔk abɛ zǝ Arik anuŋ ne jaru aŋɔk yi angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ na ndum Arik. Mǝne vu aneshir tetɛk nku ne jaru, ne kpa anuŋ ŋlɔk ne tanyɛme muŋ. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Mne sak ba iyah tetɛk ne akabaŋkɔŋ amen, mǝna wɔb ba ne ankɔŋ ne lalɛ, ir keŋ ndi me te mfu ngɔŋ bǝn abɛba mǝne zǝ ba azaza izǝ yi a goŋɔ tuk, te zǝn sak ba ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />Itum Agaribas iber nuŋ yeme, me tsin kɔmɔ ne Damaskɔ abɛ na ndum Arik angɔŋgɔŋ ne nǝm anu tena shar men. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Nɛ aririk kpakpas me ne vuŋ ankɔŋ, Itum Mne yik laŋ ne ire shu, ne naŋ laŋ yi aririk, ne hrie kam mǝ zǝk bǝn akpǝkpa abǝ tsǝne muŋɔ. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Ndi ta ne hrie ne mimi, mǝne wɔ kɔr nuŋ ndi kɛ Yahudawai idi, &lt;Shaulu, Shaulu, ayi ni duŋu sak me yai? Bai iyah ka ubǝ zin te zor bene bɛm.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Ankyak me rib tedi, &lt;&lt;Uyi ŋɔwa Arik?&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:15">Fe Arik adi, &lt;&lt;Ayi Nga Yesɔ ndi uzǝn sak me yaa maa. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Ama lu kli adidik, mǝne tsa ru tu muŋ te bɛ yi ne bla lɛ muŋ ne kiki yiŋ ndi une yik ne yi mi ne tu muŋ, me tei blau kiki nuŋ ne ti. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Mne ntau nzhɔk ne aŋɔk aye aner ami ben Yahudawa. Mna sharu bene beba <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Te ubɛ bu ba ayi, te abɛ duŋ bu te kam aŋyak laŋ, te duŋ zǝ shetan te kam zǝ Arik, te bɛ yis ba zumimin men, te abɛ li gadu ben abɛ yi tsetser, te ne tanyɛme bene bɛm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />Amɛ Itum Agaribas bam ne kyak blau ki yiŋ ndi mǝne yigǝ ire shu ba. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Ne ku ti mǝne bla aneshir abɛ Damaskɔ lɛ kɛ Arik, te na bla Urshelima ben tuntun yi Yahudiya, te na bla abaŋ ndi bai Yahudawa ba, tedi abɛ duŋ na kimimin te kama zǝ Arik, te na ndum kɛŋ ndi te tsar duŋ na zumimin mǝne. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Yiŋe ne duŋ Yahudawa ne vuŋ me ne min akabaŋkɔŋ te wɔb te aba bɛ ŋun me. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Ndi mǝne yik sak ŋɔk yi Arik, nga waŋ har a zǝzaŋ me zin bla angɔŋgɔŋ ben amumun, bam bla kinuŋ ba anak iki yiŋ ndi abɛ bla ishar yi Arik ben Musa ne di ite na <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />tedi iyi anenen Almasihu abɛ yik iyah, ayi wa atei ku te na kuti lu ne bɛ, te bla aneshir laŋ yiŋɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Bulus ayi ne min kɛ lɛ, akyak Festas atsaŋu te lɛk kɔr te di, &lt;&lt;Bulus uyi kpukpur, izhi mi iduŋ dar vuŋu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Bulus adi bam landar ba, ineshir ngɔŋ Festas, bam yi kpukpur ba, me lɛ didik ne min kɛ sik susun. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Itum Agaribas, une zhi lɛ kǝŋɛ bɔbɔk, me na lɛ ben abɔu ne susun zhin, mǝne zhi ba ki yiŋ ndi ne naŋ Itum dɔ ne kiki yiŋɛ bɔbɔk, ba kiyiŋ ndi ne suyir ba. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Itum une tanyɛme ben abɛ bla ishar yi Arik yi? Mǝne zhi une tanyɛme.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Fe Itum Agaribas akɔ di Bulus, &lt;&lt;Fe ne ivǝ mkpaŋ kǝŋe uwɔb te ubɛ kam duŋ me yi krista?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Bulus a di, &lt;&lt;Ne ivǝ kpaŋ kǝŋe kinuŋ te ya na ngɔŋ, me ben Arik, ba wa kiki mi ba, te vuŋ baŋ ndi azǝn wɔm aliŋe, abɛ yik keŋ ndi iyime, bam tanyɛmɛ te abɛ yir jaru ndi nga ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Fe Itum alu kli a didik, ben abaŋ ndi akɔ sɔŋ ben abɔu. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Ndi ne bin atu men amkpa azhiin te kpa anu te di. &lt;&lt;Ineshir waŋa bane na kinuŋ ndi ate kpau te ŋunu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Agaribas ne di Festas tedi, &lt;&lt;Abɛ di ba Bulus ne Gli lɛ ma te kɔmɔ ben kaisar ba ta abɛ zu gu azhɔk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ne gar Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Ndi tane lɛ biŋ ta tei zǝ Gu te gar Italiya, Bulus bene abɛ kur ne jaru anuŋ ne bǝn iner ngɔŋ nuŋ ne tyak kum ndi a zhɔu te Yuliyas, abɛ biŋ atu kɛ Augustas. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Tane vuŋ gu rɛ Adaramitiya, keŋ di te lu te gar igbu nuŋ ne gar kɛ Asiya, ta ne yir nek ngɔŋ te vuŋ tsin. Aristakus, awɔ ne Tasolɔnika ne gar kɛ Makidɔniya, ne bǝn bɛ ta.<verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Ne bǝn yi yaa tane yir sidon, Yuliyas ne na Bulus ki didik, te duŋu agar ben akpa amaa te bɛ lɔk Bulus te nǝgu iki wɔb maa. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Ne muɔ tane na yir nek ngɔŋ te ne zi gɔŋ kɛ Kuburus ndi ŋguŋgu ne tǝ goŋ. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Ndi tane glɔ gar kɛ ntun yi Kilikiya bene kɛ Bamfiliya, ta ne yir Mira ndi ayi ntun ŋɔk yi Likiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Ne muɔ ngɔŋ ne tyak kum ne yik Gu kɛ Iskandariya ndi gar Italiya te shur ta ne Gu mɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Tane tsin bwebwee bɛr tetɛk tane te na yik iyah te shi yir Kinidas. Ndi nguŋgu bane duŋ ta tsin ba, ta ne kam zi ŋɔk kɛ Karita gbahir ne salmɔni. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Ta ne zi kɔnsa kɛ nek ne ŋɔk mla te yik iyah ne tsin teshe yir amkpa nuŋ ndi azhɔu te amkpa ne sɔŋ sik, gbahir ne ntun ngɔŋ yi Lasiya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Tane klɛ kpaŋ tetɛk, itsin mɔrɔ ikɛ yik iyah ndi bǝn yi kpa anu neka gar gayir. Ankyak Bulus ne gbaŋ aneshir abɛ yine gumɔ atɔŋ te di, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />&lt;&lt;Aneshir abaŋa, me ne yik tsin kǝŋe yi kɛ iyah te duŋ kiki cɔkla tetɛk, ba kiki bǝn Gu akyak ba, te vuŋ asusun mɔr.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Ankyak ngɔŋ ne tyak kum, ne wɔ kiyiŋ ndi Bulus adi, tabǝ zi lɛ keŋ ndi ne den Gu bene akiki ne Gu abla ne duŋ iyiŋɛ ibǝ rɛ te Gu bɛ gbur kli ne kpaŋ tetɛk ba ne kɔnsa ba, Aner tetɛk adi ta bɛ vuŋ tsin, ne zhɔk susun ta te yir Finikiya ne amkpa ne sɔŋ sik ne karita, atɔ gar kɛ anzaŋ ne gar kɛ ŋɔk li bǝn gar kɛ amgbalu kɛ ŋɔk mla. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Ndi ngugumɔ iyar ta tsin, aneshir tetɛk adi ta bɛ nak vuŋ tsin te gar fonoki te gburkli amɔ. Ntuno iyi ne gar kɛ amblimblɛ ben amgbalu.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguŋgu yi nǝk ngɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Ndi ŋguŋgu ne fuk watsɔb te rɛ gar kɛ amgbalu, tane yik mkpaŋ kɛ tsin: Fe ne zuk gu mɔ te zi gar Karita gbahir ne ŋɔk abɛm. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Bane tsin gar gbagbaŋ ba, ŋguŋgu ngɔŋ ne fuk rɛ ŋɔk nek. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Ŋguŋgu ne fuk te yar Gumɔ tsin anenen, ta duŋ kɛ zi ŋguŋgu mɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Ndi tane zi kɔnsa te yik ya teshe yir kauda, tane na yik iyah te shi vuŋ gu vǝtsɔb. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Ndi aneshir ne vuŋ igu vǝtsɔb ne min kɛ ngɔŋ abiŋ. Ne te sisik te kpa gumɔ te kǝr bǝ tyak ba hrie ne ablubluk ayi Libiya, ndi a mli kɔte ni, ne zuk gumɔ te duŋ kɛ tsǝntsem ma. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Tane sɔŋ te duŋ nguŋgu zǝn fuk ta ndi bɛr ne ŋan aneshir avu kiki yiŋ ndi igu ne vui atuk atyak ahrie. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Ne bɛr yi tar, ne tyak ki yi duŋ gumɔ luk atyak hrie ne ŋɔk amen. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Ndi ba ne yik arik bǝn cinces ne ru kli ba ne bɛr tetɛk ŋguŋgu mɔ bane duŋ tǝ mɛ ba. Tane di ne susun mɔr tedi bɔbɔk mɔrɔ inuŋ ba te lii ru ba.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Ndi aneshir ne kpa anu bane li kili ba, Bulus alu akli ne atsutsu amen te di ba: &lt;&lt;Aneshir, abɛ di izhin ne wɔ lɛ muŋ ba zhin bɛ lu te duŋ karita ba; ba zhin bɛ yir ya yiŋɛ ba. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Ne azizaŋ me blaa zhin kɔte ŋɔwa bɛ zhɔk susun ma, Ba nuŋ ne min mɔr ndi ate ku. gumɔ kɛ akyak te cɔkla. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Ne bu yi laŋ ne shar ayou Arik ndi me ye amaa waŋ ndi me zǝu ne ru kli bene bɛm <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />te di, &lt;Bulus duŋ te sisik ba utǝ kli ne ti kɛ kaisar Itum ne Roma; Ne tu mi Arik ne lɔ susun aner abaŋ ndi izhin tsin bene abɛba inuŋ ba te ku ba.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Amɛ Gli klik susun min, aneshir, me ne tanyɛmɛ ne Arik te itei yi amɛ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ ne Arik ite yi ndi ne blama. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Ne me, ta klu te ŋɔr ne ŋɔk abɛm kɛ amashir.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gu tsik ŋar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Ne bu yi wur ne nas ta tsin te gar nek ne Adariya, Ne tsutsu bu ne duŋ gumɔ ne yik te tane yir gbahir ne goŋ abɛm. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Ne baŋ ki tsar amashir te tsar amashire te yik kli min kɛ amashir teyi aza sɔk wur ane yaa ne sɔk yaa. Ne mkpaŋ watsɔb ne na tsara tɔ te yik kli min kɛ amashire yi aza sɔk teres. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Abɛ den gumɔ ne te sisik te yik tedi ta te ŋɔr ne kpaŋ, fe azuk igu mɔtsɔtsɔb me nas shur ne tiŋ gumɔ te ben Arik gar ŋan bɛr. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Ne te te ba bɛ ru ne min gumɔ, abɛ den gumɔ a zuk igu vǝtsɔb zhɔk ne Nek, te yik ndi aba te duŋ gumɔ ba tei na luk ba. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Fe Bulus adi ngɔŋ ne tyak kum bene anki abɛ tyak kumɔ, &lt;&lt;Sei abɛ den gu abaŋ ne sɔŋ ne gumɔ mba mɛ ba ba zhin tei li ru ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Fe abɛ tyak kum a yak riri keŋ ndi Gli vǝvǝn gumɔ kluk te duŋ kɛ kɔmɔ.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Ndi bɛr ne ŋan Bulus adi ba bɛ li kili. &lt;&lt;Ne bɛr wur ne nas,&gt;&gt; Adi, izhin bane zhɔk susun ba ta ne tsin yaŋ ila izhin bane li kinuŋ ba. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Bulus adi azizaŋ mbla zhin izhin bɛ li kili. Te zhin bɛ yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ. Ba nuŋ ne miŋ min mfumfuk tu maa te kyaŋ ba. <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Ndi ne bla me, ne baŋ mplipla la te nyer Arik ne ti men bɔbɔk. Fe amlik kɛ te li. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Bɔbɔk men ne zhɔk susun te li kili ne kpa men. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Bɔbɔk mɔr te yi aneshir ankplik aya ne sɔk taŋgba ne tani (276) ne gumɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Ndi kɔte ŋɔwa ne lii hri ne vuu kiki nuŋ ben kpu atyak ahrie ne mashir ne nek ngɔŋ.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Ndi bɛr ne ŋan, bane zhi amkpa waŋ ndi aba yime ba, ne yik ablubluk ne goŋ abɛm, ne lɛ te tanyɛme aba te tur gumɔ te gar ablubluk. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Ne zuk gu mɔtsɔtsɔb a shur ne mashir, te rik ririk keŋ ndi a Gli ki kam gumɔ, fe te lɛk ti gumɔ gar amkpa waŋ ndi ŋguŋgu tǝ te gar goŋ abɛm. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Ankyak gumɔ ne tar ne blubluk te fir yir mimi. Fe iki duŋ gu tsǝne ifuk andanda te duŋ gumɔ gburkli.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Abɛ tyak kum ate te te ba abɛ ŋlɔk aner abaŋ ndi ne ku ba te kǝr inuŋ abɛ tuk akyaŋ aku tɛ dɛn te ru adɔ ba. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Neme ngɔŋ ne abɛ tyak kumɔ ne te tǝ wa abɛ ta Bulus azhɔk te yar ba nena kiyiŋ ndi ne di aba atei nai ma. Ne di waŋ ndi ate den ayir abɛ tuk akyaŋ aku te den ru. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Anki aneshir bɛ ayuŋ mplɛ kuŋkun te ru kɔ abɛ zǝ mgbalak gu nuŋ te ru. Neme bɔbɔk mǝne ne ru keke.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ne ankɔŋ ne nek Malita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Ndi tane ka lieru ne kɔtɔŋ keŋ ndi azho kɛ te Malita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Abɛ sɔŋɔ amɔ ne naa ta ki didik iyaŋ ŋursuk. Ne mɔ klu tena ta ta bɔbɔk ndi alu azǝn ku mvlu na te. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Bulus ne biŋ ankaki, ndi atei shurǝ ne lu, iwah yi tus, nguŋgu lu vuŋǝ, ikɔte nyɛn ŋɔk kɛ Bulus te fau. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Ankyak ndi abɛ sɔŋ ne amkpama ayik iwama ne nyɛnu ne ŋɔk, akɔdi akpa mɛn, &lt;&lt;Ineshir waŋa atei yi ne ŋlɔk aneshir; kɔ ndi ne na yaru ne nek ngɔŋ, iyaŋ na lɛ didik iduŋu bai lieru ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Fe Bulus ne mes iwama azhɔk ne lu bane wɔ kinuŋ ne kpa maa ba. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Aneshir a shurɔ yi te aba abɛ yik amkpa maa ne wu tɛ tuno zhaku, fe ndi ne dǝk te zen shurɔ yi bane yik kinuŋ ne nau ba, akama sen asusun men tedi ayi Arik.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Ne mwɔ, waŋa ayi nuŋ waŋ ndi azhɔu te Babiliyus, ngɔŋ ne amkpama. Ne ta ta ne kɔmaa iber mai tar te naa ta didik. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Tetɛɛ maa ikpa ne ŋuru vuŋ te akɔkur, azǝn yik iyah nǝ lɔ lamuka te bene ja. Bulus ne yir te yigu te nau tǝ nɛ rɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Fe ndi ne yi amɛ, nki abɛ lɔ kpa ne ntuno anyɛ ne naa ba te ne rɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Ne nǝk ta ngɔŋ ne nkuŋkɔŋ tetɛk fe ta neka tei lu, ne nǝk ta kiki tetɛk iyi wɔb mɔr.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne yir Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Ndi ihwa tar ne gayir, tane lu ne malita te zǝ gu kɛ Alikzandariya ndi ne nakǝ te sub izhu atagwe arik amɛ yaa kastɔ bǝn Pullus. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Tane klɛ ne Sirakus iber tar amɔ. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Tane na lu amɔ te yir ntun yi Rigiyum. Nǝ ŋen bɛr, nguŋgu yi amgbalu ne tei fe bɛr te ŋan ta yir Futiyoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Amɔ tane yik abɛ zi Arik ne di tabǝ te sati zhin bene ba. Ndi amɛ tane kɔmɔ ne Roma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Amunya amɔ ne wɔ ŋyɛ mɔrɔ, tǝ nɛ vuŋ tsǝn ibaŋ rɛ Afiyus, bene amkpa ne sɔŋ sik anuŋ awaŋa ndi azhɔu te abene sɔŋ sik atar tǝ bɛ mla bǝn ta amɔ. Ndi ne yik anere Bulus ne nyere Arik tena ŋuro klik. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Ndi tane yir Roma, ne duŋ Bulus a sɔŋ kiki maa, ben ne kpaakpa waŋ ndi atei blɛu.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ne bla lɛ kɛ Arik ne Roma ndi azǝn ŋubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Ndi iber tar ne gayir, ne zhɔ aner abiŋ amɔ aŋgɔŋ anuŋ abɛ Yahudawa. Ndi ne biŋ, Bulus adi ba: &lt;&lt;Amunyamɔr, mne zhi bam nǝ naa aneshir amɔr ikinuŋ yi cɔk susun la ba kɔ kam ŋglak lɛ kɛ ŋyak atsintsime mɔr, ne vuŋ me ne Urushelima te baŋ mǝ a nǝk Romawa. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Ne rib me te di abɛba, te bam ni lalɛ nuŋ kɛ mla ku ba. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Fe Yahudawa akyak ilɛmɛ, Ankyak mne baŋ ilɛmɛ te gar ben kaisar. Bai nyer muŋ ba tem baŋa aner amuŋ te bɛ yaa ilalɛ nuŋ. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Ndi yeme, mne wɔb tem yik zhin te lɛ bene abɛ zhin. Ayi ndi ijɔk susun kɛ Isrela iyi ne kpam ne atabɛrbɛr.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Akɔ sagu ma, &lt;&lt;Ba tane ta icɛr mplɛ nuŋ rɛ Yahuda ne atu amin ba, ba nuŋ ne min kɛ anere mɔrɔ waŋ ndi ne rɛm wɔ te bla lɛ mimin ne tu mi. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Fe tane di tab wɔb te ta bɛ wɔ iki yiŋ ndi utǝ blai, te tane zhi te neshir kɔte me bane tanyɛmɛ ne zǝ Arik yayas yiŋɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Ne kpa nyak ndi atei yik Bulus bɛr nuŋ, te nyɛ ne du ne abɛ ne sɔŋɔ maa. Ne bla ba ilɛmɛ ibaŋ rɛ amblimblɛ mla nǝ ku arik, abla lɛ kɛ kɔb Arik, te baŋ rɛ nkanlɛ yi Musa, bǝn abɛ na ndum Arik tǝ wa abɛ baŋ asusun mǝne tɔ gar nǝ lɛ kɛ Yesɔ. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Anuŋ ne tanyɛme nǝ lɛ kɛ bla maa, anuŋ ne kyak. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Ne gaaŋa ne akpa mɛn te ŋar azhizhin ndi Bulus ne lǝlɛ kɛ klɛ maa: Izhu tsetser ne bla lɛ atsintsim amɔr ilɛ didik ndi ne di nenu akɛ Ishaya ne nau ndum maa:<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />&lt;&lt;&lt;Gar ben aneshir abaŋa te di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">&lt;&lt;Izhin tei wɔ ba zhin tei zhi ba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">Izhin tei tɔ ba zhin tei yik ba.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Tǝ asusun aner abaŋa neka kama yi ashishir;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Itei lɔ ba wɔ ne tɔŋɔ men,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Nena ku ayi men.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Mba amɛ ba atei yik ne ayi amen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Tena wɔ ne atɔŋ amen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Tena zhi ne asusun amen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Tena kam aŋyak bene bɛm, fe nga M tei zuk ba shur.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />&lt;&lt;Fe ngam wɔb te izhin bǝ zhi te ta zhɔk ye Arik ne sharu bene abaŋ ndi bai Yahudawa ba, atei wɔ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Ndi Bulus ne bla amɛ, fe Yahudawa akɔ lu te te antam ne akpa.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Nǝ min kɛ ase yaa anenen Bulus ne sɔŋ ne kɔb keŋ ndi ne nyagu tǝ ta anere abaŋ ndi ne nyɛ bene bɔu. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Te zen bla lɛ kɛ kɔb ngɔŋ kɛ Arik, bǝn tsar ne atu yi Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ kristi iyaŋ klu sǝsǝk, ba nuŋ ne yaru ba.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>